ps://github.com/cheonghakim/topo-space/commit/41198e9dab55823b89446418bee29951d5fcf03c","sha":"41198e9dab55823b89446418bee29951d5fcf03c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheonghakim/topo-space/commits/41198e9dab55823b89446418bee29951d5fcf03c"}],"sha":"db9f789360af964a0421d284a92c30e1e0144d4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheonghakim/topo-space/commits/db9f789360af964a0421d284a92c30e1e0144d4f"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheonghakim/topo-space/commits/41198e9dab55823b89446418bee29951d5fcf03c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T04:30:00Z","email":"cheongha.kim@cyberone.kr","name":"cheongha.kim"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T06:43:08Z","email":"cheongha.kim@cyberone.kr","name":"cheongha.kim"},"message":"perf: scale link and label rendering toward 10k+ devices/links\n\n- Track a linksRevision counter so in-place link edits (status,\n  midX/midZ, type) sync to the renderer, not just add/remove changing\n  the link count\n- Index links by device and device-pair so drags/position refreshes\n  and parallel-edge spreading touch only the affected links instead of\n  walking every link in the scene\n- Auto-spread parallel links between the same device pair instead of\n  rendering them as one overlapping line\n- Skip per-frame animation work for static (non-dashed, non-down)\n  links instead of touching every link''s material every frame\n- Cap status badges by severity so a mass incident (thousands of\n  devices going warning/critical) doesn''t spawn unbounded DOM nodes\n- Track alert device ids incrementally instead of rescanning every\n  device each frame for the warning/critical pulse\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eb5a5367acc1d9bf109b1ddfd32cacf58efe1b8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheonghakim/topo-space/git/trees/eb5a5367acc1d9bf109b1ddfd32cacf58efe1b8d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cheonghakim/topo-space/git/commits/41198e9dab55823b894