tter","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trossitter/cadence/commits/87f1792e45491e16afd446e6a415d62be889968d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T05:04:25Z","email":"44932088+trossitter@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Thalia Rossitter"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-01T05:04:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(host-smoke): key on semantic landmarks, not styling classes (#3)\n\nThe \"host harness chrome CSS → Tailwind\" conversion removed the\n.host-bar / .host-stage classes, but the smoke test still waited on\nthem, so it failed despite the host rendering correctly. Locate the\nshell by its banner/main landmark roles, which survive restyling.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"14def2bc5166e6f15ec3a0c2a3fc6680d03c8447","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trossitter/cadence/git/trees/14def2bc5166e6f15ec3a0c2a3fc6680d03c8447"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trossitter/cadence/git/commits/87f1792e45491e16afd446e6a415d62be889968d","verification":{"payload":"tree 14def2bc5166e6f15ec3a0c2a3fc6680d03c8447\nparent 97b7c96ae2313392b8865ec4283afda87ad13230\nparent ee776783558fb487fd8c357c8bc3928ca2e727f9\nauthor Thalia Rossitter <44932088+trossitter@users.noreply.github.com> 1780290265 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780290265 -0500\n\nfix(host-smoke): key on semantic landmarks, not styling classes (#3)\n\nThe \"host harness chrome CSS → Tailwind\" conversion removed the\n.host-bar / .host-stage classes, but the smoke test still waited on\nthem, so it failed despite the host rendering correctly. Locate the\nshell by its banner/main landmark roles, which survive restyling.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqHRLZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAS5wQAG7L+pJKQv4iHIZBE4G+K9Ug\nlghBlwYTWnZcO20OBmqxOJaxU4gHTmod282ggjArDeHOxGeIlAfJ50u96jpjNcxD\n