email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Scaffold module federation micro-frontend monorepo\n\nSet up a pnpm workspace + Turborepo monorepo where a host shell composes\nthree independently deployable products at runtime via Module Federation.\n\n- apps/host: shell (:3000) that runtime-loads product a/b/c remotes, with\n  per-remote ErrorBoundary + Suspense isolation (RemoteSlot)\n- apps/product-a|b|c: Vite + React remotes (:3001-3003) exposing ./App,\n  also runnable standalone\n- packages/ui: shared design system (@mf/ui) consumed by host and remotes\n- react/react-dom shared as singletons to avoid duplicate/hook conflicts\n- Vite 8 + React 19 + @module-federation/vite; dts worker disabled in favor\n  of hand-written remote type contracts (apps/host/src/remotes.d.ts)\n\nVerified: pnpm typecheck/build pass; host + all remoteEntry.js serve 200 in\nboth dev and preview.","tree":{"sha":"400a6ff49a7dd87f3efaf23677d60ef8d10b7425","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhmkchs/module-federation-monorepo/git/trees/400a6ff49a7dd87f3efaf23677d60ef8d10b7425"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhmkchs/module-federation-monorepo/git/commits/9dbf71d3987e38a6ee52503e912357e8b5add67e","verification":{"payload":"tree 400a6ff49a7dd87f3efaf23677d60ef8d10b7425\nparent 95baeabc2c68a0cc3c80ca2f309393f9421c2cd0\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780186305 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780186305 +0000\n\nScaffold module federation micro-frontend monorepo\n\nSet up a pnpm workspace + Turborepo monorepo where a host shell composes\nthree independently deployable products at runtime via Module Federation.\n\n- apps/host: shell (:3000) that runtime-loads product a/b/c remotes, with\n  per-remote ErrorBoundary + Suspense isolation (RemoteSlot)\n- apps/product-a|b|c: Vite + React remotes (:3001-3003) exposing ./App,\n  also runnable standalone\n- packages/ui: shared design system (@mf/ui) consumed by host and remotes\n- react/react-dom shared as singletons to avoid duplicate/hook conflicts\n- Vite 8 + React 19 + @module-federation/vite; dts worker disabled in favor\n  of hand-written remote type contracts (apps/host/src/remotes.d.ts)\n\nVerified: pnpm typecheck/build pass; host + all remoteEntry.js serve 200 in\nboth dev and preview.\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQEzIDPuI\ncMyEtCrWYODwiZ5bjvv/delW5ToccKZ1GDby6NzLaQ0Pb/u5VOdOxQtp3WA23OQCitYx3/0L2r+k\nQAU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-31T00:11:50Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/dhmkchs/module-federation-monorepo/commit/9dbf71d3987e38a6ee52503e912357e8b5add67e","node_id":"C_kwDOSq_M-9oAKDlkYmY3MWQzOTg3ZTM4YTZlZTUyNTAzZTkxMjM1N2U4YjVhZGQ2N2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/dhmkchs/module-federation-monorepo/commit/95baeabc2c68a0cc3c80ca2f309393f9421c2cd0","sha":"95baeabc2c68a0cc3c80ca2f309393f9421c2cd0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/dhmkc