ghtlysoftware.com","name":"GAUTAM JHA"},"message":"feat: initial hc-nextjs-mfe-adapter — Vue+Vite federation adapter for Next.js MFEs\n\nReusable template that bridges Next.js apps into the brightly-app-fe\nVue 3 shell via @originjs/vite-plugin-federation without requiring\nnative Next.js Module Federation support.\n\nArchitecture:\n- Exposes ./remoteConfig matching the shell''s Vue federation contract\n- Bundles the Next.js project''s React source via @vitejs/plugin-react\n- Reads source from a sibling Next.js project via VITE_NEXTJS_PROJECT_PATH\n- Aliases @/lib/router-adapter → router-adapter.mfe.ts (MFE context shim)\n- Mounts React tree via createRoot inside NextjsAppView.vue (no script tags)\n\nConfiguration (VITE_* env vars):\n- VITE_NEXTJS_PROJECT_PATH: path to the Next.js project web/ directory\n- VITE_NEXTJS_API_BASE_URL: base URL for API calls (fetch interceptor target)\n- VITE_BASE_PATH: shell route prefix (default /accounting-valuation)\n- VITE_REMOTE_NAME: federation remote name (default remoteAV)\n- VITE_ADAPTER_BASE_URL: absolute URL for asset chunk cross-origin loading\n\nFirst consumer: operation-phantom (Accounting & Valuation Next.js app)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6bbc475b3e7810fa486e9fa5b37a456693cc88f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gautam-jha/hc-nextjs-mfe-adapter/git/trees/6bbc475b3e7810fa486e9fa5b37a456693cc88f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gautam-jha/hc-nextjs-mfe-adapter/git/commits/5eeb9ac725e26ea1908b63ed487d5359f119f49d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16630278?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gautam-jha/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gautam-jha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gautam-jha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gautam-jh