aipro23/frontend-app-learning/commit/13eea81fe725bc9dc48bf3fb56be80c8ab83c938","sha":"13eea81fe725bc9dc48bf3fb56be80c8ab83c938","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thaipro23/frontend-app-learning/commits/13eea81fe725bc9dc48bf3fb56be80c8ab83c938"}],"sha":"0bd9483cdb967bbd8820b1901097ba4c6a99cf8d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thaipro23/frontend-app-learning/commits/0bd9483cdb967bbd8820b1901097ba4c6a99cf8d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/112954497?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brian-smith-tcril","id":112954497,"login":"brian-smith-tcril","node_id":"U_kgDOBruMgQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-smith-tcril","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thaipro23/frontend-app-learning/commits/13eea81fe725bc9dc48bf3fb56be80c8ab83c938/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-13T22:29:07Z","email":"112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Brian Smith"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-13T22:29:07Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): regenerate package-lock.json (#1855)\n\n* fix(deps): regenerate package-lock.json\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(deps): regenerate package-lock.json\n\nMoved @openedx/frontend-build from dependencies to devDependencies.\nRemoved direct jest devDependency which was causing ts-jest hoisting issues.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(tests): use require() for MockedPluginSlot in jest.mock\n\nJest hoists jest.mock() calls to the top of the file, which caused\nMockedPluginSlot to be undefined when the mock factory executed.\nUsing require() inside the factory ensures it loads at runtime.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(types): handle nullable breakpoint types\n\nParagon''s breakpoint types now have optional minWidth/maxWidth properties.\nAdded non-null assertions since these values are always defined in practice.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(tests): add IntlProvider to ContentIFrame tests\n\nParagon''s ModalDialog now uses useIntl() (openedx/paragon#3624),\nrequiring an IntlProvider in the component ancestry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(tests): await async operations in Course tests\n\nFixed dangling waitFor blocks that weren''t awaited, causing tests\nto not actually wait for async operations. Changed to properly use\nawait with screen.findBy*() queries.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(tests): use dynamic imports in LearnerToolsSlot tests\n\nJest hoists mock calls but ES imports run before the test body.\nUsing dynamic imports in beforeEach ensures mocks are set up\nbefore modules are loaded.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"db97bef51c585a0f231c607d460c38fd0074e61a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thaipro23/frontend-app-learning/git/trees/db97bef51c585a0f231c607d460c38fd0074e61a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thaipro23/frontend-app-learning/git/commits/13eea81fe725bc9dc48bf3fb56be80c8ab83c938","verification":{"payload":"tree db97bef51c585a0f231c607d460c38fd0074e61a\nparent 1d0ab113e72d241a03069777c682a4119be49178\nauthor Brian Smith <112954497+brian-smith-tcril@users.noreply.github.com> 1771021747 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1771021747 -0500\n\nfix(deps): regenerate package-lock.json (#1855)\n\n* fix(deps): regenerate package-lock.json\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(deps): regenerate package-lock.json\n\nMoved @openedx/frontend-build from dependencies to devDependencies.\nRemoved direct jest devDependency which was causing ts-jest hoisting issues.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(tests): use require() for MockedPluginSlot in jest.mock\n\nJest hoists jest.mock() calls to the top of the file, which caused\nMockedPluginSlot to be undefined when the mock factory executed.\nUsing require() inside the factory ensures it loads at runtime.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(types): handle nullable breakpoint types\n\nParagon''s breakpoint types now have optional minWidth/maxWidth properties.\nAdded non-null assertions since these values are always defined in practice.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(tests): add IntlProvider to ContentIFrame tests\n\nParagon''s ModalDialog now uses useIntl() (openedx/paragon#3624),\nrequiring an IntlProvider in the component ancestry.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(tests): await async operations in Course tests\n\nFixed dangling waitFor blocks that weren''t awaited, causing tests\nto not actually wait for async operations. Changed to properly use\nawait with screen.findBy*() queries.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(tests): use dynamic imports in LearnerToolsSlot tests\n\nJest hoists mock calls but ES imports run before the test body.\nUsing dynamic imports in beforeEach ensures mocks are set up\nbefore modules are loaded.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpj6WzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANgcQAAZeittyHHfJXkv+HZV4mkJH\nIfRNZMjcP7lx8o1xoaJzFw57WexUX6DEIs9uSYvwGMVHTji8SeZjLNkSRxmQSjRE\nSdJQYeUHmpjXmmHO64SvrCzPf6dUy8KEtycWE8V13eIgxnLLMUcLKqFRu9wmiZcn\nGQqOxgBXYt/ppAW+1yn/OMNQbGINWYXoa5edEcU/l83CKHzYnPSrpSJh+e2P072m\nv4w5TjXzicBcjUJTnETocH7IN0wDY/383f4ifQGRpzz3r2I+17cJOXZsPpaSjJph\nxVvcv2QsvCNj79nvGSq6aj6o0Fbprn32ifdTxkC1rupTIO7kvTmXKCqi9jf4p9QW\na8b2chfUDh1TLz6XS55PJRtLggxa3ApzdgbTz6Cou+MCLNP3StOaaET4tj7T947d\nSlPPVgEXR+8Ero6x7UL3oa0NZ3nbvvm8Q8Zhljmdfg8jn0m8jJjOC2eD6bVjo3eW\nTY435aCNXMBj13bpfo23oOB1V3GU8fBEqMlVAOD4X1ydHUcV2MysRoYdiTsHo3ZF\n4AR0GbCOCdLt3DlsvDwXaBizdsSR5Yajo1VSecRKaabyurPCLLo9wYIvgFO2dwOW\nVnmTOjMlXPr3FXz6WS6DvdLCajdyodt9UzlK4T3oMSJ1GrmyxpTyb0Ws2E3ABJbP\nIb05Uhr5aXVaF6sN25Ks\n=haW1\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-29T08:22:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_ty