","name":"renzsiguenza"},"message":"chore: add comprehensive .gitignore configuration\n\n- Exclude node_modules and package manager artifacts (.pnp, .pnp.js)\n- Ignore build outputs (dist/, build/, out/, .next/, .turbo/)\n- Exclude environment variable files (.env, .env.local, etc.)\n- Ignore log files and debug logs from npm, yarn, and pnpm\n- Exclude TypeScript build info files (*.tsbuildinfo)\n- Ignore test coverage and nyc output directories\n- Exclude IDE configuration (.vscode, .idea, editor temp files)\n- Ignore OS-specific files (Thumbs.db, .DS_Store, Desktop.ini)\n- Exclude temporary and cache files (.cache/, *.tmp, *.temp)\n- Ignore Husky and Turbo internal directories\n- Exclude Module Federation and debug artifacts\n- Prevents accidental commits of generated files, dependencies, and environment-specific data","tree":{"sha":"dc6f5fd444ef31ba4f640af07ce28b1bbaa5c2f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enzox0/module-federation-project-template/git/trees/dc6f5fd444ef31ba4f640af07ce28b1bbaa5c2f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/enzox0/module-federation-project-template/git/commits/5f68c58aa900297e7cf3b9667b34ae880a3173a0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220648054?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enzox0/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enzox0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enzox0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enzox0/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/enzox0","id":220648054,"login":"enzox0","node_id":"U_kgDODSbSdg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enzox0/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enzox0/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enzox0/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/enzox0/starre