e":"2026-05-30T06:57:17Z","email":"j.fuerlinger@htl-leonding.ac.at","name":"Josef Fürlinger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T06:57:17Z","email":"j.fuerlinger@htl-leonding.ac.at","name":"Josef Fürlinger"},"message":"feat(ios): add native SwiftUI iOS app\n\nFull-featured iOS 17+ app mirroring the Family Hub web interface:\n\n- Auth: animated login/register screen with dark gradient, form validation\n- Dashboard: greeting, stat cards, pending todos preview, pull-to-refresh\n- Family: multi-family selector, member list with avatars, invite by e-mail\n- Todos: filter bar (All/Open/Done), swipe-to-toggle, assignee chips, due date\n- Calendar: personal events (create/delete, grouped by day), family calendar\n  with per-member visibility toggle, Add Event sheet with DatePicker\n- Settings sheet: profile info, API URL display, sign-out\n\nArchitecture:\n- MVVM with @MainActor ObservableObject ViewModels\n- APIClient using URLSession + async/await, custom ISO8601 date decoder\n- JWT stored in Keychain (survives app restarts)\n- EnvironmentObject dependency injection through MainTabView\n- Comprehensive DesignSystem: PrimaryButtonStyle, FHTextField, UserAvatar,\n  StatusBadge, FHErrorBanner, FHEmptyState, colour helpers\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"9e54e8d00af33b49b925a5aa544935fe509680e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jfuerlinger/family-hub/git/trees/9e54e8d00af33b49b925a5aa544935fe509680e5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jfuerlinger/family-hub/git/commits/0961de185ec295b7cf759272dc808a7afc2b0244","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44121556?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfuerlinger/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfuerlinger/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfuerlinger/following{