/jfuerlinger/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfuerlinger/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jfuerlinger","id":44121556,"login":"jfuerlinger","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ0MTIxNTU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfuerlinger/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfuerlinger/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfuerlinger/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfuerlinger/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfuerlinger/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jfuerlinger","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jfuerlinger/family-hub/commits/3097af9f19f9c7aeb0cbe8fe32062ce0bc460da7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T14:15:10Z","email":"j.fuerlinger@htl-leonding.ac.at","name":"Josef Fürlinger"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T14:15:10Z","email":"j.fuerlinger@htl-leonding.ac.at","name":"Josef Fürlinger"},"message":"feat: Add Family Hub full-stack application\n\n- Clean Architecture: Domain / Application / Infrastructure / API\n- .NET 10 backend with JWT auth, EF Core + PostgreSQL\n- Vue 3 + Pinia + TypeScript frontend with Vite 8\n- .NET Aspire AppHost orchestration (FamilyHub.AppHost)\n- All use cases: registration, login, families, todos (with due dates), personal + family calendar with per-member visibility toggles\n- 13 backend tests (6 unit, 7 integration) - all passing\n- 11 frontend tests (Vitest + Pinia) - all passing\n- EF Core migrations (InitialCreate) with full schema incl. AllDay + DueDateUtc\n- Docker Compose for dev build and Docker Hub deployment\n- Demo seed user: demo@familyhub.local / Demo1234!\n- README.md + AGENTS.md documentation\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"e214ae46dec7ac865b8a0068aeb045da0d46359c","url":"https://api.g