reater/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shanepreater","id":6948843,"login":"shanepreater","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDg4NDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/92ad563b912ade16e33fdb0c80f6990e8d0ec003/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-26T09:59:32Z","email":"shane@argodevops.co.uk","name":"Shane P"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-26T09:59:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(contracts): migrate all Pact consumer tests to V4 spec and add CI/CD docs (#42)\n\n* feat(contracts): migrate all Pact consumer tests to V4 spec and add CI/CD docs\n\n- Migrate 5 admin-ui and 3 user-ui TypeScript consumer tests from PactV3 to PactV4 API\n- Migrate 3 Java orchestrator consumer tests (PactSpecVersion.V3→V4, RequestResponsePact→V4Pact,\n  .toPact()→.toPact(V4Pact.class))\n- Bump @pact-foundation/pact to 16.5.0 in both UIs\n- Add async jest.config.ts wrapper to handle https-proxy-agent v9 ESM in Jest\n- Add --runInBand to admin-ui test:contract to prevent pact file merge conflicts\n- Regenerate all four pact files as Pact V4 spec\n- Add docs/cicd.md with full pipeline reference (CI, Deploy, Terraform, Infracost)\n- Link docs/cicd.md from docs/README.md and root README.md\n- Bump admin-ui 0.5.1→0.5.2, user-ui 0.7.2→0.7.3, orchestrator 0.4.2→0.4.3\n\n* fix(ci): repair npm workspace lock file for cross-platform CI\n\nRoot package-lock.json was generated on macOS ARM and only recorded\n@next/swc-darwin-arm64 — Linux CI runners require all platform variants\n(@next/swc-linux-x64-gnu, linux-arm64-musl, etc.). npm ci failed with\n\"Missing: next@16.2.6 from lock file\" because a peer-only entry for\nnext existed without resolved/integrity fields.\n\nFixes:\n- Pin next@15.5.18 at root devDependencies to resolve the peer dep\n  properly with full registry metadata and all SWC platform variants\n- Add @testing-library/dom@^10.0.0 as explicit devDependency to both\n  UIs — it is a required peer of @testing-library/react@16 but was\n  never installed, causing 11 component test suites to fail on run\n- Regenerate root package-lock.json to include all platform variants\n\n* fix(user-ui): switch vis-network to standalone build to fix Docker build\n\nvis-network''s default export resolves to the peer ESM build which\nimports vis-data, vis-util, keycharm, @egjs/hammerjs, and\ncomponent-emitter as external peer dependencies. These were never\ninstalled because they were only recorded as unmet peers in the lock\nfile and npm ci does not install unresolvable peers.\n\nSwitch the dynamic import and type ref in GraphInsightsView to\nvis-network/standalone, which bundles all dependencies, eliminating\nthe \"Module not found: Can''t resolve vis-data/peer/esm/vis-data.js\"\nbuild error. Update the jest.mock path to match.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Shane P <shane@argodevops.co.uk>","tree":{"sha":"9e98bd3ef236a9db14110cb0fcc6bbdd90ae83cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/trees/9e98bd3ef236a9db14110cb0fcc6bbdd90ae83cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/commits/92ad563b912ade16e33fdb0c80f6990e8d0ec003","verification":{"payload":"tree 9e98bd3ef236a9db14110cb0fcc6bbdd90ae83cf\nparent e8641752a05fb7152b4a210be5b6044515316048\nauthor Shane P <shane@argodevops.co.uk> 1779789572 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779789572 +0100\n\nfeat(contracts): migrate all Pact consumer tests to V4 spec and add CI/CD docs (#42)\n\n* feat(contracts): migrate all Pact consumer tests to V4 spec and add CI/CD docs\n\n- Migrate 5 admin-ui and 3 user-ui TypeScript consumer tests from PactV3 to PactV4 API\n- Migrate 3 Java orchestrator consumer tests (PactSpecVersion.V3→V4, RequestResponsePact→V4Pact,\n  .toPact()→.toPact(V4Pact.class))\n- Bump @pact-foundation/pact to 16.5.0 in both UIs\n- Add async jest.config.ts wrapper to handle https-proxy-agent v9 ESM in Jest\n- Add --runInBand to admin-ui test:contract to prevent pact file merge conflicts\n- Regenerate all four pact files as Pact V4 spec\n- Add docs/cicd.md with full pipeline reference (CI, Deploy, Terraform, Infracost)\n- Link docs/cicd.md from docs/README.md and root README.md\n- Bump admin-ui 0.5.1→0.5.2, user-ui 0.7.2→0.7.3, orchestrator 0.4.2→0.4.3\n\n* fix(ci): repair npm workspace lock file for cross-platform CI\n\nRoot package-lock.json was generated on macOS ARM and only recorded\n@next/swc-darwin-arm64 — Linux CI runners require all platform variants\n(@next/swc-linux-x64-gnu, linux-arm64-musl, etc.). npm ci failed with\n\"Missing: next@16.2.6 from lock file\" because a peer-only entry for\nnext existed without resolved/integrity fields.\n\nFixes:\n- Pin next@15.5.18 at root devDependencies to resolve the peer dep\n  properly with full registry metadata and all SWC platform variants\n- Add @testing-library/dom@^10.0.0 as explicit devDependency to both\n  UIs — it is a required peer of @testing-library/react@16 but was\n  never installed, causing 11 component test suites to fail on run\n- Regenerate root package-lock.json to include all platform variants\n\n* fix(user-ui): switch vis-network to standalone build to fix Docker build\n\nvis-network''s default export resolves to the peer ESM build which\nimports vis-data, vis-util, keycharm, @egjs/hammerjs, and\ncomponent-emitter as external peer dependencies. These were never\ninstalled because they were only recorded as unmet peers in the lock\nfile and npm ci does not install unresolvable peers.\n\nSwitch the dynamic import and type ref in GraphInsightsView to\nvis-network/standalone, which bundles all dependencies, eliminating\nthe \"Module not found: Can''t resolve vis-data/peer/esm/vis-data.js\"\nbuild error. Update the jest.mock path to match.\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Shane P <shane@argodevops.co.uk>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFW8ECRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAeOgQAI2klaOETs/pjEdaF6FS/ueZ\nc6onXBgYxS2NwX9h/kF6/zOXvutrXjeDg/zXYTJem8j2J+N3ANvEG9+Lygyy8IqX\nfbec99ABTM2rJocTJUfIg7P4IpHGJD7BMBkjc6jvrsoKske3lH2IZMIzRSRHpGQv\n0YtxuYUwOfDKZSYaJWBg/ot8oce3icTZSna7A7Ll7U80iACllFhSIenGO+wotJNR\noXIOeGdCc/cGQfC00FVVoKK4y19JCNQ+Wrt0+MKbGeNKYyf0JdwnqxNHvueVdTQB\nUzH6V9pcHLHpDHc1G8USEqc93dEbk92ZkJVo9KqOPFgET+f4I/yzDl48UA40L/z1\ndDNZmlDGUjmYkIECGFPlu4wUu6oGD+KcSffhfBxQfirIS1W6kxRm5jL4bKKUTDQJ\nGteIiE4nn87tA8oRgAFRPVU+ZKBQZec5J8mwwBpZeh+4T4LPegH1lQ7jm64B2yfU\nZ/8drPGigKPyI27EyGU6ch/PNYaI0f1QRrXQh9V8LPORJ+Z+TEabBC0xUlXZ6M9+\n+KP8K01NII8vbRGCMLXL4i59/yFNf9cKUUd+RwvxgMUqSE2q4hOTpX+A/3vhL081\nA8w4CRq+HP2d6QHf0fktK7Bda/7azN557KdORUgFf3b2VBYk1p1Ss09DGxxLOpC6\n2xtTyfxckws4kMqOLVsi\n=9uKE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-29T15:47:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commit/92ad563b912ade16e33fdb0c80f6990e8d0ec003","node_id":"C_kwDOSrf_edoAKDkyYWQ1NjNiOTEyYWRlMTZlMzNmZGIwYzgwZjY5OTBlOGQwZWMwMDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commit/e8641752a05fb7152b4a210be5b6044515316048","sha":"e8641752a05fb7152b4a210be5b6044515316048","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/e8641752a05fb7152b4a210be5b6044515316048"}],"sha":"92ad563b912ade16e33fdb0c80f6990e8d0ec003","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/92ad563b912ade16e33fdb0c80f6990e8d0ec003"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6948843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shanepreater","id":6948843,"login":"shanepreater","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDg4NDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/e8641752a05fb7152b4a210be5b6044515316048/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-25T08:42:12Z","email":"shane@argodevops.co.uk","name":"Shane P"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-25T08:42:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feat/infracost pr comments (#41)\n\n* feat(ci): add Infracost PR cost estimate comments for Terraform changes\n\nAdd a GitHub Actions workflow and Infracost project config that posts a\ncost diff comment on every PR touching deployment/terraform/**. The comment\nshows the monthly cost delta between the base branch and the PR so reviewers\ncan spot unexpected infrastructure cost changes before merge.\n\n- .github/workflows/infracost.yml: checks out base branch, generates\n  baseline estimate, then generates a diff against the PR branch and posts\n  an updating comment via infracost/actions/comment@v1\n- .infracost/configuration.yml: project config pointing at uat.tfvars for\n  realistic sizing; placeholder values for required secret variables (not\n  used in cost calculation)\n- TF_CLI_ARGS_init=-backend=false prevents terraform init from attempting\n  to contact TFC during static analysis\n- docs/deployment.md: add INFRACOST_API_KEY, GHCR_USERNAME, GHCR_TOKEN to\n  the GitHub Secrets setup table\n\n* feat(setup): add infracost to setup.sh and verify check\n\n* fix(ci): update infracost workflow and scripts for v2 CLI changes\n\ninfracost v2 removed breakdown/diff in favour of scan, which uploads\nresults to the Infracost cloud. The GitHub App (infracost ci setup)\nthen posts the PR comment automatically.\n\n- infracost.yml: replace breakdown+diff+comment with infracost scan\n- scripts/setup.sh: fix API key instructions to point to dashboard\n  CLI Tokens page; add estimate-cost.sh to post-install steps\n- scripts/estimate-cost.sh: new script to run a local cost scan\n\n* fix(scripts): fix estimate-cost.sh path/currency args; add deployment.md setup guide\n\n- estimate-cost.sh: path is positional (not --path flag), default\n  currency changed to GBP, fix arg parsing from for-loop to while\n- scripts/setup.sh: fix API key instructions to point to dashboard\n  CLI Tokens page; add estimate-cost.sh to post-install steps\n- docs/deployment.md: add §3.6 Infracost setup with step-by-step\n  instructions for CI token, GitHub App, and local estimate script\n\n* feat(contracts): migrate TypeScript consumer pact tests to V4 spec\n\n- Migrate all 8 consumer tests (admin-ui ×5, user-ui ×3) from PactV3\n  to PactV4 builder API; generated pact files now emit spec 4.0\n- Add --runInBand to admin-ui test:contract to eliminate the parallel-\n  write race condition that caused flaky CI failures on the empty-list\n  interaction\n- Bump @pact-foundation/pact to ^16.5.0 in both UIs\n- Override transformIgnorePatterns in both jest.config.ts files to allow\n  ts-jest to transpile https-proxy-agent and agent-base (both ESM-only\n  in pact 16.5.0) after nextJest resets the default ignore list\n- Bump admin-ui 0.5.1→0.5.2 and user-ui 0.7.2→0.7.3\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Shane P <shane@argodevops.co.uk>","tree":{"sha":"da38263c07216112092daf4b1e79a9e2782e3f11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/trees/da38263c07216112092daf4b1e79a9e2782e3f11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/commits/e8641752a05fb7152b4a210be5b6044515316048","verification":{"payload":"tree da38263c07216112092daf4b1e79a9e2782e3f11\nparent 61ef56ffffff935cfffd6aa2e30fea235fd9847a\nauthor Shane P <shane@argodevops.co.uk> 1779698532 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779698532 +0100\n\nFeat/infracost pr comments (#41)\n\n* feat(ci): add Infracost PR cost estimate comments for Terraform changes\n\nAdd a GitHub Actions workflow and Infracost project config that posts a\ncost diff comment on every PR touching deployment/terraform/**. The comment\nshows the monthly cost delta between the base branch and the PR so reviewers\ncan spot unexpected infrastructure cost changes before merge.\n\n- .github/workflows/infracost.yml: checks out base branch, generates\n  baseline estimate, then generates a diff against the PR branch and posts\n  an updating comment via infracost/actions/comment@v1\n- .infracost/configuration.yml: project config pointing at uat.tfvars for\n  realistic sizing; placeholder values for required secret variables (not\n  used in cost calculation)\n- TF_CLI_ARGS_init=-backend=false prevents terraform init from attempting\n  to contact TFC during static analysis\n- docs/deployment.md: add INFRACOST_API_KEY, GHCR_USERNAME, GHCR_TOKEN to\n  the GitHub Secrets setup table\n\n* feat(setup): add infracost to setup.sh and verify check\n\n* fix(ci): update infracost workflow and scripts for v2 CLI changes\n\ninfracost v2 removed breakdown/diff in favour of scan, which uploads\nresults to the Infracost cloud. The GitHub App (infracost ci setup)\nthen posts the PR comment automatically.\n\n- infracost.yml: replace breakdown+diff+comment with infracost scan\n- scripts/setup.sh: fix API key instructions to point to dashboard\n  CLI Tokens page; add estimate-cost.sh to post-install steps\n- scripts/estimate-cost.sh: new script to run a local cost scan\n\n* fix(scripts): fix estimate-cost.sh path/currency args; add deployment.md setup guide\n\n- estimate-cost.sh: path is positional (not --path flag), default\n  currency changed to GBP, fix arg parsing from for-loop to while\n- scripts/setup.sh: fix API key instructions to point to dashboard\n  CLI Tokens page; add estimate-cost.sh to post-install steps\n- docs/deployment.md: add §3.6 Infracost setup with step-by-step\n  instructions for CI token, GitHub App, and local estimate script\n\n* feat(contracts): migrate TypeScript consumer pact tests to V4 spec\n\n- Migrate all 8 consumer tests (admin-ui ×5, user-ui ×3) from PactV3\n  to PactV4 builder API; generated pact files now emit spec 4.0\n- Add --runInBand to admin-ui test:contract to eliminate the parallel-\n  write race condition that caused flaky CI failures on the empty-list\n  interaction\n- Bump @pact-foundation/pact to ^16.5.0 in both UIs\n- Override transformIgnorePatterns in both jest.config.ts files to allow\n  ts-jest to transpile https-proxy-agent and agent-base (both ESM-only\n  in pact 16.5.0) after nextJest resets the default ignore list\n- Bump admin-ui 0.5.1→0.5.2 and user-ui 0.7.2→0.7.3\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Shane P <shane@argodevops.co.uk>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqFAtkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtKQQAJWaqW8zy27CKO2JnH9yGfKF\n+DREUKn+3b057bsm6am0H/qAgdTm1agrhyespc0pOAY/58I8oM0/6fZrICgBJcp+\nSZpWnKBoolanUL/74kxzaTLoovKhRFmDUPv/uEDV0Q32/JctFspl711lM0m43uUQ\ncLcT/JVV5Sb7lwJdMs8TqbhS6CmnqG5j+ZgjaUU+NvlBzCM1xPTIA9yA8e9DUM95\nAaixCFgsHb9I/5ag1EEkeRBel8XhQaKcqOoqTRXWMky4ev0yiK3dNNfr0z6X3v49\nUtSIopp3M2pyIsa6KS4K2sAuXb8zVJjuWe+GxlDqc9CT5cJq3chrjFkYI5ucgX4x\n94OFqwKg4zfWfnHd3DnAVEG5FYieU6CN4zkxU+Mz882rE+GCBrd8nPfE7AM5tO04\n/HPnUlrRU7DtSxRtj/BvtaNDCnAvNIC7elta9yCEqo9vNEFZA7LJOloLcVPvA1l6\nTfobrqF0AbHem5SzNvvirhFWM0oAf5qSgkDdnHeVnF8MRiMH+PIHICtH05J61Iok\niFVCGHK4cQNN3NKQBoJZR9M4v36VrHO3Z+7VdeLvJvgrIasiD2fD8hqrvCcYKALY\nLYPexwSQPuIAUcTqvQJAIu6dQiAIX2bJypcWq8bjzsGsposEGSCeYQCA8nlhdsZH\njZXUciV5RPw9DMeeRGmO\n=7Ooo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-29T15:47:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://a