nepreater","id":6948843,"login":"shanepreater","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDg4NDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/deda25a6f9c9900d5157cd268a4e538d1f8efdeb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T16:40:43Z","email":"shane@argodevops.co.uk","name":"Shane P"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T16:40:43Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ci): enforce image-build ordering and fix production plan in terraform pipeline (#39)\n\n* fix(ci): enforce image-build ordering and fix production plan in terraform pipeline\n\nSwitch the terraform workflow from a push-to-main trigger to a workflow_run\ntrigger (fires after ''Deploy — Build & Push OCI Images'' succeeds) so the UAT\ncontainer apps are always updated with freshly-pushed GHCR images. Previously\nthe workflow could run before or in parallel with the image build, causing\nGHCR UNAUTHORIZED or :latest pull failures.\n\n- Replace push/workflow_dispatch triggers with workflow_run after deploy\n- validate job guarded to only run on PR or workflow_run(success)\n- plan-uat (speculative) now runs on PR only\n- apply-uat now runs on workflow_run, checkouts workflow_run.head_sha\n- plan-production creates a real approvable TFC run (not speculative) so a\n  team lead can review and apply directly in TFC; auto-apply must be OFF on\n  the spyder-production workspace\n- apply-production job removed (TFC handles the apply after manual approval)\n- TFC_ORG moved to top-level env block; all jobs use ${{ env.TFC_ORG }}\n- docs/deployment.md: update sections 5.2/5.3, add 5.4 promotion guide\n\n* chore(deployment): bump VERSION to 0.2.2\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Shane P <shane@argodevops.co.uk>","tree":{"sha":"18432d53358c65b5a43c10eeb5bbc462f024c2c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/trees/18432d53358c65b5a43c10eeb5bbc462f024c2c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/commits/deda25a6f9c9900d5157cd268a4e538d1f8efdeb","verification":{"payload":"tree 18432d53358c65b5a43c10eeb5bbc462f024c2c7\nparent fead2696735a5a77d88408257c405f04470bb792\nauthor Shane P <shane@argodevops.co.uk> 1779640843 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779640843 +0100\n\nfix(ci): enforce image-build ordering and fix production plan in terraform pipeline (#39)\n\n* fix(ci): enforce image-build ordering and fix production plan in terraform pipeline\n\nSwitch the terraform workflow from a push-to-main trigger to a workflow_run\ntrigger (fires after ''Deploy — Build & Push OCI Images'' succeeds) so the UAT\ncontainer apps are always updated with freshly-pushed GHCR images. Previously\nthe workflow could run before or in parallel with the image build, causing\nGHCR UNAUTHORIZED or :latest pull failures.\n\n- Replace push/workflow_dispatch triggers with workflow_run after deploy\n- validate job guarded to only run on PR or workflow_run(success)\n- plan-uat (speculative) now runs on PR only\n- apply-uat now runs on workflow_run, checkouts workflow_run.head_sha\n- plan-production creates a real approvable TFC run (not speculative) so a\n  team lead can review and apply directly in TFC; auto-apply must be OFF on\n  the spyder-production workspace\n- apply-production job removed (TFC handles the apply after manual approval)\n- TFC_ORG moved to top-level env block; all jobs use ${{ env.TFC_ORG }}\n- docs/deployment.md: update sections 5.2/5.3, add 5.4 promotion guide\n\n* chore(deployment): bump VERSION to 0.2.2\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Shane P <shane@argodevops.co.uk>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqEyoLCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA84oQAGNOpfsJLZ1LJQ0ZtoUF/vWj\nWBt0BZ1hEuPm/+H9nMRwnJETCVzc5ZYBwhc9tJD2puD6JOx4drb/fYD5+uLhdzPr\nIL+G2LjQiQcMZJSQNUd11/fNIxZcV1m3aPwxX3K634VVX7f0De/ztM6cQkAWTCxB\nb7qOtw0VbFuOreK3hf8xmV8nNVQxGVlgnZyEJH2fhUQFB6N4mHDxxRGB8vBKAiYk\nCByoFhJgTiu391CR7BzYjj9sy1EHVgQyJWU5VH36ck+cBXwh7ZorcJTVlUXMPBhD\nH8aWTKnM0WyEa96dC9VHTzSbqugT8PqVJj7fVAPhz9OR5jhNsSPe6LEbsgZz6gEA\nLgA9MpbBNBZrrZzEoFdawiA2jie7XpoRcP0wWNqBlHKNEqS4omeU4ANZeqVctN4m\nwW+CgTyFYtj38eeKSJrR4XZiYn9q6Wyw+x6cIXZz8YERRd1CR2nku5i5PtLb+8sg\nr8gkqz+DU5jUzaqZO9krwo16WmjlT35PDvhnixd64UYi7j+xNVLaeJc6Em5MiII8\n9dGBymopJz/RXOsyyIaRZhlGN/998xVvAhDlC4s3ct6Si6+8rVpizHuhddO+Tw6L\n8nAL3DLsWoqJud9Bl+ZNs1i/Lll0+ixu6n/LhDYXi7MonGrYacoHNSSmybxwhj1T\n/TovT6DZLuJjE2mtmx29\n=hndl\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-29T15:47:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commit/deda25a6f9c9900d5157cd268a4e538d1f8efdeb","node_id":"C_kwDOSrf_edoAKGRlZGEyNWE2ZjljOTkwMGQ1MTU3Y2QyNjhhNGU1MzhkMWY4ZWZkZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commit/fead2696735a5a77d88408257c405f04470bb792","sha":"fead2696735a5a77d88408257c405f04470bb792","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/fead2696735a5a77d88408257c405f04470bb792"}],"sha":"deda25a6f9c9900d5157cd268a4e538d1f8efdeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/deda25a6f9c9900d5157cd268a4e538d1f8efdeb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6948843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shanepreater","id":6948843,"login":"shanepreater","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDg4NDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/fead2696735a5a77d88408257c405f04470bb792/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T14:59:25Z","email":"shane@argodevops.co.uk","name":"Shane P"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T14:59:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ci): enforce ordered on-merge pipeline and fix plan-production (#38)\n\nRestructure terraform.yml to trigger via workflow_run after the deploy\nworkflow so images are always pushed before UAT is applied. Plan-production\nnow creates an approvable TFC run (non-speculative) rather than a speculative\nplan-only run, allowing a team lead to approve directly in Terraform Cloud.\nRemoves the workflow_dispatch apply-production job as TFC handles approval.\n\nAlso renames uat.auto.tfvars to versions.auto.tfvars since UAT and production\nuse the same image versions.","tree":{"sha":"fe1ef468086ebd51fd45f87242b920de631c0e63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/trees/fe1ef468086ebd51fd45f87242b920de631c0e63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/commits/fead2696735a5a77d88408257c405f04470bb792","verification":{"payload":"tree fe1ef468086ebd51fd45f87242b920de631c0e63\nparent f599553e6cc17cde527d8487e46d0ee6996fdd93\nauthor Shane P <shane@argodevops.co.uk> 1779634765 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779634765 +0100\n\nfix(ci): enforce ordered on-merge pipeline and fix plan-production (#38)\n\nRestructure terraform.yml to trigger via workflow_run after the deploy\nworkflow so images are always pushed before UAT is applied. Plan-production\nnow creates an approvable TFC run (non-speculative) rather than a speculative\nplan-only run, allowing a team lead to approve directly in Terraform Cloud.\nRemoves the workflow_dispatch apply-production job as TFC handles approval.\n\nAlso renames uat.auto.tfvars to versions.auto.tfvars since UAT and production\nuse the same image versions.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqExJNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABUoQAFGWVbvNaUOM0NqrGcl+1Dtc\nWkIZ4LYpwrD9AOWuHGkVHqGgwoQcknAHmVmVNxyx+D58Fluu7jSuM+eUgm7qVIdW\nDEG4AKYgrjZvW2+ekIE9ACHEBOnyfh3MmD+Bu7g9spYbTXisBlFMNo84Yokrn7WT\n1LFNQICOPZLcMy/sxjn83S8o2MYLTjbVkBPc209u0HcyXzBxgheduB390bPSFfVX\n9L/dzNFue6vL8V1IUQvxOSdeI2sgeCxSf1ej/WAQt/50AInfxMjCH1wSmGVabDJK\nBcQ22rDE8zKtWoli245L4MvVM6QQvudwLvIofamKopK/iuqNI86tLU