epos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commit/f599553e6cc17cde527d8487e46d0ee6996fdd93","node_id":"C_kwDOSrf_edoAKGY1OTk1NTNlNmNjMTdjZGU1MjdkODQ4N2U0NmQwZWU2OTk2ZmRkOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commit/ced69f6cf7a13e588197eb5f4f8ec93ad3d7b531","sha":"ced69f6cf7a13e588197eb5f4f8ec93ad3d7b531","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/ced69f6cf7a13e588197eb5f4f8ec93ad3d7b531"}],"sha":"f599553e6cc17cde527d8487e46d0ee6996fdd93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/f599553e6cc17cde527d8487e46d0ee6996fdd93"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6948843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shanepreater","id":6948843,"login":"shanepreater","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDg4NDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/ced69f6cf7a13e588197eb5f4f8ec93ad3d7b531/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T12:59:09Z","email":"shane@argodevops.co.uk","name":"Shane P"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T12:59:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deployment): add GHCR registry credentials to Azure Container Apps (#36)\n\n* feat(terraform): add GHCR registry credentials to Azure Container Apps\n\nEach GHCR-sourced container app (orchestrator, ai-engine, user-ui,\nadmin-ui) now has a registry block pointing to ghcr.io. A ghcr-pat\nsecret is injected into each app and the PAT is also stored in Key Vault\nfor auditability. ghcr_username defaults to argodevops.\n\n* feat(ci): inject GHCR credentials into TFC workspaces before plan/apply\n\nAdds set-tfc-workspace-var.sh which upserts a TFC workspace variable via\nthe API. All four Terraform jobs (plan/apply UAT, plan/apply production)\nnow call this script to inject ghcr_username and ghcr_pat from the\nexisting GHCR_USERNAME and GHCR_TOKEN GitHub secrets before uploading\nthe config version, so TFC has credentials without manual setup.\n\n* chore(deployment): bump VERSION to 0.2.0","tree":{"sha":"35576c9a82bb43dc92ec0d60029e72f7c9dbf730","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/trees/35576c9a82bb43dc92ec0d60029e72f7c9dbf730"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/commits/ced69f6cf7a13e588197eb5f4f8ec93ad3d7b531","verification":{"payload":"tree 35576c9a82bb43dc92ec0d60029e72f7c9dbf730\nparent 1276782ecbecebd2e0d93bca5057a82ac769002c\nauthor Shane P <shane@argodevops.co.uk> 1779627549 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779627549 +0100\n\nfix(deployment): add GHCR registry credentials to Azure Container Apps (#36)\n\n* feat(terraform): add GHCR registry credentials to Azure Container Apps\n\nEach GHCR-sourced container app (orchestrator, ai-engine, user-ui,\nadmin-ui) now has a registry block pointing to ghcr.io. A ghcr-pat\nsecret is injected into each app and the PAT is also stored in Key Vault\nfor auditability. ghcr_username defaults to argodevops.\n\n* feat(ci): inject GHCR credentials into TFC workspaces before plan/apply\n\nAdds set-tfc-workspace-var.sh which upserts a TFC workspace variable via\nthe API. All four Terraform jobs (plan/apply UAT, plan/apply production)\nnow call this script to inject ghcr_username and ghcr_pat from the\nexisting GHCR_USERNAME and GHCR_TOKEN GitHub secrets before uploading\nthe config version, so TFC has credentials without manual setup.\n\n* chore(deployment): bump VERSION to 0.2.0","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqEvYdCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAhpoQAFxGYFGyUc7R4DInnSSSQAWs\nsitzYkMXoWZ0x2GysYJ/RvxBHSfNNa7b/1Ux7DJpVD6WcR9TNbDmMi2rx800Ozz2\nlHehHmw0VqzvxfiJqds6BDh2NO0L12jI/CuPLG8zLYhbpph0iCykuINpbY1X+YwP\nofXvPEmIKOYrheVZUef9WCjWUdMyGMYFNUUx0to/gqgiOSGzyWVQIrb4NBDl5lmk\n4rWca/Z+dIanPbY8qS0hMJvRlijJpsreZv0PZYDhbxxwvo5TjpA+8iL+cPR7pRf1\nQUtRFqjZneg9KM4zQBVgSjZRv6MuajKmjsDr6DNrOIX+uz0zeQozaJmQlEBEECVL\nGHCydN+qM690PoOhzg7c55NZ95auB00yw8e3AnRqyuVbwYcGGzGVPmd23z0B8Q//\nt8G60OuK8EewKLsUmgqdvEHabK23LVflVbxDsm2bByQVWRnM7LkrzzvoOUa484dp\naLIQ0aahPfnJZL8v2/Z1sv+Z5NZ/g4Qum9ZDKPs/5znYJ2BFvOepaOwei439ZK+i\nNEVWMtYlJD+jseRFVQxugAFMTKDxaaopgwtfemEBcru3Uh01z+IrTsXB5HXwkj1G\nujGNf+8AzV3XDrG377P3eUUGlOEFn7WdJ1s3KsfeQbBIVhW+Z5sFAhTSr+xw5kkq\nLXSYTNNg0yZ4BeCyCQ7W\n=i12/\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-29T15:47:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commit/ced69f6cf7a13e588197eb5f4f8ec93ad3d7b531","node_id":"C_kwDOSrf_edoAKGNlZDY5ZjZjZjdhMTNlNTg4MTk3ZWI1ZjRmOGVjOTNhZDNkN2I1MzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commit/1276782ecbecebd2e0d93bca5057a82ac769002c","sha":"1276782ecbecebd2e0d93bca5057a82ac769002c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/1276782ecbecebd2e0d93bca5057a82ac769002c"}],"sha":"ced69f6cf7a13e588197eb5f4f8ec93ad3d7b531","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/ced69f6cf7a13e588197eb5f4f8ec93ad3d7b531"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6948843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shanepreater","id":6948843,"login":"shanepreater","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDg4NDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/1276782ecbecebd2e0d93bca5057a82ac769002c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-24T12:09:58Z","email":"shane@argodevops.co.uk","name":"Shane P"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-24T12:09:58Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: security hardening — IP restrictions, version pinning, empty-secret fix (#34)\n\n* feat: security hardening — IP restrictions, version pinning, orchestrator empty-secret fix\n\n- Lock Keycloak and Admin UI ingress to Argo VPN CIDR (20.108.63.16/28) via\n  Azure Container Apps ip_security_restriction blocks on all environments\n- Expose argo_vpn_cidr as a Terraform variable (default: 20.108.63.16/28)\n  so the CIDR can be overridden without code changes if the VPN range changes\n- Add additional_ip_allow_ranges variable for per-workspace developer access\n  (dynamic ip_security_restriction blocks appended when list is non-empty)\n- Add terraform_data version guard: production and UAT workspaces must set\n  explicit image tags — ''latest'' is rejected at plan time\n- Fix orchestrator Container App: telegram, x, and facebook connector secrets\n  and their env vars are now dynamic blocks that are omitted when the token\n  value is empty, preventing Azure''s ContainerAppSecretInvalid 400 error\n- Add UAT testing guide section on VPN access and developer IP allow-listing\n\n* fix(ai-engine): correct uvicorn entry point from spider_ai to spyder_ai\n\nThe Dockerfile CMD referenced spider_ai.main:app (missing the ''y''),\ncausing a ModuleNotFoundError on container startup. The installed package\nis spyder_ai as declared in pyproject.toml and the src/ layout.\n\nBumps ai-engine to 0.3.1.\n\n* fix(terraform): wrap compact() with toset() for dynamic secret/env blocks\n\nTerraform requires dynamic block for_each to be a set or map, not a list.\ncompact() returns list(string) which caused a validation error. Wrapping\nwith toset() satisfies the type constraint while preserving the empty-list\nbehaviour when token values are empty strings.\n\n* docs(env): add Terraform local plan variables to .env.example\n\nDocuments the ARM_* and TF_VAR_* values needed to run terraform plan\nlocally against the dev_shanep workspace using a backend_override.tf.\n\n* feat(ci): auto-generate uat.auto.tfvars from VERSION files before TFC upload\n\nAdd scripts/generate-versions-tfvars.sh which reads the VERSION file from\neach subproject (orchestrator, ai-engine, user-ui, admin-ui) and writes\ndeployment/terraform/uat.auto.tfvars. Terraform automatically loads *.auto.tfvars\nfiles, so version variables are injected into every TFC plan and apply without\nmanual intervention.\n\nAdd a \"Generate versions tfvars\" step to all four TFC jobs (plan-uat, apply-uat,\nplan-production, apply-production) so the generated file is always present when\nthe configuration is uploaded.\n\nRemove hardcoded version values from uat.tfvars and production.tfvars; versions\nare now the sole responsibility of the CI step.\n\nAdd uat.auto.tfvars to .gitignore — it is ephemeral and must not be committed.","tree":{"sha":"69b16401b579e998c9da36e7e81de85a72a36b7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/trees/69b16401b579e998c9da36e7e81de85a72a36b7e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/commits/1276782ecbecebd2e0d93bca5057a82ac769002c","verification":{"payload":"tree 69b16401b579e998c9da36e7e81de85a72a36b7e\nparent 5d1bd1191a669b4965d18b17ac4e224454182c67\nauthor Shane P <shane@argodevops.co.uk> 1779624598 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779624598 +0100\n\nfeat: security hardening — IP restrictions, version pinning, empty-secret fix (#34)\n\n* feat: security hardening — IP restrictions, version pinning, orchestrator empty-secret fix\n\n- Lock Keycloak and Admin UI ingress to Argo VPN CIDR (20.108.63.16/28) via\n  Azure Container Apps ip_security_restriction blocks on all environments\n- Expose argo_vpn_cidr as a Terraform variable (default: 20.108.63.16/28)\n  so the CIDR can be overridden without code changes if the VPN range changes\n- Add additional_ip_allow_ranges variable for per-workspace developer access\n  (dynamic ip_security_restriction blocks appended when list is non-empty)\n- Add terraform_data version guard: production and UAT workspaces must set\n  explicit image tags — ''latest'' is rejected at plan time\n- Fix orchestrator Container App: telegram, x, and facebook connector secrets\n  and their env vars are now dynamic blocks that are omitted when the token\n  value is empty, preventing Azure''s ContainerAppSecretInvalid 400 error\n- Add UAT testing guide section on VPN access and developer IP allow-listing\n\n* fix(ai-engine): correct uvicorn entry point from spider_ai to spyder_ai\n\nThe Dockerfile CMD referenced spider_ai.main:app (missing the ''y''),\ncausing a ModuleNotFoundError on container startup. The installed package\nis spyder_ai as declared in pyproject.toml and the src/ layout.\n\nBumps ai-engine to 0.3.1.\n\n* fix(terraform): wrap compact() with toset() for dynamic secret/env blocks\n\nTerraform requires dynamic block for_each to be a set or map, not a list.\ncompact() returns list(string) which caused a validation error. Wrapping\nwith toset() satisfies the type constraint while preserving the empty-list\nbehaviour when token values are empty strings.\n\n* docs(env): add Terraform local plan variables to .env.example\n\nDocuments the ARM_* and TF_VAR_* values needed to run terraform plan\nlocally against the dev_shanep workspace using a backend_override.tf.\n\n* feat(ci): auto-generate uat.auto.tfvars from VERSION files before TFC upload\n\nAdd scripts/generate-versions-tfvars.sh which reads the VERSION file from\neach subproject (orchestrator, ai-engine, user-ui, admin-ui) and writes\ndeployment/terraform/uat.auto.tfvars. Terraform automatically loads *.auto.tfvars\nfiles, so version variables are injected into every TFC plan and apply without\nmanual intervention.\n\nAdd a \"Generate versions tfvars\" step to all four TFC jobs (plan-uat, apply-uat,\nplan-production, apply-production) so the generated file is always present when\nthe configuration is uploaded.\n\nRemove hardcoded version values from uat.tfvars and production.tfvars; versions\nare now the sole responsibility of the CI step.\n\nAdd uat.auto.tfvars to .gitignore — it is ephemeral and must not be committed.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqEuqWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAcRwQAAtzK1AkIE+fex3Ib56APPjR\n027T5LqEjumdUGM3rI/trtp23a4hizeHZZF2hG7sNcveUe/GKAO6iLp0J608MfBg\n10vl9rTYq6JG8Ex2XkaigQnPVo94ReJrl3tjjEISbFpLcetTUe8xHbkjaZd/upHK\ngc+8e/RAzcaPw/swX/j4iYevgaAJUIOJx+nW8ucOtr/Nf3SS5qcEKfwstCCcKuHQ\nV9jb36iW7yaIwVDHtWPE0PwaVvfnfd4J544MndNrjqPDmilxFjK9Udf1RAAkJO+7\nwznky/GThvx7/jWf/iA3lFfoN3wVoe2IoHfnAia2Xx1r8IkRqz8GyzV/xPDI3M43\ni157xrYFrxbYCt1GpL220Iml5Aj3YrZLQ3R7lzDZM2kWB+PHqosvNaoKheHvCMdG\n6baP+GAjBis6zdn4OXP2/L4lWsttjY9+8vbfsnr7hj1CpHbxUenCWvfwo11wYZDI\nI5aSwgjd2lT5Axa75I1nDXfDF/2s/uAyoeXOBgztrGcL4iJSfIVikqe5Cvfp+Qd3\nksaWPtE3oKfHnt1iOLk/Und/edfGrZzIbZ+kZSS5AvScvZxLNPl/5sIFw/QBBPc3\nMRR5HaAiGvBB07ncVrSD3EY8sm6cowD8YRBhJ24vZTtYzqOIlSYDQO/jdCtAbnwE\nbuhB/IgRM29wGbo80qTa\n=IABI\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-29T15:47:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/