/commits/4e2bac28df128798d16e140438b6de2712701d91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6948843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shanepreater","id":6948843,"login":"shanepreater","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDg4NDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commit/4e2bac28df128798d16e140438b6de2712701d91","node_id":"C_kwDOSrf_edoAKDRlMmJhYzI4ZGYxMjg3OThkMTZlMTQwNDM4YjZkZTI3MTI3MDFkOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commit/6df48e32670de629b32a59b6f947861d42ab30d3","sha":"6df48e32670de629b32a59b6f947861d42ab30d3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/6df48e32670de629b32a59b6f947861d42ab30d3"}],"sha":"4e2bac28df128798d16e140438b6de2712701d91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/4e2bac28df128798d16e140438b6de2712701d91"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6948843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shanepreater","id":6948843,"login":"shanepreater","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDg4NDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/6df48e32670de629b32a59b6f947861d42ab30d3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T13:19:51Z","email":"shane@argodevops.co.uk","name":"Shane P"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T13:19:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: Spider platform features — export, graph insights, org self-service, notifications, search history (#28)\n\n* fix(docker): correct server.js path for Next.js monorepo standalone build\n\nWith outputFileTracingRoot set to the monorepo root, Next.js places\nserver.js at .next/standalone/<subdir>/server.js, not at the root.\nUpdate CMD in both UI Dockerfiles to match the actual path, and\ndocument this gotcha in docs/development.md.\n\n* feat: admin-ui navbar fix, notification persistence, and bulk export evidence pack\n\nadmin-ui:\n- Fix organisations pages missing AdminLayout wrapper (navbar/sidebar dropped)\n- Bump admin-ui VERSION 0.3.2 → 0.3.3\n\nnotifications (@spider/shared):\n- Add zustand persist middleware with SSR-safe localStorage storage\n- Cap stored notifications at 50; rehydrate timestamps as Date objects\n- Update tests in both UIs to match new 50-notification cap\n\nbulk export (orchestrator + user-ui):\n- Add GET /api/v1/searches/{searchId}/export endpoint returning ZIP\n- ZIP contains results.csv and audit_trail.csv (full audit trail for the search)\n- Requires ANALYST or ADMIN role; logs EXPORT audit action\n- Add ExportService, EXPORT AuditAction, AuditEntryRepository query\n- Add SearchControllerExportTest with role-gating and error scenarios\n- Add Export Evidence Pack button with spinner to ResultsConsole\n- Bump orchestrator VERSION 0.2.6 → 0.2.7, user-ui VERSION 0.5.1 → 0.5.2\n\n* feat: org-scoped user management and settings self-service\n\nAdd org-admin endpoints (GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/v1/org/users, GET/PUT\n/api/v1/org) so tenant ADMIN users can manage their own team and update\nprovisioning/retention settings without Argo superadmin involvement.\n\nOrchestrator:\n- OrgUserController: list, invite, update role, suspend, delete users\n  scoped to calling user''s org via RequestContext\n- OrgSelfController: read and update own org settings (name/slug read-only;\n  provisioningStrategy/resultRetentionDays/searchHistoryDays editable)\n- OrgAdminInterceptor: defence-in-depth ADMIN check at interceptor layer\n  for /api/v1/org/users/** paths; wired in WebMvcConfig\n- OrgSettingsRequest DTO for the editable-fields-only PUT body\n- WebMvcTest unit tests for both controllers (role enforcement, validation)\n- Bump orchestrator VERSION 0.2.7 → 0.2.8\n\nuser-ui:\n- api.ts: fix getOrgUsers to call /api/v1/org/users; add inviteUser,\n  updateUserRole, suspendUser, deleteUser, getOrgSettings, updateOrgSettings\n- types/index.ts: add OrgSettings, OrgSettingsUpdate, UserProvisioningStrategy;\n  document displayName→name mapping on OrgUser\n- team/page.tsx: add Invite User modal, per-row role/suspend/delete actions\n  (ADMIN only), success toasts via useNotificationStore, refresh after action\n- settings/page.tsx: new ADMIN-only org settings page (read-only org details\n  section + editable provisioning strategy, retention days)\n- AppNav.tsx: add Settings nav link (admin-only section)\n- Bump user-ui VERSION 0.5.2 → 0.5.3\n\n* feat: OSINT graph insights, search history, eviction/purge jobs, adapter refactor\n\n- Add GraphInsightsView component with vis-network entity co-occurrence graph,\n  feature-gated behind GRAPH_INSIGHTS flag; upsell placeholder when flag absent\n- Add Results/Graph tab bar to ResultsConsole; Export Evidence Pack button\n- Add search history page (/history) with pagination, status badges, links to results\n- Add Search History and Settings nav links in AppNav; guard Settings to ADMIN only\n- Fix audit page auth guard to use synchronous three-branch pattern (no flash)\n- Add SearchResultEvictionJob (@Scheduled, 5-min default) and SearchHistoryPurgeJob\n  (@Scheduled cron 2am daily) with @EnableScheduling on OrchestratorApplication\n- Extract AdapterUtils.configStr() — removes duplicated private method from\n  TelegramAdapter, XAdapter, PhpbbAdapter, FacebookAdapter, WebSearchAdapter\n- Add SearchHistoryEntry and OrgSettings types; extend api.ts with getSearchHistory,\n  getOrgSettings, updateOrgSettings, inviteUser, updateUserRole, suspendUser, deleteUser\n- Fix AppNav tests to use exact string match after Search History link was added\n- Bump orchestrator 0.2.8→0.2.9, user-ui 0.5.3→0.5.4\n- Remove implemented items from docs/features.md\n\n* fix(ci): use GHCR_TOKEN for GHCR push and guard Trivy SARIF upload\n\nGITHUB_TOKEN lacks write_package permission for org-level GHCR packages.\nSwitch all four build jobs to use the GHCR_TOKEN repository secret.\n\nAlso guard each upload-sarif step with hashFiles() so the step is skipped\nrather than erroring when Trivy fails to pull an image and never writes the\n.sarif file.\n\n* docs: add new feature backlog items from product review\n\nAdds 13 new backlog entries across search, observability, alerting, analyst\nworkflow, multi-tenancy, persistence, and accessibility — sourced from an\narchitectural review of the current codebase. Items are sized small/medium\nand scoped to orchestrator, user-ui, or admin-ui.","tree":{"sha":"c103f0d416a167b079403835859a0c3a93acc31a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/trees/c103f0d416a167b079403835859a0c3a93acc31a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/commits/6df48e32670de629b32a59b6f947861d42ab30d3","verification":{"payload":"tree c103f0d416a167b079403835859a0c3a93acc31a\nparent 47c60c1753ce0a9b82dfb4dfa85136d276c5df77\nauthor Shane P <shane@argodevops.co.uk> 1779283191 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779283191 +0100\n\nfeat: Spider platform features — export, graph insights, org self-service, notifications, search history (#28)\n\n* fix(docker): correct server.js path for Next.js monorepo standalone build\n\nWith outputFileTracingRoot set to the monorepo root, Next.js places\nserver.js at .next/standalone/<subdir>/server.js, not at the root.\nUpdate CMD in both UI Dockerfiles to match the actual path, and\ndocument this gotcha in docs/development.md.\n\n* feat: admin-ui navbar fix, notification persistence, and bulk export evidence pack\n\nadmin-ui:\n- Fix organisations pages missing AdminLayout wrapper (navbar/sidebar dropped)\n- Bump admin-ui VERSION 0.3.2 → 0.3.3\n\nnotifications (@spider/shared):\n- Add zustand persist middleware with SSR-safe localStorage storage\n- Cap stored notifications at 50; rehydrate timestamps as Date objects\n- Update tests in both UIs to match new 50-notification cap\n\nbulk export (orchestrator + user-ui):\n- Add GET /api/v1/searches/{searchId}/export endpoint returning ZIP\n- ZIP contains results.csv and audit_trail.csv (full audit trail for the search)\n- Requires ANALYST or ADMIN role; logs EXPORT audit action\n- Add ExportService, EXPORT AuditAction, AuditEntryRepository query\n- Add SearchControllerExportTest with role-gating and error scenarios\n- Add Export Evidence Pack button with spinner to ResultsConsole\n- Bump orchestrator VERSION 0.2.6 → 0.2.7, user-ui VERSION 0.5.1 → 0.5.2\n\n* feat: org-scoped user management and settings self-service\n\nAdd org-admin endpoints (GET/POST/PUT/DELETE /api/v1/org/users, GET/PUT\n/api/v1/org) so tenant ADMIN users can manage their own team and update\nprovisioning/retention settings without Argo superadmin involvement.\n\nOrchestrator:\n- OrgUserController: list, invite, update role, suspend, delete users\n  scoped to calling user''s org via RequestContext\n- OrgSelfController: read and update own org settings (name/slug read-only;\n  provisioningStrategy/resultRetentionDays/searchHistoryDays editable)\n- OrgAdminInterceptor: defence-in-depth ADMIN check at interceptor layer\n  for /api/v1/org/users/** paths; wired in WebMvcConfig\n- OrgSettingsRequest DTO for the editable-fields-only PUT body\n- WebMvcTest unit tests for both controllers (role enforcement, validation)\n- Bump orchestrator VERSION 0.2.7 → 0.2.8\n\nuser-ui:\n- api.ts: fix getOrgUsers to call /api/v1/org/users; add inviteUser,\n  updateUserRole, suspendUser, deleteUser, getOrgSettings, updateOrgSettings\n- types/index.ts: add OrgSettings, OrgSettingsUpdate, UserProvisioningStrategy;\n  document displayName→name mapping on OrgUser\n- team/page.tsx: add Invite User modal, per-row role/suspend/delete actions\n  (ADMIN only), success toasts via useNotificationStore, refresh after action\n- settings/page.tsx: new ADMIN-only org settings page (read-only org details\n  section + editable provisioning strategy, retention days)\n- AppNav.tsx: add Settings nav link (admin-only section)\n- Bump user-ui VERSION 0.5.2 → 0.5.3\n\n* feat: OSINT graph insights, search history, eviction/purge jobs, adapter refactor\n\n- Add GraphInsightsView component with vis-network entity co-occurrence graph,\n  feature-gated behind GRAPH_INSIGHTS flag; upsell placeholder when flag absent\n- Add Results/Graph tab bar to ResultsConsole; Export Evidence Pack button\n- Add search history page (/history) with pagination, status badges, links to results\n- Add Search History and Settings nav links in AppNav; guard Settings to ADMIN only\n- Fix audit page auth guard to use synchronous three-branch pattern (no flash)\n- Add SearchResultEvictionJob (@Scheduled, 5-min default) and SearchHistoryPurgeJob\n  (@Scheduled cron 2am daily) with @EnableScheduling on OrchestratorApplication\n- Extract AdapterUtils.configStr() — removes duplicated private method from\n  TelegramAdapter, XAdapter, PhpbbAdapter, FacebookAdapter, WebSearchAdapter\n- Add SearchHistoryEntry and OrgSettings types; extend api.ts with getSearchHistory,\n  getOrgSettings, updateOrgSettings, inviteUser, updateUserRole, suspendUser, deleteUser\n- Fix AppNav tests to use exact string match after Search History link was added\n- Bump orchestrator 0.2.8→0.2.9, user-ui 0.5.3→0.5.4\n- Remove implemented items from docs/features.md\n\n* fix(ci): use GHCR_TOKEN for GHCR push and guard Trivy SARIF upload\n\nGITHUB_TOKEN lacks write_package permission for org-level GHCR packages.\nSwitch all four build jobs to use the GHCR_TOKEN repository secret.\n\nAlso guard each upload-sarif step with hashFiles() so the step is skipped\nrather than erroring when Trivy fails to pull an image and never writes the\n.sarif file.\n\n* docs: add new feature backlog items from product review\n\nAdds 13 new backlog entries across search, observability, alerting, analyst\nworkflow, multi-tenancy, persistence, and accessibility — sourced from an\narchitectural review of the current codebase. Items are sized small/medium\nand scoped to orchestrator, user-ui, or admin-ui.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDbT3CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKeEQACP5/ALKkb0jHAJsHC+AAlpC\nggz1ZgUZpLcIpXCpBmPkT/T0CE0V5fX//uM8b5jndFysxPlrlazoGa6cxzA4JmJP\nyU0nd2kW93pJAJrIAeHwPrLyu8vHdKjI+jzOsMnFzW5tQeTz6U+aRGzUad5q/+1x\nzQTfXlrsBv0XJmCteUxrybNdNDLZ04+albb9THXHQJLuezmWXlq9a7ZBGAIFbtcs\nDFLufw3puiyK3+fHE95gWoWxI3+WOefIJycsvuHqxlmYxp2xF9G5kKbzGtB3vcGb\n