ow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commit/47c60c1753ce0a9b82dfb4dfa85136d276c5df77","node_id":"C_kwDOSrf_edoAKDQ3YzYwYzE3NTNjZTBhOWI4MmRmYjRkZmE4NTEzNmQyNzZjNWRmNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commit/db6b0b84c088b66e073f2389f2267aa3bfebaae5","sha":"db6b0b84c088b66e073f2389f2267aa3bfebaae5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/db6b0b84c088b66e073f2389f2267aa3bfebaae5"}],"sha":"47c60c1753ce0a9b82dfb4dfa85136d276c5df77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/47c60c1753ce0a9b82dfb4dfa85136d276c5df77"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6948843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shanepreater","id":6948843,"login":"shanepreater","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDg4NDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/db6b0b84c088b66e073f2389f2267aa3bfebaae5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T12:16:41Z","email":"shane@argodevops.co.uk","name":"Shane P"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T12:16:41Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: resolve Flyway V19 seed/migration version conflict (#26)\n\n* fix: dev container Gradle permissions, venv robustness, and test module resolution\n\nThree root causes addressed:\n\n1. Gradle lock-file error in dev container: Docker named volumes are\n   created with root ownership; post-create.sh now runs sudo chown\n   before any Gradle or npm cache access. Also adds ensurepip\n   fallback for Python venv creation.\n\n2. Python venv pip missing: start-debug.sh and test.sh now check for\n   .venv/bin/pip existence (not just .venv/) before using it, and\n   bootstrap ensurepip if needed.\n\n3. GHCR images not found by start-local.sh: adds --build flag that\n   calls build-oci.sh to build images locally before docker compose\n   up; docker-compose.yml gains a build: stanza for ai-engine so\n   compose build works for that service.\n\n4. Jest cannot resolve zustand/next-auth from packages/spider-shared:\n   both user-ui and admin-ui jest.config.ts gain modulePaths pointing\n   at their own node_modules so peer deps of the shared package are\n   found during tests (spider-shared has no node_modules of its own).\n\n* docs: document start-local.sh flags including new --build option\n\n* fix: correct build context for user-ui and admin-ui Docker builds\n\n- build-oci.sh: pass monorepo root as context for user-ui and admin-ui\n  (Dockerfiles reference packages/ outside the subproject dir)\n- test.sh: same fix for Docker dry-run image build checks\n- .devcontainer/Dockerfile: pre-create ~/.gradle and ~/.npm with vscode\n  ownership so named volumes initialise with correct permissions\n- .devcontainer/devcontainer.json: switch from image: to build: to apply\n  the Dockerfile fix\n- .devcontainer/post-create.sh: use write-check instead of blind sudo\n  chown; robust Python venv with ensurepip fallback\n- docs: add TOC to development.md, connectors.md, and hld.md\n\n* docs: add TOC to prototyping.md and ux.md\n\n* fix: renumber conflicting Flyway seed migration V19→V1000\n\ndb/migration/V19 and db/seed/V19 shared the same version number.\nWhen both locations are scanned (local and docker profiles) Flyway\nfails with \"Found more than one migration with version 19\".\n\nRenamed db/seed/V19__reset_organisations.sql to V1000 and documented\nthe convention: db/migration uses V1–V999, db/seed uses V1000+.\n\n* docs: add Gotchas section to development.md and update TOC","tree":{"sha":"5083eee12116fc2bb087b7a1cfa9940a8654d984","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/trees/5083eee12116fc2bb087b7a1cfa9940a8654d984"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/commits/db6b0b84c088b66e073f2389f2267aa3bfebaae5","verification":{"payload":"tree 5083eee12116fc2bb087b7a1cfa9940a8654d984\nparent 61b65709b6892b5c8aabcc0962f667a7e631e671\nauthor Shane P <shane@argodevops.co.uk> 1779279401 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779279401 +0100\n\nfix: resolve Flyway V19 seed/migration version conflict (#26)\n\n* fix: dev container Gradle permissions, venv robustness, and test module resolution\n\nThree root causes addressed:\n\n1. Gradle lock-file error in dev container: Docker named volumes are\n   created with root ownership; post-create.sh now runs sudo chown\n   before any Gradle or npm cache access. Also adds ensurepip\n   fallback for Python venv creation.\n\n2. Python venv pip missing: start-debug.sh and test.sh now check for\n   .venv/bin/pip existence (not just .venv/) before using it, and\n   bootstrap ensurepip if needed.\n\n3. GHCR images not found by start-local.sh: adds --build flag that\n   calls build-oci.sh to build images locally before docker compose\n   up; docker-compose.yml gains a build: stanza for ai-engine so\n   compose build works for that service.\n\n4. Jest cannot resolve zustand/next-auth from packages/spider-shared:\n   both user-ui and admin-ui jest.config.ts gain modulePaths pointing\n   at their own node_modules so peer deps of the shared package are\n   found during tests (spider-shared has no node_modules of its own).\n\n* docs: document start-local.sh flags including new --build option\n\n* fix: correct build context for user-ui and admin-ui Docker builds\n\n- build-oci.sh: pass monorepo root as context for user-ui and admin-ui\n  (Dockerfiles reference packages/ outside the subproject dir)\n- test.sh: same fix for Docker dry-run image build checks\n- .devcontainer/Dockerfile: pre-create ~/.gradle and ~/.npm with vscode\n  ownership so named volumes initialise with correct permissions\n- .devcontainer/devcontainer.json: switch from image: to build: to apply\n  the Dockerfile fix\n- .devcontainer/post-create.sh: use write-check instead of blind sudo\n  chown; robust Python venv with ensurepip fallback\n- docs: add TOC to development.md, connectors.md, and hld.md\n\n* docs: add TOC to prototyping.md and ux.md\n\n* fix: renumber conflicting Flyway seed migration V19→V1000\n\ndb/migration/V19 and db/seed/V19 shared the same version number.\nWhen both locations are scanned (local and docker profiles) Flyway\nfails with \"Found more than one migration with version 19\".\n\nRenamed db/seed/V19__reset_organisations.sql to V1000 and documented\nthe convention: db/migration uses V1–V999, db/seed uses V1000+.\n\n* docs: add Gotchas section to development.md and update TOC","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDaYpCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATTcQADgEZl/1RrhQvb0EooVQ1kCG\nlhwGOWfY14ivGqjaG3i92UNAltTbrW3LKECyq5EkJ6oAttavzsFCNuG3Aersamny\n3mwItXz71ffifXNzgtRaS3