venv creation.\n\n2. Python venv pip missing: start-debug.sh and test.sh now check for\n   .venv/bin/pip existence (not just .venv/) before using it, and\n   bootstrap ensurepip if needed.\n\n3. GHCR images not found by start-local.sh: adds --build flag that\n   calls build-oci.sh to build images locally before docker compose\n   up; docker-compose.yml gains a build: stanza for ai-engine so\n   compose build works for that service.\n\n4. Jest cannot resolve zustand/next-auth from packages/spider-shared:\n   both user-ui and admin-ui jest.config.ts gain modulePaths pointing\n   at their own node_modules so peer deps of the shared package are\n   found during tests (spider-shared has no node_modules of its own).\n\n* docs: document start-local.sh flags including new --build option\n\n* fix: correct build context for user-ui and admin-ui Docker builds\n\n- build-oci.sh: pass monorepo root as context for user-ui and admin-ui\n  (Dockerfiles reference packages/ outside the subproject dir)\n- test.sh: same fix for Docker dry-run image build checks\n- .devcontainer/Dockerfile: pre-create ~/.gradle and ~/.npm with vscode\n  ownership so named volumes initialise with correct permissions\n- .devcontainer/devcontainer.json: switch from image: to build: to apply\n  the Dockerfile fix\n- .devcontainer/post-create.sh: use write-check instead of blind sudo\n  chown; robust Python venv with ensurepip fallback\n- docs: add TOC to development.md, connectors.md, and hld.md\n\n* docs: add TOC to prototyping.md and ux.md","tree":{"sha":"121af32aa0242e863de7a5d70636efc9010caee3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/trees/121af32aa0242e863de7a5d70636efc9010caee3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/commits/61b65709b6892b5c8aabcc0962f667a7e631e671","verification":{"payload":"tree 121af32aa0242e863de7a5d70636efc9010caee3\nparent 16edd25aba6b68bf25aa68d484294bb5124a6b55\nauthor Shane P <shane@argodevops.co.uk> 1779278516 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779278516 +0100\n\nfix: dev container, build scripts, and docs TOCs (#25)\n\n* fix: dev container Gradle permissions, venv robustness, and test module resolution\n\nThree root causes addressed:\n\n1. Gradle lock-file error in dev container: Docker named volumes are\n   created with root ownership; post-create.sh now runs sudo chown\n   before any Gradle or npm cache access. Also adds ensurepip\n   fallback for Python venv creation.\n\n2. Python venv pip missing: start-debug.sh and test.sh now check for\n   .venv/bin/pip existence (not just .venv/) before using it, and\n   bootstrap ensurepip if needed.\n\n3. GHCR images not found by start-local.sh: adds --build flag that\n   calls build-oci.sh to build images locally before docker compose\n   up; docker-compose.yml gains a build: stanza for ai-engine so\n   compose build works for that service.\n\n4. Jest cannot resolve zustand/next-auth from packages/spider-shared:\n   both user-ui and admin-ui jest.config.ts gain modulePaths pointing\n   at their own node_modules so peer deps of the shared package are\n   found during tests (spider-shared has no node_modules of its own).\n\n* docs: document start-local.sh flags including new --build option\n\n* fix: correct build context for user-ui and admin-ui Docker builds\n\n- build-oci.sh: pass monorepo root as context for user-ui and admin-ui\n  (Dockerfiles reference packages/ outside the subproject dir)\n- test.sh: same fix for Docker dry-run image build checks\n- .devcontainer/Dockerfile: pre-create ~/.gradle and ~/.npm with vscode\n  ownership so named volumes initialise with correct permissions\n- .devcontainer/devcontainer.json: switch from image: to build: to apply\n  the Dockerfile fix\n- .devcontainer/post-create.sh: use write-check instead of blind sudo\n  chown; robust Python venv with ensurepip fallback\n- docs: add TOC to development.md, connectors.md, and hld.md\n\n* docs: add TOC to prototyping.md and ux.md","reason":"valid","s