2N2E3ZTYzMWU2NzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commit/16edd25aba6b68bf25aa68d484294bb5124a6b55","sha":"16edd25aba6b68bf25aa68d484294bb5124a6b55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/16edd25aba6b68bf25aa68d484294bb5124a6b55"}],"sha":"61b65709b6892b5c8aabcc0962f667a7e631e671","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/61b65709b6892b5c8aabcc0962f667a7e631e671"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6948843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shanepreater","id":6948843,"login":"shanepreater","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDg4NDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/16edd25aba6b68bf25aa68d484294bb5124a6b55/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T11:57:55Z","email":"shane@argodevops.co.uk","name":"Shane P"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T11:57:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: update trivy-action to v0.36.0 in deploy workflow (#24)\n\n* fix: update trivy-action to v0.36.0 in deploy workflow\n\naquasecurity/trivy-action@0.28.0 has been removed from the marketplace,\ncausing all four build jobs to fail at the vulnerability scan step.\n\n* fix: use monorepo root as Docker build context for user-ui and admin-ui\n\nThe Dockerfiles for both UIs reference packages/ (shared workspace\npackages) outside their own subproject directory. Using the subproject\ndir as context causes \"not found\" errors when Docker tries to COPY those\npaths. Use the repo root as context with --file pointing to the\nDockerfile, matching the deploy.yml CI behaviour.","tree":{"sha":"e9e9277b576a21bea274768552fd49b2fc0de4b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/trees/e9e9277b576a21bea274768552fd49b2fc0de4b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/commits/16edd25aba6b68bf25aa68d484294bb5124a6b55","verification":{"payload":"tree e9e9277b576a21bea274768552fd49b2fc0de4b1\nparent 0ab3e97b684e3e854505c6d0e16ba7dd8d8a5593\nauthor Shane P <shane@argodevops.co.uk> 1779278275 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779278275 +0100\n\nfix: update trivy-action to v0.36.0 in deploy workflow (#24)\n\n* fix: update trivy-action to v0.36.0 in deploy workflow\n\naquasecurity/trivy-action@0.28.0 has been removed from the marketplace,\ncausing all four build jobs to fail at the vulnerability scan step.\n\n* fix: use monorepo root as Docker build context for user-ui and admin-ui\n\nThe Dockerfiles for both UIs reference packages/ (shared workspace\npackages) outside their own subproject directory. Using the subproject\ndir as context causes \"not found\" errors when Docker tries to COPY those\npaths. Use the repo root as context with --file pointing to the\nDockerfile, matching the deploy.yml CI behaviour.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDaHDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwggQAFJgUCJUw3d7hjvxj0l6pWlu\nlYQMWe/EbyW1RS3BLeNpVyWNEGQLsjvwGir1q38QY0/8IxoQMLU3lh9copUcq6Nn\nNniQjLYM05Pq8BPL1RHT+4n2cqVVvunfgszJ9Rf/KeFq0z3Q98cRDK+dbAmIQFex\nMyUzbgoflUI23FFgf6FUFsRPMmGI5Dg/lUExyh46X8DIXcIOQL6efq+VX5fGsqnV