criptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/1d2ac83b8e89d4295e3bd3fbb1a16c31baa76228/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-20T09:06:00Z","email":"shane@argodevops.co.uk","name":"Shane P"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-20T09:06:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add WEB_SEARCH connector, on by default for every organisation (#21)\n\n- Add `WEB_SEARCH` to the Platform enum and all frontend type definitions\n- Implement `WebSearchAdapter`: queries DuckDuckGo HTML (no credentials\n  required); optional `searchEngineUrl` config overrides to a self-hosted\n  SearXNG or similar endpoint; uses Jsoup (already a dependency)\n- Register WEB_SEARCH schema in ConnectorSchemas (one optional field)\n- V20 Flyway migration seeds a system-wide default connector with empty\n  config so web search is available to every org from first boot\n- Update all UI components: ConnectorCard, ConnectorDetails, LiveSourcesPanel,\n  PostCard, ResultsConsole in user-ui; connectors page and DefaultConnectorForm\n  in admin-ui — all include WEB_SEARCH labels, colour (#4a90d9), and icon\n- Fix pact contract tests: update platform regex to include WEB_SEARCH;\n  change `configuration: like({})` to reflect nullable config; update\n  provider states to clear V20-seeded defaults before inserting TELEGRAM\n  test fixtures so list expectations remain deterministic\n- Add Web Search section to docs/connectors.md and \"Adding a new connector\"\n  guide with connector architecture improvement notes to docs/development.md\n- Bump orchestrator 0.2.4→0.2.5, user-ui 0.5.0→0.5.1, admin-ui 0.3.1→0.3.2","tree":{"sha":"9cf4bae3542aecbb62789357cb889a33ac2a41bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/trees/9cf4bae3542aecbb62789357cb889a33ac2a41bc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/commits/1d2ac83b8e89d4295e3bd3fbb1a16c31baa76228","verification":{"payload":"tree 9cf4bae3542aecbb62789357cb889a33ac2a41bc\nparent bc3b4113d6273c6e755eec1b3156008dd268796c\nauthor Shane P <shane@argodevops.co.uk> 1779267960 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779267960 +0100\n\nfeat: add WEB_SEARCH connector, on by default for every organisation (#21)\n\n- Add `WEB_SEARCH` to the Platform enum and all frontend type definitions\n- Implement `WebSearchAdapter`: queries DuckDuckGo HTML (no credentials\n  required); optional `searchEngineUrl` config overrides to a self-hosted\n  SearXNG or similar endpoint; uses Jsoup (already a dependency)\n- Register WEB_SEARCH schema in ConnectorSchemas (one optional field)\n- V20 Flyway migration seeds a system-wide default connector with empty\n  config so web search is available to every org from first boot\n- Update all UI components: ConnectorCard, ConnectorDetails, LiveSourcesPanel,\n  PostCard, ResultsConsole in user-ui; connectors page and DefaultConnectorForm\n  in admin-ui — all include WEB_SEARCH labels, colour (#4a90d9), and icon\n- Fix pact contract tests: update platform regex to include WEB_SEARCH;\n  change `configuration: like({})` to reflect nullable config; update\n  provider states to clear V20-seeded defaults before inserting TELEGRAM\n  test fixtures so list expectations remain deterministic\n- Add Web Search section to docs/connectors.md and \"Adding a new connector\"\n  guide with connector architecture improvement notes to docs/development.md\n- Bump orchestrator 0.2.4→0.2.5, user-ui 0.5.0→0.5.1, admin-ui 0.3.1→0.3.2","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqDXl4CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvkcQAELK79o2sQaSgTZZTcHsYTU5\nW81qqPpc8dSqqMoXNJq9WDEQiwQPzcxSBr7Kjrp1E1zeFQ7kR+M/0k20yioLNiq7\nVTNussiip6vc14Y3YfJmrLgv6cvRHf2DdbAhnrxXMUg1ZlbkFnagKZEGkFqFTXeB\nz+TArINXQMqoihsdZZvsINz14vssN6i/GGimj/T5sIygfJYwPetwgT1ngx3+DkN/\nCOh0PfHDQp8N9robGabah2N5YU4lmph1vlkWK/Pg1S8hBMJ4EaeK