shane@argodevops.co.uk","name":"Shane P"},"message":"refactor: extract shared packages (@spider/shared, @spider/ui)\n\nSets up npm workspaces at the monorepo root with two new packages:\n\n@spider/shared (packages/spider-shared):\n- Shared domain types: Role, UserStatus, Platform, PaginatedResponse\n- buildAuthOptions() — single Keycloak next-auth config for both apps\n- useNotificationStore / undismissedCount — Zustand notification store\n- next-auth.d.ts module augmentation\n\n@spider/ui (packages/spider-ui):\n- SessionProviderWrapper — identical in both apps, now shared\n- ToastContainer — parameterised notification toasts\n- Footer — parameterised with appName and optional className\n\nBoth apps updated to:\n- Declare @spider/shared and @spider/ui workspace deps\n- Add tsconfig.json path aliases for direct source resolution\n- Add transpilePackages in next.config.mjs for Next.js bundling\n- Import shared types, store, auth config, and components from packages\n- Delete 10 local files that were duplicated across both apps\n\ndocs/development.md: new Shared Packages section documenting how to\nadd types, components, and install workspace dependencies.","tree":{"sha":"a65824eaf8d0837af8f69fcbea4dc1acd2e4b0ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/trees/a65824eaf8d0837af8f69fcbea4dc1acd2e4b0ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/commits/04831020f0defbd6dab4158f2944880a5bab69bd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6948843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shanepre