er-ui admin views\n\nadmin-ui:\n- Organisations list page with TierBadge, seat-usage bar, OrgExpiryBadge\n- Create Organisation modal backed by OrgForm with full validation\n- Org detail page with Overview, Users, and License tabs (edit-in-place)\n- Users tab: org-scoped user table, Add User modal, Suspend/Activate\n- License tab: view/assign/update tier, seats, expiry\n- Zustand orgsStore with loading/saving/error per operation\n- Users and Licenses nav items replaced by Organisations; old routes redirect\n- Bump admin-ui to 0.3.0\n\nuser-ui:\n- Team page (/team): org-scoped user table, ADMIN-only\n- Audit Log page (/audit): paginated org-scoped events with prev/next\n- AppNav shows Team and Audit icons only when session role is ADMIN\n- New OrgUser, AuditEntry, PaginatedResponse types; getOrgUsers/getOrgAuditLog API calls\n- Bump user-ui to 0.5.0\n\ndocs:\n- SSO & Authentication, Admin UI Organisations Module, and User UI Admin Views\n  sections added to both features.md and docs/features.md\n- Planned items updated to mark completed work","tree":{"sha":"bbf1b193fd6d929ea47686b0784d6ecedbb4b77f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/trees/bbf1b193fd6d929ea47686b0784d6ecedbb4b77f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/commits/0b449cd5a921fe97c03f7c34273d206b2e0dc5e3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6948843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shanepreater","id":6948843,"login":"shanepreater","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDg4NDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.