cripts): guard empty env_args array in stop-local.sh\n\nbash nounset (-u) treats an empty array expansion as unbound.\nWrapping the docker compose call in set +u / set -u avoids the error\nwhen .env doesn''t exist and env_args is empty.","tree":{"sha":"b5f773dce3a32563219ea9862d0a46ff21d26200","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/trees/b5f773dce3a32563219ea9862d0a46ff21d26200"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/commits/8818b1029a257b82dbf818284a1c81a28af73798","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6948843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shanepreater","id":6948843,"login":"shanepreater","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDg4NDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commit/8818b1029a257b82dbf818284a1c81a28af73798","node_id":"C_kwDOSrf_edoAKDg4MThiMTAyOWEyNTdiODJkYmY4MTgyODRhMWM4MWEyOGFmNzM3OTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commit/9d2407b9b5a50e12f0a553ad6330b1c58889ee1b","sha":"9d2407b9b5a50e12f0a553ad6330b1c58889ee1b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/9d2407b9b5a50e12f0a553ad6330b1c58889ee1b"}],"sha":"8818b1029a257b82dbf818284a1c81a28af73798","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/8818b1029a257b82dbf818284a1c81a28af73798"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6948843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shanepreater","id":6948843,"login":"shanepreater","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDg4NDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/9d2407b9b5a50e12f0a553ad6330b1c58889ee1b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T15:35:25Z","email":"shane@argodevops.co.uk","name":"Shane P"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T15:35:25Z","email":"shane@argodevops.co.uk","name":"Shane P"},"message":"feat: Keycloak SSO, docker Spring profile, and canonical seed data\n\nSSO (next-auth v4 with Keycloak):\n- user-ui and admin-ui: install next-auth, add auth config, API route,\n  middleware, SessionProviderWrapper, and next-auth type declarations\n- Login pages replaced with single-button Keycloak redirect\n- api.ts / adminApi.ts: read X-User-Email, X-User-Role, X-Organisation-Id\n  from next-auth session instead of hardcoded env vars or localStorage\n- Separate KEYCLOAK_EXTERNAL_URL (browser redirect) from\n  KEYCLOAK_INTERNAL_URL (container-to-container token exchange) to avoid\n  Docker network routing issues\n- KC_HOSTNAME=localhost + KC_HOSTNAME_PORT fixes issuer consistency so\n  JWT iss claim matches from both browser and server-side validation\n\nOrchestrator docker profile:\n- application-docker.yml activated via SPRING_PROFILES_ACTIVE=docker in\n  docker-compose; enables db/seed Flyway location and sets CORS defaults\n- V19 seed migration in db/seed: resets orgs/licenses/users to canonical\n  three-org structure (Argo Enterprise 50 seats 5y, Acme Professional 10\n  seats 2y, Beta Starter 3 seats 2y); removes old example.com addresses\n- SPIDER_DEFAULT_ORG_ID now points to the real Acme org UUID\n\nKeycloak realm:\n- Clients converted to confidential (client secrets) for next-auth server flow\n- New users with NCSC three-word passwords replacing Spider1! credentials:\n  admin@argodevops.co.uk, user@argodevops.co.uk, admin@acme.com,\n  user@acme.com, admin@beta.com, user@beta.com\n\nEnv var audit (docker-compose.yml):\n- user-ui and admin-ui now receive all SSO env vars\n- NEXTAUTH_SECRET documented in .env.example\n\nBumps: orchestrator 0.2.3, user-ui 0.3.9, admin-ui 0.2.13.","tree":{"sha":"08c2b914145d28249088222d04f511831de078da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/trees/08c2b914145d28249088222d04f511831de078da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/commits/9d2407b9b5a50e12f0a553ad6330b1c58889ee1b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6948843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/following{/other_us