and stream\n\nActions sit inside the Live column as a card between the connector selector\nand the results stream, replacing the previous top bar and vertical panel.\nUnlicensed actions remain greyed out with plan-upgrade tooltip.","tree":{"sha":"6ffadccfceff1ca0a047b3d83f5b3e1824c03fa9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/trees/6ffadccfceff1ca0a047b3d83f5b3e1824c03fa9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/commits/46a57b5e8ab57fc2787936c2c1f0cafe903e3d46","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6948843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shanepreater","id":6948843,"login":"shanepreater","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDg4NDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commit/46a57b5e8ab57fc2787936c2c1f0cafe903e3d46","node_id":"C_kwDOSrf_edoAKDQ2YTU3YjVlOGFiNTdmYzI3ODc5MzZjMmMxZjBjYWZlOTAzZTNkNDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commit/9cb2ec41bcb1f8f022bc8c96ffadb4a5143273d8","sha":"9cb2ec41bcb1f8f022bc8c96ffadb4a5143273d8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/9cb2ec41bcb1f8f022bc8c96ffadb4a5143273d8"}],"sha":"46a57b5e8ab57fc2787936c2c1f0cafe903e3d46","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/46a57b5e8ab57fc2787936c2c1f0cafe903e3d46"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6948843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shanepreater","id":6948843,"login":"shanepreater","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NDg4NDM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/commits/9cb2ec41bcb1f8f022bc8c96ffadb4a5143273d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-19T08:06:42Z","email":"shane@argodevops.co.uk","name":"Shane P"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-19T08:06:42Z","email":"shane@argodevops.co.uk","name":"Shane P"},"message":"feat: structured licence enforcement, search actions panel, and licence generation UI\n\n- LicenseViolationException with Reason enum (EXPIRED/NOT_PERMITTED/NOT_FOUND);\n  @RestControllerAdvice returns ProblemDetail 403 with reason field so the\n  frontend can surface a meaningful message instead of a raw status code\n- FeatureSwitchService.requireFeature() checks licence expiry before granting\n  access; expiry also respected in isEnabled() for feature-gate queries\n- GET /api/v1/features returns the search features enabled for the current org;\n  user-ui fetches this on load and uses it to gate action buttons\n- Search actions moved from top bar to a vertical panel between Live and Insight;\n  unlicensed actions are greyed out with a \"Plan upgrade required\" label\n- Debug org switcher (dev only): floating panel stores chosen org in localStorage\n  and injects X-Organisation-Id header; enables STARTER/PROFESSIONAL/ENTERPRISE\n  comparison without restarting the server\n- V16 dev seed: Acme downgraded to STARTER, Acme Professional added at\n  PROFESSIONAL tier for side-by-side feature enforcement testing\n- Admin-ui licence page gains a Generate Licence tab: org selector, tier picker,\n  seat count, optional expiry; backed by POST /api/v1/admin/license/generate\n  which creates or replaces the organisation''s licence\n- GET /api/v1/admin/license/organisations exposes all orgs for the dropdown\n- user-ui api.ts parses ProblemDetail 403 bodies and uses the reason code as\n  the notification title for licence-related errors","tree":{"sha":"ee3303652d0778846ffc5389f6bbff0da4fca903","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/trees/ee3303652d0778846ffc5389f6bbff0da4fca903"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Rsam1993/spider-monorepo/git/commits/9cb2ec41bcb1f8f022bc8c96ffadb4a5143273d8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6948843?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shanepreater/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shanepreater","id":6948843,"login":"shaneprea