ackward-compatible StartupOS module (new\ncommands, agent skills, docs, templates, memory model, and integrations;\nnothing in existing Praxis behavior changes). Added a \"startupos\" keyword and\ncut the CHANGELOG [Unreleased] section to [1.17.0].\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXgLZJQaYPVQWQeRCzVxif","tree":{"sha":"1c456e87dcdbf2681da3c7922669453919e84e17","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/1c456e87dcdbf2681da3c7922669453919e84e17"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/016036f4186265030b58c26538a19d39fc98ad9a","verification":{"payload":"tree 1c456e87dcdbf2681da3c7922669453919e84e17\nparent 438311ee439b6d7edddacadf040317150ad9f24a\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782473694 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782473694 +0000\n\nBump plugin version to 1.17.0 (StartupOS module)\n\nMinor bump for the additive, backward-compatible StartupOS module (new\ncommands, agent skills, docs, templates, memory model, and integrations;\nnothing in existing Praxis behavior changes). Added a \"startupos\" keyword and\ncut the CHANGELOG [Unreleased] section to [1.17.0].\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXgLZJQaYPVQWQeRCzVxif\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQKNbuDjr\nZscphLc1Hiitf5bk/E5kr4nQr5nURF9mzEpmLU3KAhaG0X8Sx6Voi1j88tUbQKdYrticQ2Jw1ruv\nVg4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-26T11:34:56Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marcrabadan/praxis/commit/016036f4186265030b58c26538a19d39fc98ad9a","node_id":"C_kwDOSroCA9oAKDAxNjAzNmY0MTg2MjY1MDMwYjU4YzI2NTM4YTE5ZDM5ZmM5OGFkOWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marcrabadan/praxis/commit/438311ee439b6d7edddacadf040317150ad9f24a","sha":"438311ee439b6d7edddacadf040317150ad9f24a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/438311ee439b6d7edddacadf040317150ad9f24a"}],"sha":"016036f4186265030b58c26538a19d39fc98ad9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/016036f4186265030b58c26538a19d39fc98ad9a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/438311ee439b6d7edddacadf040317150ad9f24a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T09:32:24Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T09:32:24Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Flatten StartupOS commands to /startupos-<name> (fix PR #37 P1)\n\nThe automated reviewer correctly flagged that .claude/commands/startupos/*.md\ndoes NOT register as /startupos:<name>: per the Claude Code docs, a\n.claude/commands/ command takes its name from the file name, and a subdirectory\nis not part of the command name (it only shows in the description). So the docs\nadvertised commands Claude Code would not register on the CLI/desktop.\n\nFix: move the 11 commands to flat files .claude/commands/startupos-<name>.md so\nthey register as /startupos-<name> — guaranteed by the documented naming rule,\nidentical across CLI/desktop/web, and still grouped by the startupos- prefix.\n\n- Renamed .claude/commands/startupos/<name>.md -> startupos-<name>.md (11),\n  fixed their internal link depth (../../../ -> ../../) and self-references.\n- Replaced the plugin dir symlink with 11 flat command symlinks.\n- build_integrations.py reads startupos-<name>.md and matches the new link depth.\n- Replaced /startupos:<name> -> /startupos-<name> across all skills, docs,\n  templates, README, GitHub page, and CHANGELOG; rewrote the commands.md naming\n  note to describe the real Claude Code behavior. The flat commands now also\n  appear in SKILLS.md (build_catalog globs flat command files).\n\nVerified: catalog-check, integrations-check (170 files), validate-all,\nvalidate-harness, and 120 unit tests all pass; no `startupos:` colon form\nremains anywhere in the repo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXgLZJQaYPVQWQeRCzVxif","tree":{"sha":"4480f90bf4dc97d08b2fc856e5ba8037121afd84","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/4480f90bf4dc97d08b2fc856e5ba8037121afd84"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/438311ee439b6d7edddacadf040317150ad9f24a","verification":{"payload":"tree 4480f90bf4dc97d08b2fc856e5ba8037121afd84\nparent 0c0935d024468d1209a12f384664c6c8b73e46ef\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782466344 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782466344 +0000\n\nFlatten StartupOS commands to /startupos-<name> (fix PR #37 P1)\n\nThe automated reviewer correctly flagged that .claude/commands/startupos/*.md\ndoes NOT register as /startupos:<name>: per the Claude Code docs, a\n.claude/commands/ command takes its name from the file name, and a subdirectory\nis not part of the command name (it only shows in the description). So the docs\nadvertised commands Claude Code would not register on the CLI/desktop.\n\nFix: move the 11 commands to flat files .claude/commands/startupos-<name>.md so\nthey register as /startupos-<name> — guaranteed by the documented naming rule,\nidentical across CLI/desktop/web, and still grouped by the startupos- prefix.\n\n- Renamed .claude/commands/startupos/<name>.md -> startupos-<name>.md (11),\n  fixed their internal link depth (../../../ -> ../../) and self-references.\n- Replaced the plugin dir symlink with 11 flat command symlinks.\n- build_integrations.py reads startupos-<name>.md and matches the new link depth.\n- Replaced /startupos:<name> -> /startupos-<name> across all skills, docs,\n  templates, README, GitHub page, and CHANGELOG; rewrote the commands.md naming\n  note to describe the real Claude Code behavior. The flat commands now also\n  appear in SKILLS.md (build_catalog globs flat command files).\n\nVerified: catalog-check, integrations-check (170 files), validate-all,\nvalidate-harness, and 120 unit tests all pass; no `startupos:` colon form\nremains anywhere in the repo.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXgLZJQaYPVQWQeRCzVxif\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOmC2Rd3\nffD5gDry3AwjjQQWXU2HAi7tg64l2/ha4r+j664gwP37Wgnlmy95VU7NI+4KwXeKbLcbjrfW47es\ncwU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-26T09:32:27Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marcrabadan/praxis/commit/438311ee439b6d7edddacadf040317150ad9f24a","node_id":"C_kwDOSroCA9oAKDQzODMxMWVlNDM5YjZkN2VkZGRhY2FkZjA0MDMxNzE1MGFkOWYyNGE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marcrabadan/praxis/commit/0c0935d024468d1209a12f384664c6c8b73e46ef","sha":"0c0935d024468d1209a12f384664c6c8b73e46ef","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/0c0935d024468d1209a12f384664c6c8b73e46ef"}],"sha":"438311ee439b6d7edddacadf040317150ad9f24a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/438311ee439b6d7edddacadf040317150ad9f24a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/0c0935d024468d1209a12f384664c6c8b73e46ef/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T09:22:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T09:22:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Make StartupOS discoverable from Cursor''s always-on rule\n\nAudit of the Cursor and IntelliJ integrations for the same discoverability gap\nfixed in Codex: IntelliJ''s always-read guidelines.md already pointed to\nStartupOS, but Cursor''s always-applied praxis.mdc rule did not — so an agent\nreading the entry rule wouldn''t know StartupOS exists (the praxis-startupos rule\nis only description-gated). Added a concise StartupOS pointer to praxis.mdc; the\nfull roster stays in the description-gated praxis-startupos rule. Cursor/IntelliJ\ninstall steps (cp -R) already carry every StartupOS file, so no install gap.\n\nVerified: make integrations-check, catalog-check, validate-harness, and 120\nunit tests all pass. Integration file count unchanged (170).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXgLZJQaYPVQWQeRCzVxif","tree":{"sha":"0940e80bb5fdf32631646e56263dd143d5e4d0d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/0940e80bb5fdf32631646e56263dd143d5e4d0d2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/0c0935d024468d1209a12f384664c6c8b73e46ef","verification":{"payload":"tree 0940e80bb5fdf32631646e56263dd143d5e4d0d2\nparent 7ab241857026c93eec0839db904ea6e70d814d4d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782465759 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782465759 +0000\n\nMake StartupOS discoverable from Cursor''s always-on rule\n\nAudit of the Cursor and IntelliJ integrations for the same discoverability gap\nfixed in Codex: IntelliJ''s always-read guidelines.md already pointed to\nStartupOS, but Cursor''s always-applied praxis.mdc rule did not — so an agent\nreading the entry rule wouldn''t know StartupOS exists (the praxis-startupos rule\nis only description-gated). Added a concise StartupOS pointer to praxis.mdc; the\nfull roster stays in the description-gated praxis-startupos rule. Cursor/IntelliJ\ninstall steps (cp -R) already carry every StartupOS file, so no install gap.\n\nVerified: make integrations-check, catalog-check, validate-harness, and 120\nunit tests all pass. Integration file count unchanged (170).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXgLZJQaYPVQWQeRCzVxif\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQK0MMY51\n3lOmeZLULJxjt74VgbKfqNjnomGW/eNQ95sc9fNCRv1HscWfah3r9eXDh2gxsWOU0lvl/PJ5RH94\n8