om/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/7ab241857026c93eec0839db904ea6e70d814d4d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T09:20:11Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T09:20:11Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Fix Codex integration gaps for StartupOS\n\nThe first Codex pass left StartupOS unreachable through the documented install:\nthe roster lived in a separate AGENTS.startupos.md that the README''s install\nsteps never wired in (step 1 appends only AGENTS.praxis.md), AGENTS.praxis.md\nitself never mentioned StartupOS (unlike IntelliJ''s guidelines.md), and\nappending both AGENTS files would have duplicated the harness note.\n\nFix by folding the StartupOS roster into AGENTS.praxis.md as an \"optional\npre-build module\" section (symmetric with the IntelliJ guidelines section) and\ndropping the separate AGENTS.startupos.md, so the single documented append\n(install step 1) wires the whole roster. Updated the Codex README install/use\nsteps to note the startupos-* guides and /praxis-startupos-* prompts ride along\nwith the existing copy steps, and fixed the stray AGENTS.startupos.md references\nin integrations/README.md and the changelog.\n\nIntegration file count 171 → 170. Verified: make integrations-check,\ncatalog-check, validate-harness, and 120 unit tests all pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXgLZJQaYPVQWQeRCzVxif","tree":{"sha":"9fcdb7dc132cbf4663a5f3eb9e84d48546bad441","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/9fcdb7dc132cbf4663a5f3eb9e84d48546bad441"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/7ab241857026c93eec0839db904ea6e70d814d4d","verification":{"payload":"tree 9fcdb7dc132cbf4663a5f3eb9e84d48546bad441\nparent 5f072dc0b677a1fe08615eb05c9b7a29fb19ca42\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782465611 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782465611 +0000\n\nFix Codex integration gaps for StartupOS\n\nThe first Codex pass left StartupOS unreachable through the documented install:\nthe roster lived in a separate AGENTS.startupos.md that the README''s install\nsteps never wired in (step 1 appends only AGENTS.praxis.md), AGENTS.praxis.md\nitself never mentioned StartupOS (unlike IntelliJ''s guidelines.md), and\nappending both AGENTS files would have duplicated the harness note.\n\nFix by folding the StartupOS roster into AGENTS.praxis.md as an \"optional\npre-build module\" section (symmetric with the IntelliJ guidelines section) and\ndropping the separate AGENTS.startupos.md, so the single documented append\n(install step 1) wires the whole roster. Updated the Codex README install/use\nsteps to note the startupos-* guides and /praxis-startupos-* prompts ride along\nwith the existing copy steps, and fixed the stray AGENTS.startupos.md references\nin integrations/README.md and the changelog.\n\nIntegration file count 171 → 170. Verified: make integrations-check,\ncatalog-check, validate-harness, and 120 unit tests all pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXgLZJQaYPVQWQeRCzVxif\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1l