":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/5f072dc0b677a1fe08615eb05c9b7a29fb19ca42/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:51:40Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:51:40Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Generate Cursor/Codex/IntelliJ integrations for StartupOS\n\nExtend build_integrations.py to re-express the StartupOS module in each IDE''s\nnative format, as a parallel, namespaced set so the SDLC-expert outputs are\nuntouched (integrations-check still green).\n\nPer tool, StartupOS now ships:\n- 12 agent persona guides (praxis-startupos-* Cursor rules, .praxis/startupos-*.md\n  Codex guides, .junie/praxis/startupos-*.md Junie guides), bundled from each\n  skill''s SKILL.md + practices + checklist.\n- the 11 lifecycle commands as /startupos-* (Cursor) and /praxis-startupos-*\n  (Codex) prompts, with Claude-only skill-loading mechanics rewritten to\n  persona-guide references.\n- a StartupOS roster doc (praxis-startupos rule, AGENTS.startupos.md,\n  .junie/praxis-startupos.md) and a mention in each tool README.\n\nGenerated output grows 99 → 171 files. Verified: make integrations-check,\ncatalog-check, validate-all, validate-harness, and 120 unit tests all pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXgLZJQaYPVQWQeRCzVxif","tree":{"sha":"0205c8a72e4bbda9b35f870c1cb9008038ed734e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/0205c8a72e4bbda9b35f870c1cb9008038ed734e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/5f072dc0b677a1fe08615eb05c9b7a29fb19ca42","verification":{"payload":"tree 0205c8a72e4bbda9b35f870c1cb9008038ed734e\nparent ac752aa79846828a2ae76549a216a143d6bbf731\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782463900 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782463900 +0000\n\nGenerate Cursor/Codex/IntelliJ integrations for StartupOS\n\nExtend build_integrations.py to re-express the StartupOS module in each IDE''s\nnative format, as a parallel, namespaced set so the SDLC-expert outputs are\nuntouched (integrations-check still green).\n\nPer tool, StartupOS now ships:\n- 12 agent persona guides (praxis-startupos-* Cursor rules, .praxis/startupos-*.md\n  Codex guides, .junie/praxis/startupos-*.md Junie guides), bundled from each\n  skill''s SKILL.md + practices + checklist.\n- the 11 lifecycle commands as /startupos-* (Cursor) and /praxis-startupos-*\n  (Codex) prompts, with Claude-only skill-loading mechanics rewritten to\n  persona-guide references.\n- a StartupOS roster doc (praxis-startupos rule, AGENTS.startupos.md,\n  .junie/praxis-startupos.md) and a mention in each tool README.\n\nGenerated output grows 99 → 171 files. Verified: make integrations-check,\ncatalog-check, validate-all, validate-harness, and 120 unit tests all pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXgLZJQaYPVQWQeRCzVxif\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQK+vooHO\nEocuDDSBaNSH0wnmrjQM2TZRaUoEDMXWlekvCZje7POoh6Jvnzbq4gj3WMdqV3L/RjQmhfhtAMH6\noA0=\n-----