,"id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/ac752aa79846828a2ae76549a216a143d6bbf731/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:43:19Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T08:43:19Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Refactor StartupOS agents into real Claude Code skills (doctrine-aligned)\n\nFollow the repo''s skill-factory doctrine: each StartupOS agent persona is now\na real, validated Claude Code skill (like the SDLC experts), and every\n/startupos:* command loads the relevant agent skill(s) and reasons in-persona\ninstead of embedding the persona only in docs.\n\n- 12 Tier 2 agent skills under .claude/skills/startupos-* (ceo, vc-partner,\n  market-analyst, customer-researcher, business-designer, product-strategist,\n  financial-analyst, gtm-strategist, cto, ai-architect, security-officer,\n  legal-compliance), each with SKILL.md + references/{practices,checklist}.md.\n  All pass validate_skill.py.\n- The 11 /startupos:* commands now load the matching skills (the command holds\n  the per-stage workflow; the skill holds the persona doctrine), mirroring how\n  /architect loads software-architect and /new-feature orchestrates the experts.\n- Symlinked the 12 skills into plugin-praxis/skills/.\n- Regenerated SKILLS.md (now 31 skills); updated docs/startupos/agents.md and\n  commands.md (agents are skills, not self-contained), README, and CHANGELOG.\n\nVerified: make validate-all, catalog-check, integrations-check (99 files,\nunchanged), validate-harness, and 120 unit tests all pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXgLZJQaYPVQWQeRCzVxif","tree":{"sha":"a4893c4d3c8d2e78648537fee593a3a73ca2218d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/a4893c4d3c8d2e78648537fee593a3a73ca2218d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/ac752aa79846828a2ae76549a216a143d6bbf731","verification":{"payload":"tree a4893c4d3c8d2e78648537fee593a3a73ca2218d\nparent 1e5f0f1523f09b98ef55b02d9fe34ed533b951db\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782463399 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782463399 +0000\n\nRefactor StartupOS agents into real Claude Code skills (doctrine-aligned)\n\nFollow the repo''s skill-factory doctrine: each StartupOS agent persona is now\na real, validated Claude Code skill (like the SDLC experts), and every\n/startupos:* command loads the relevant agent skill(s) and reasons in-persona\ninstead of embedding the persona only in docs.\n\n- 12 Tier 2 agent skills under .claude/skills/startupos-* (ceo, vc-partner,\n  market-analyst, customer-researcher, business-designer, product-strategist,\n  financial-analyst, gtm-strategist, cto, ai-architect, security-officer,\n  legal-compliance), each with SKILL.md + references/{practices,checklist}.md.\n  All pass validate_skill.py.\n- The 11 /startupos:* commands now load the matching skills (the command holds\n  the per-stage workflow; the skill holds the persona doctrine), mirroring how\n  /architect loads software-architect and /new-feature orchestrates the experts.\n- Symlinked the 12 skills into plugin-praxis/skills/.\n- Regenerated SKILLS.md (now 31 skills); updated docs/startupos/agents.md and\n  commands.md (agents are skills, not self-contained), README, and CHANGELOG.\n\nVerified: make validate-all, catalog-check, integrations-check (99 files,\nunchanged), validate-harness, and 120 unit tests all pass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXgLZJQaYPVQWQeRCzVxif\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQFDhe2eH\nCkQPkmXIoh3hGOmEcJ5ckmlUe8ngsP1XB7dOq+Dr60/JO6qWalStOTutz/9Mpe1hkTlugdbn4wOx\ntg0=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-26T08:43:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marcrabadan/praxis/commit/ac752aa79846828a2ae76549a216a143d6bbf731","node_id":"C_kwDOSroCA9oAKGFjNzUyYWE3OTg0NjgyOGEyYWU3NjU0OWEyMTZhMTQzZDZiYmY3MzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marcrabadan/praxis/commit/1e5f0f1523f09b98ef55b02d9fe34ed533b951db","sha":"1e5f0f1523f09b98ef55b02d9fe34ed533b951db","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/1e5f0f1523f09b98ef55b02d9fe34ed533b951db"}],"sha":"ac752aa79846828a2ae76549a216a143d6bbf731","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/ac752aa79846828a2ae76549a216a143d6bbf731"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/1e5f0f1523f09b98ef55b02d9fe34ed533b951db/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-26T07:53:58Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-26T07:53:58Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add StartupOS module: pre-build discovery → validation → Praxis handoff\n\nStartupOS is an optional, AI-native front door layered on top of Praxis.\nPraxis answers \"how do we build it correctly?\"; StartupOS answers \"what\nshould we build, why, for whom, and how do we turn it into a company?\" It\ndiscovers, validates, and designs startup/business ideas, then hands a\nPraxis-ready project to the existing lifecycle. No existing Praxis behavior\nchanges — the new commands live in a namespaced subdirectory that the flat\ncatalog/integration generators ignore (verified: catalog-check,\nintegrations-check, validate-harness, and 120 unit tests all pass).\n\n- Commands: .claude/commands/startupos/ (11, namespaced /startupos:*),\n  symlinked into plugin-praxis/commands/.\n- Docs: docs/startupos/ (vision, lifecycle, commands, templates, agents,\n  memory, guardrails, praxis-integration, integrations).\n- Templates: docs/startupos/templates/ (13).\n- Memory model: memory/startupos/ with the \"never invent facts\" labeling\n  discipline (fact/assumption/estimate/hypothesis).\n- Guardrails: mandatory human gates before idea selection and Praxis export;\n  reject weak ideas; always include risks and validation experiments.\n- README + GitHub Pages updated with a StartupOS section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXgLZJQaYPVQWQeRCzVxif","tree":{"sha":"b7aeaa0d878c6d368915c9628836db70eaa6fd01","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/b7aeaa0d878c6d368915c9628836db70eaa6fd01"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/1e5f0f1523f09b98ef55b02d9fe34ed533b951db","verification":{"payload":"tree b7aeaa0d878c6d368915c9628836db70eaa6fd01\nparent 1f8f7a789909ddb30d063d3bee844d8582d6de97\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782460438 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782460438 +0000\n\nAdd StartupOS module: pre-build discovery → validation → Praxis handoff\n\nStartupOS is an optional, AI-native front door layered on top of Praxis.\nPraxis answers \"how do we build it correctly?\"; StartupOS answers \"what\nshould we build, why, for whom, and how do we turn it into a company?\" It\ndiscovers, validates, and designs startup/business ideas, then hands a\nPraxis-ready project to the existing lifecycle. No existing Praxis behavior\nchanges — the new commands live in a namespaced subdirectory that the flat\ncatalog/integration generators ignore (verified: catalog-check,\nintegrations-check, validate-harness, and 120 unit tests all pass).\n\n- Commands: .claude/commands/startupos/ (11, namespaced /startupos:*),\n  symlinked into plugin-praxis/commands/.\n- Docs: docs/startupos/ (vision, lifecycle, commands, templates, agents,\n  memory, guardrails, praxis-integration, integrations).\n- Templates: docs/startupos/templates/ (13).\n- Memory model: memory/startupos/ with the \"never invent facts\" labeling\n  discipline (fact/assumption/estimate/hypothesis).\n- Guardrails: mandatory human gates before idea selection and Praxis export;\n  reject weak ideas; always include risks and validation experiments.\n- README + GitHub Pages updated with a StartupOS section.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01YXgLZJQaYPVQWQeRCzVxif\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIQyTPTA\nrlS/6Qzz8I/TGVaCxrbshqh80odsOd+o/8Mww6hdD+AbJdf45xB7XARXv/tsyu3JQ7gi9IPANWaJ\nsQI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-26T07:54:04Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","u