,"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/43060c462608eb8bc625838d60840709aac5ab2a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-24T10:38:14Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-24T10:38:14Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"fix(integrations): bundle experience-grounding into a portable guide\n\nAddress PR review (P2): the generated Cursor/Codex/IntelliJ persona guides\nbundled only SKILL.md + practices.md + checklist.md, so the new workflow and\nreference links in ux-ui-engineer''s SKILL.md pointed at files absent from the\nported integrations — unusable outside Claude Code.\n\n- Emit a self-contained per-tool experience-grounding guide that inlines every\n  workflow body and every extra reference (the grounding bundle).\n- Redirect the persona guide''s Workflows section and extra-reference bullets to\n  that grounding guide, so the persona guide carries no dangling links.\n- Cursor ships it as a description-gated rule (attaches only for grounding\n  tasks, not always-on); Codex/IntelliJ ship it beside the persona guide and\n  index it.\n\nGeneralized via _has_grounding (any skill with workflows/), so future tier-3\npersonas port the same way.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014nYsgMFCbLr8LGMmZ2Jawb","tree":{"sha":"7caa4b6524f1e6acabb97d8013758b48a06b45f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/7caa4b6524f1e6acabb97d8013758b48a06b45f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/43060c462608eb8bc625838d60840709aac5ab2a","verification":{"payload":"tree 7caa4b6524f1e6acabb97d8013758b48a06b45f4\nparent 0fc5009f6a865119b9581439300a19b059a0b8ef\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782297494 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782297494 +0000\n\nfix(integrations): bundle experience-grounding into a portable guide\n\nAddress PR review (P2): the generated Cursor/Codex/IntelliJ persona guides\nbundled only SKILL.md + practices.md + checklist.md, so the new workflow and\nreference links in ux-ui-engineer''s SKILL.md pointed at files absent from the\nported integrations — unusable outside Claude Code.\n\n- Emit a self-contained per-tool experience-grounding guide that inlines every\n  workflow body and every extra reference (the grounding bundle).\n- Redirect the persona guide''s Workflows section and extra-reference bullets to\n  that grounding guide, so the persona guide carries no dangling links.\n- Cursor ships it as a description-gated rule (attaches only for grounding\n  tasks, not always-on); Codex/IntelliJ ship it beside the persona guide and\n  index it.\n\nGeneralized via _has_grounding (any skill with workflows/), so future tier-3\npersonas port the same way.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014nYsgMFCbLr8LGMmZ2Jawb\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAA