nces (UX comprehension & friction, imagery &\n  taste, landing & conversion, gate-phase map, interview protocol,\n  implementation guardrails, governance articles, design-rationale block).\n- Drop duplicate gate references; repoint accessibility, usability, tokens,\n  components, hierarchy, IA, content, and QA gates to the existing\n  practices.md and checklist.md.\n- Update SKILL.md (description, when-to-use, workflows, references) and\n  regenerate SKILLS.md.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014nYsgMFCbLr8LGMmZ2Jawb","tree":{"sha":"bd6f82fb542ead655b6689d3651e2e0a74f6f4fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/bd6f82fb542ead655b6689d3651e2e0a74f6f4fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/fc9bf3f2bc383163bb1f1b84d91609e2fff0298e","verification":{"payload":"tree bd6f82fb542ead655b6689d3651e2e0a74f6f4fb\nparent 14b445ce270b2394501cf0f978190279f7cd1f2d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782293993 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782293993 +0000\n\nfeat(ux-ui-engineer): add spec-driven experience-grounding workflows\n\nFold the spec-driven experience-grounding capability into the existing\nux-ui-engineer skill as a non-owning workflow set, rather than a new\ntop-level skill (per the repo''s promotion policy).\n\n- Bump ux-ui-engineer to tier 3 (gains workflows/) and version 1.1.0.\n- Add five experience-grounding workflows: guided run, governance seed,\n  phase contributions, design-system/Figma grounding, and design checklist.\n- Add eight net-new references (UX comprehension & friction, imagery &\n  taste, landing & conversion, gate-phase map, interview protocol,\n  implementation guardrails, governance articles, design-rationale block).\n- Drop duplicate gate references; repoint accessibility, usability, tokens,\n  components, hierarchy, IA, content, and QA gates to the existing\n  practices.md and checklist.md.\n- 