45d619dc0a498a25984414f85a1a28ba81/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T10:47:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T10:47:43Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Redesign GitHub Pages with a blueprint/drafting identity\n\nReskin the landing page with a palette and visual language fitted to\npraxis (engineering doctrine, ADRs, lifecycle, blueprints) instead of\nthe generic dark-slate + coral SaaS look:\n\n- New palette: deep ink-navy \"drafting board\", a precise teal primary\n  and a warm brass secondary for craft/factory accents.\n- Subtle blueprint grid behind the page, hero and CTA band.\n- Drafting cues: corner tick on cards, title-block rule on panels,\n  technical eyebrow/badge markers.\n- Geometric π brand mark (vector, font-independent) replacing ⌘;\n  regenerated favicon and og-image to match.\n- Updated theme-color metas to the new ink-navy.\n\nStructure, copy, classes and JS behaviour are unchanged, so the theme\ntoggle, scrollspy, tabs and copy buttons keep working. Light theme\nreworked as \"blueprint on drafting paper\" with AA-contrast tokens.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015jBJRP7rrDcuGJMbcmKJfL","tree":{"sha":"2afa5642fd6d2dd440de64fee876e3015aca03cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/2afa5642fd6d2dd440de64fee876e3015aca03cd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/d2d2d945d619dc0a498a25984414f85a1a28ba81","verification":{"payload":"tree 2afa5642fd6d2dd440de64fee876e3015aca03cd\nparent 59f1f9a2630f683d256b772bceb719bb567587f3\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782038863 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1782038863 +0000\n\nRedesign GitHub Pages with a blueprint/drafting identity\n\nReskin the landing page with a palette and visual language fitted to\npraxis (engineering doctrine, ADRs, lifecycle, blueprints) instead of\nthe generic dark-slate + coral SaaS look:\n\n- New palette: deep ink-navy \"drafting board\", a precise teal primary\n  and a warm brass secondary for craft/factory accents.\n- Subtle blueprint grid behind the page, hero and CTA band.\n- Drafting cues: corner tick on cards, title-block rule on panels,\n  technical eyebrow/badge markers.\n- Geometric π brand mark (vector, font-independent) replacing ⌘;\n  regenerated favicon and og-image to match.\n- Updated theme-color metas to the new ink-navy.\n\nStructure, copy, classes and JS behaviour are unchanged, so the theme\ntoggle, scrollspy, tabs and copy buttons keep working. Light theme\nreworked as \"blueprint on drafting paper\" with AA-contrast tokens.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_015jBJRP7rrDcuGJMbcmKJfL\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQLI6eJCO\nvtJ1ZIgvIbRPN5Nfo7nNgNe+mZz3t4CDfsfh9hySC6eQDjg5j8oKfKSW1D08R7acQn6ptzIz1OtL\nDAU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-21T10:47:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/ow