.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/cdc27ad90a879ed5721589f219c32666dffea4f6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-18T16:24:27Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-18T16:24:27Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(devops): harden deploy phase with guardrails, supply-chain, SLO+DORA gates\n\nOperationalize DevOps doctrine into enforceable gates on the optional deploy phase:\n- deploy-plan-guardrails: Infracost cost budget, OPA/Conftest policy-as-code,\n  tfsec/Checkov IaC scan over the terraform plan before promotion (fail-closed\n  on production; unconfigured checks skipped-and-recorded)\n- deploy-supply-chain: SBOM (Syft), cosign signature, SLSA provenance, admission\n  control before apply (unsigned/unverifiable image blocks)\n- deploy-healthy: tie promotion to SLO error-budget burn-rate + capture DORA\n\nAdds deploy.guardrails / deploy.supplyChain / target.slo to the config schema\n(verified with jsonschema), new Gate reference section + report template\nsections, and bumps devops-engineer to v1.2.0.\n\nValidation: schema tests PASS; validate-harness OK; validate-all OK; catalog +\nintegrations up to date.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011ixYkzFM89pCMWZFseCN3U","tree":{"sha":"369f68cead84b7e32a16b3025ff9b32fc7a24236","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/369f68cead84b7e32a16b3025ff9b32fc7a24236"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repo