public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/c2e1d4d6eeea22af54f24b34c91ffe298392a331/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-17T18:23:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-17T18:23:57Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat(devops): pin MCP servers, add deploy-report template, scope out GitOps\n\nRefine the optional deploy phase per review:\n- MCP servers now carry pinned sources (HashiCorp Terraform MCP, Kubernetes MCP,\n  AWS/Azure MCP official; GCP via the google provider through Terraform MCP or a\n  vetted community server) with a version floor and mandatory digest pinning;\n  config example gains version + digest fields\n- add projects/_template scaffold reports/release/deploy-report.md (DEP-<NNN>)\n- record GitOps (Argo/Flux) as an explicit out-of-scope note, not a backend\n\nValidation: make validate-harness OK; make validate-all OK; integrations-check\nup to date.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011ixYkzFM89pCMWZFseCN3U","tree":{"sha":"02ff8f1a8df90e862f059467ee733a37a8313984","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/02ff8f1a8df90e862f059467ee733a37a8313984"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/c2e1d4d6eeea22af54f24b34c91ffe298392a331","verification":{"payload":"tree 02ff8f1a8df90e862f059467ee733a37a8313984\nparent 44f61aed76d9a43aeea94fd9760b07dc1f8f3cb5\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781720637 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781720637 +0000\n\nfeat(devops): pin MCP servers, add deploy-report template, scope out GitOps\n\nRefine the optional deploy phase per review:\n- MCP servers now carry pinned sources (HashiCorp Terraform MCP, Kubernetes MCP,\n  AWS/Azure MCP official; GCP via the google provider through Terraform MCP or a\n  vetted community server) with a version flo