hub.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/5e306a22a739a1e32145cc09757a9dd40fb4a8d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-11T17:16:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-11T17:16:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"feat: semantic model tiers + leaner descriptions to cut token cost\n\nReplace hardcoded vendor model names (Opus/Sonnet/Haiku) in the lifecycle\ncommands with semantic tiers (light/standard/deep), resolved through a new\noptional ''models'' map in .praxis/config.json so each runtime (Claude Code,\nCodex, Cursor, Junie) maps tiers to its own models — including higher tiers\nlike fable for deep. Doctrine in rules/model-tiers.md; schema updated.\n\nHarden the cost policy: every phase now defaults to the standard tier and\nmust earn deep escalation, instead of running design/build phases on the\nfrontier tier by reflex.\n\nShorten all 19 skill descriptions (~45% on average), the most verbose\ncommand descriptions, and the plugin manifest to cut the fixed per-request\ncontext cost. Regenerate SKILLS.md and the cursor/codex/intellij\nintegrations. Bump plugin to 1.13.0.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01L9XY56bBo84XgUqUQynQCo","tree":{"sha":"985f6600a7ef22d590ffae57e9150375bb5a5860","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/985f6600a7ef22d590ffae57e9150375bb5a5860"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/5e306a22a739a1e32145cc09757a9dd40fb4a8d7","verification":{"payload":"tree 985f6600a7ef22d590ffae57e9150375bb5a5860\nparent c6e8ce5f758c871bafb4a5066af3c3bab3b70653\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781198212 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781198212 +0000\n\nfeat: semantic model tiers + leaner descriptions to cut token cost\n\nReplace hardcoded vendor model names (Opus/Sonnet/Haiku) in the lifecycle\ncommands with semantic tiers (light/standard/deep), resolved through a new\noptional ''models'' map in .praxis/config.json so each runtime (Claude Code,\nCodex, Cursor, Junie) maps tiers to its own models — including higher tiers\nlike fable for deep. Doctrine in rules/model-tiers.md; schema updated.\n\nHarden the cost policy: every phase now defaults to the standard tier and\nmust earn deep escalation, instead of running design/build phases on the\nfrontier tier by reflex.\n\nShorten all 19 skill descriptions (~45% on average), the most verbose\ncommand descriptions, and the plugin manifest to cut the fixed per-request\ncontext cost. Regenerate SKILLS.md and the cursor/codex/intellij\nintegrations. Bump plugin to 1.13.0.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01L9XY56bBo84XgUqUQynQCo\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQDUwY7mo\nyK81YmWsCMVKqYn5sHiVseH0f3IsXU+d3lbRNuqmO+LcFb7/5JksIsDZyK9N6c9DRoeWxMJwjYLG\nbwI=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-11T17:16:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"