 vocabulary and default\nmin/max thresholds (Coverage >= 80%, Duplicated Lines <= 3%,\nMaintainability/Reliability/Security Rating = A, Security Hotspots Reviewed\n= 100%, Cyclomatic Complexity <= 10, Cognitive Complexity <= 15, Technical\nDebt Ratio bands A-E) aligned to SonarQube''s default Quality Gate. A repo''s\nown configured quality gate is binding when one exists -- this is a shared\nvocabulary plus defaults, not a new mandatory gate. Wired into developer\n(DRY/complexity practices + pre-merge checklist), qa-engineer (coverage\nchecklist item), software-architect (checklist item 8.7 alongside the 8.6\nhotspot signal), and security-engineer (pipeline-gates checklist ahead of\nG-security). Recorded as ledger decision 20260610-211200-9aa6.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Tv4HwSizQttWpyuBgK3DMM","tree":{"sha":"074f5abe509c40b8ede01c89c2977b5406703d11","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/074f5abe509c40b8ede01c89c2977b5406703d11"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/5c0ba52ce2ffbdd14d57ebc389c6f3c8c34c3efc","verification":{"payload":"tree 074f5abe509c40b8ede01c89c2977b5406703d11\nparent 2e7b8c4c70bfb316c661de272122ef91cc6e4da0\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781125950 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781125950 +0000\n\nfeat(architect): add SonarQube-aligned code-quality-metrics rule with default thresholds\n\nAdds rules/code-quality-metrics.md, giving developer, qa-engineer,\nsoftware-architect, and security-engineer a shared vocabulary and default\nmin/max thresholds (Coverage >= 80%, Duplicated Lines <= 3%,\nMaintainability/Reliability/Security Rating = A, Security Hotspots Reviewed\n= 100%, Cyclomatic Complexity <= 10, Cognitive Complexity <= 15, Technical\nDebt Ratio bands A-E) aligned to SonarQube''s default Quality Gate. A repo''s\nown configured quality gate is binding when one exists -- this is a shared\nvocabulary plus defaults, not a new mandatory gate. Wired into dev