module recurring across 3+ entries as a\nhotspot, routing to the existing /refine lifecycle. The software-architect\npractice gains a \"Systemic complexity\" subsection and checklist item 8.6.\nThe other gaps are deferred pending evidence from real projects, recorded as\nledger decision 20260610-184151-08ca.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Tv4HwSizQttWpyuBgK3DMM","tree":{"sha":"10909bbb302e14534ae1e23111916bbb12ea1145","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/10909bbb302e14534ae1e23111916bbb12ea1145"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/2e7b8c4c70bfb316c661de272122ef91cc6e4da0","verification":{"payload":"tree 10909bbb302e14534ae1e23111916bbb12ea1145\nparent e46fdb28a1fb4774d21f49331029d2195e48fc23\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781116951 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781116951 +0000\n\nfeat(architect): add systemic-complexity hotspot signal to /patterns\n\nOf the systemic-complexity gaps identified for praxis (no continuous\ncomplexity gate, no fitness functions, no proactive complexity-accumulation\ndetection, no Conway''s-law/cross-repo tracking), only the proactive-detection\ngap is addressed for now, and as a small extension of existing tooling rather\nthan new process surface: /patterns now reads implementation entries'' \"Files\ntouched\" lists and flags a file/module recurring across 3+ entries as a\nhotspot, routing to the existing /refine lifecycle. The software-architect\npractice gains a \"Systemic complexity\" subsection and checklist item 8.6.\nThe other gaps are deferred pending evidence from real projects, recorded as\nledger decision 20260610-184151-08ca.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01Tv4HwSizQttWpyuBgK3DMM\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOsGEn/7\nB5xR9J5V5rgmcKVQrPGAxYnF399Uzie9c4sT