pare, regression threshold, evidence);\n  devops-engineer owns the runtime/SLO side. validation-orchestrator\n  names the owner. Resolves the asymmetry where G-security had an owner\n  but G-performance did not.\n\nPlugin symlink added; SKILLS.md + integrations regenerated.\nValidation: validate-all, validate-harness, catalog-check,\nintegrations-check OK; 105 tests pass.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01NjrHRKNZ5FQg7dYpxK61QZ","tree":{"sha":"c16d05c92813a37aac9c69f2b8d29c53f1e98383","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/c16d05c92813a37aac9c69f2b8d29c53f1e98383"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/460089d241f15e7e0b7dc3dfde5fed7347fc3e90","verification":{"payload":"tree c16d05c92813a37aac9c69f2b8d29c53f1e98383\nparent ce04a99e63a9e3ec817fae70d2beedc5a29e84ae\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781011039 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781011039 +0000\n\nAdd /patterns command and give G-performance an owning expert\n\nRoster follow-up from the review, both minimal and doctrine-aligned\n(no new skill — promotion-policy: keep capability in the parent until\nevidence justifies a split).\n\n- /patterns command wraps tools/patterns.py, giving the continuous-\n  learning miner a command surface alongside /learn, /memory,\n  /validate-skills; routes recurring candidates into /learn.\n- software-architect gains references/performance-review.md, becoming the\n  owning expert for the build-time side of the G-performance gate\n  (budgets, baseline → load → compare, regression threshold, evidence);\n  devops-engineer owns the runtime/SLO side. validation-orchestrator\n  names the owner. Resolves the asymmetry where G-security had an owner\n  but G-performance did not.\n\nPlugin symlink added; SKILLS.md + integrations regenerated.\nValidation: validate-all, validate-harness, catalog-check,\nintegrations-check OK; 105 tests pass.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01NjrHRKNZ5FQg7dYpxK61QZ\n","reason"