.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/ce04a99e63a9e3ec817fae70d2beedc5a29e84ae/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T12:47:14Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T12:47:14Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Close PSDOS gaps #2–#5 in feature-development harness\n\nBuilds on the security/performance gates (#1) to bring the feature\nlifecycle closer to a faithful PSDOS implementation.\n\nWorkflow state machine (#3, #4, upstream criteria, failure protocol):\n- New states product-definition and release-candidate make the front and\n  back halves explicit, each with its own artifact + template.\n- gateCriteria: HITL approval tokens become criteria-checked gates;\n  architecture-validated gives architecture its own pass/fail.\n- transitions.onGateFailure: a failed gate routes back to its rework\n  state (root-cause → return → revalidate), never a bypass.\n- workflow.schema.json + validate_harness.py extended; +5 unit tests.\n\nValidation Orchestrator (#2, scoped to one agent):\n- New Tier-2 skill + /validation-orchestrator command: the standing role\n  with sole authority to halt progression; adjudicates each gate to a\n  closed-set verdict advance|block|escalate. Plugin symlinks + catalog\n  regenerated; integrations correctly exclude it (not an SDLC persona).\n\nContinuous-learning pattern miner (#5):\n- tools/patterns.py + `make patterns`: read-only sweep of the ledger and\n  run logs for recurring tags/sources/stop-conditions, surfaced as\n  human-gated promotion candidates. +8 unit tests.\n\nScope: feature-development only; bug-fix/refinement unchanged by design.\nValidation: validate-harness, validate-all, catalog-check,\nintegrations-check, traceability all OK; 105 tests pass.\n\nhttps://claude.ai/code/session_01NjrHRKNZ5FQg7dYpxK61QZ","tree":{"sha":"b66569fee7e94ff6a7c73ed44301804b38fca59d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/b66569fee7e94ff6a7c73ed44301804b38fca59d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/ce04a99e63a9e3ec817fae70d2beedc5a29e84ae","verification":{"payload":"tree b66569fee7e94ff6a7c73ed44301804b38fca59d\nparent 4ad853b44f381785c1b48e566dfd8a94fe167a13\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781009234 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1781009234 +0000\n\nClose PSDOS gaps #2–#5 in feature-development harness\n\nBuilds on the security/performance gates (#1) to bring the feature\nlifecycle closer to a faithful PSDOS implementation.\n\nWorkflow state machine (#3, #4, upstream criteria, failure protocol):\n- New states product-definition and release-candidate make the front and\n  back halves explicit, each with its own artifact + template.\n- gateCriteria: HITL approval tokens become criteria-checked gates;\n  architecture-validated gives architecture its own pass/fail.\n- transitions.onGateFailure: a failed gate routes back to its rework\n  state (root-cause → return → revalidate), never a bypass.\n- workflow.schema.json + validate_harness.py extended; +5 unit tests.\n\nValidation Orchestrator (#2, scoped to one agent):\n- N