wed edit surface); per-surface groups declare\n  files-owned (mirroring the experience contract''s filesOwned). Scaffold /\n  per-surface / cross-cutting phasing with a verify task per surface.\n- tools/check_tasks.py: deterministic, stdlib-only linter. Flags any task\n  missing required fields (default Forbidden/Gate/Output) and any surface group\n  missing files-owned. Advisory like validate_traceability (not a blocking\n  harness gate, so pre-existing specs aren''t broken). `make check-tasks FILE=...`.\n- tools/test_check_tasks.py: 8 tests (suite now 92).\n- Makefile: check-tasks target + help.\n- AGENTS.md + systems/feature-development: document the structured tasks model.","tree":{"sha":"f296c7c9042fefc6c088780b63bd6d045ccb35a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/f296c7c9042fefc6c088780b63bd6d045ccb35a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/450795d4e39b7ac4425b6a587f337540f101f2e5","verification":{"payload":"tree f296c7c9042fefc6c088780b63bd6d045ccb35a6\nparent 4a09ffb201e58b895be690c72659d140db69fcee\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780990134 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780990134 +0000\n\nAdd per-task anti-drift fields + files-owned + linter (gap 4)\n\n- projects/_template/specs/_template/tasks/tasks.md: structured per-task format\n  — every task names Plan ref, Decisions, Forbidden, Gate (G-* from the catalog),\n  and Output (its only allowed edit surface); per-surface groups declare\n  files-owned (mirroring the experience contract''s filesOwned). Scaffold /\n  per-surface / cross-cutting phasing with a verify task per surface.\n- tools/check_tasks.py: deterministic, stdlib-only linter. Flags any task\n  missing required fields (default Forbidden/Gate/Output) and any surface group\n  missing files-owned. Advisory like validate_traceability (not a blocking\n  harness gate, so pre-existing specs aren''t broken). `make check-tasks FILE=...`.\n- tools/test_check_tasks.py: 8 