 P-*/S- additions with trigger/surfacedAs/resolutionGate).\n- tools/validate_harness.py: _check_stop_conditions validates an optional\n  projects/<p>/specs/<s>/stop-conditions.json (id patterns, STOP[ prefix,\n  unique ids, spec match). Inert when absent.\n- projects/_template/specs/_template/runs/_run-log.md: the stop-incident run-log\n  protocol (context, evidence, >=2 options, re-entry point) — also closes the\n  run-log gap.\n- rules/stop-conditions.md + never-assume linkage + AGENTS.md: wire the catalog\n  in and document the partition.\n- tools/test_harness_tools.py: 6 tests (suite now 84).","tree":{"sha":"2e795321f593f410fe86d6c0c64364400824ef1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/2e795321f593f410fe86d6c0c64364400824ef1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/4a09ffb201e58b895be690c72659d140db69fcee","verification":{"payload":"tree 2e795321f593f410fe86d6c0c64364400824ef1a\nparent 0b2938a91056ee2d91cb69e13922b3fd732b5dd7\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780989987 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780989987 +0000\n\nAdd enumerated stop-conditions catalog: the hard-blocker half (gap 3)\n\nComplements the assumptions ledger (soft, low-confidence guesses) with a\ndeterministic catalog of observable blockers, completing the partition:\nsoft guess -> assumptions ledger; judgement ambiguity -> stop-conditions\ncategories; hard observable blocker -> this catalog.\n\n- rules/stop-conditions-catalog.md: the universal U-1..U-10 catalog, each with\n  an observable trigger, the exact STOP[...] surfaced text, and a resolution\n  gate; explains the three-way partition and how a fired condition halts the\n  step and writes a run log.\n- schemas/stop-conditions.schema.json: per-spec catalog shape (inheritsUniversal\n  + P-*/S- additions with trigger/surfacedAs/resolutionGate).\n- tools/validate_harness.py: _check_stop_conditions validates an optional\n  projects/<p>/specs/<s>/stop-conditions.json