_workflow_loops now checks loop gates resolve to the\n  catalog. (signature gained catalog_ids — call sites updated.)\n- workflows/{feature-development,bug-fix,refinement}: real gate catalogs and\n  loops.verify.gates wired to them. feature-dev gets G-build/lint/typecheck/\n  tests/runtime-clean/acceptance + conditional G-routes-200/G-visual; corrective\n  flows get their own (G-repro-gone, G-behavior-preserved, ...).\n- projects/_template verify reports (spec, bug, refinement): record a per-gate\n  pass/fail/skipped/n-a table, stop conditions hit, verdict, and reviewer\n  sign-off, with an explicit \"no self-certification\" rule (the U-8 hard stop).\n- experience contracts already reference the same gate ids (gap 1), so a surface\n  declares exactly which gates prove it.\n- systems/feature-development: documents the catalog + report rules.\n- tools/test_harness_tools.py: 4 gate-catalog/loop-gate tests (suite now 78).","tree":{"sha":"5cf247653ff31232bdbef02a759177630d661d35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/5cf247653ff31232bdbef02a759177630d661d35"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/0b2938a91056ee2d91cb69e13922b3fd732b5dd7","verification":{"payload":"tree 5cf247653ff31232bdbef02a759177630d661d35\nparent 7c94217598d9f3440c0e70f3137933944d07b9e0\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780989819 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780989819 +0000\n\nAdd typed gate catalog + verify report with no self-certification (gap 2)\n\n- schemas/workflow.schema.json: new optional `gateCatalog` (typed G-* gates:\n  description, runner, passCriteria, conditional/appliesTo) — distinct from the\n  entry-condition `gates`. `loops.<step>.gates` may reference catalog ids.\n- tools/validate_harness.py: _check_gate_catalog validates well-formedness and\n  returns the id set; _check_workflow_loops now checks loop gates resolve to the\n  catalog. (signature gained catalog_ids — call sites updated.)\n- workflows/{feature-development,bug-fix,refinement}: real gate catalogs and\n  loops.verify.gates wired to them. feature-dev gets G-build/lint/typecheck/\n  tests/runtime-clean/acceptance + conditional G-routes-200/G-visual; corrective\n  flows get their own (G-repro-gone, G-behavior-preserved, ...).\n- projects/_template verify reports (spec, bug, refinement): record a per-gate\n  pass/fail/skipped/n-a table, stop conditions hit, verdict, and reviewer\n  sign-off, with an explicit \"no self-certification\" rule (the U-8 hard stop).\n- experience contracts already reference the same gate ids (gap 1), so a surface\n  declares exactly which gates prove it.\n- systems/feature-development: documents the catalog + report rules.\n- tools/test_harness_tools.py: 4 gate-catalog/loop-gate tests (suite now 78).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQOkvH1m4\nmF/e6riEsZvcGohRo+bFdu+MsSGXJXDkBRM1nj7K8sYaENSLa2VPdevbq/dBdMDpHmVmR9eaQXr/\n2wQ=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-09T07:23:42Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/marcrabadan/praxis/commit/0b2938a91056ee2d91cb69e13922b3fd732b5dd7","node_id":"C_kwDOSroCA9oAKDBiMjkzOGE5MTA1NmVlMmQ5MWNiNjllMTM5MjJiM2ZkNzMyYjVkZDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/marcrabadan/praxis/commit/7c94217598d9f3440c0e70f3137933944d07b9e0","sha":"7c94217598d9f3440c0e70f3137933944d07b9e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/7c94217598d9f3440c0e70f3137933944d07b9e0"}],"sha":"0b2938a91056ee2d91cb69e13922b3fd732b5dd7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/0b2938a91056ee2d91cb69e13922b3fd732b5dd7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/commits/7c94217598d9f3440c0e70f3137933944d07b9e0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-09T07:20:19Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-09T07:20:19Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"Add experience contracts + optional experience step (gap 1)\n\nAdapts SDD Kit''s marquee idea — an executable per-surface contract between\nspec and plan — into Praxis idioms.\n\n- schemas/experience-contract.schema.json: the companion JSON contract for one\n  surface (screen/flow/api/job/cli/data/integration) — sourceOfTruth,\n  filesOwned (verifier scope), components (dependency map), and a per-surface\n  verification list referencing gate ids. Closed status set.\n- schemas/spec.schema.json: expanded (still 4 required fields, so existing\n  specs stay valid) with an optional machine-readable `experienceInventory`.\n- workflows/feature-development: insert the optional `experience` step between\n  spec and plan; plan now gates on `experience-complete`.\n- tools/validate_harness.py: _check_experience_contracts validates any\n  experience/*.contract.json structurally and, when a spec declares an\n  inventory, checks per-surface coverage. Inert for specs with no surfaces.\n- projects/_template: experience/ scaffold (_surface.md + _surface.contract.json)\n  and an Experience Inventory section in the spec template.\n- systems/feature-development + AGENTS.md: lifecycle, tree, and steps table\n  now include the experience step.\n- tools/test_harness_tools.py: 7 tests (suite now 74).","tree":{"sha":"f3f82aba38229654685e9ff94a68b721dfc30f52","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/trees/f3f82aba38229654685e9ff94a68b721dfc30f52"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/marcrabadan/praxis/git/commits/7c94217598d9f3440c0e70f3137933944d07b9e0","verification":{"payload":"tree f3f82aba38229654685e9ff94a68b721dfc30f52\nparent 013955f6164606fa5c864ea06392638efa16f50b\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780989619 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1780989619 +0000\n\nAdd experience contracts + optional experience step (gap 1)\n\nAdapts SDD Kit''s marquee idea — an executable per-surface contract between\nspec and plan — into Praxis idioms.\n\n- schemas/experience-contract.schema.json: the companion JSON contract for one\n  surface (screen/flow/api/job/cli/data/integration) — sourceOfTruth,\n  filesOwned (verifier scope), components (dependency map), and a per-surface\n  verification list referencing gate ids. Closed status set.\n- schemas/spec.schema.json: expanded (still 4 required fields, so existing\n  specs stay valid) with an optional machine-readable `experienceInventory`.\n- workflows/feature-development: insert the optional `experience` step between\n  spec and plan; plan now gates on `experience-complete`.\n- tools/validate_harness.py: _check_experience_contracts validates any\n  experience/*.contract.json structurally and, when a spec declares an\n  inventory, checks per-surface coverage. Inert for specs with no surfaces.\n- projects/_template: experience/ scaffold (_surface.md + _surface.contract.json)\n  and an Experience Inventory section in the spec template.\n- systems/feature-development + AGENTS.md: lifecycle, tree, and steps table\n  now include the experience step.\n- tools/test_harness_tools.py: 7 tests (suite now 74).\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQP1thCwS\nQehwlWuH20swzFaRiqtq3MKde2OQLii4JAmsZzfnaJnC01KIjSgVXX0Y2CP/XfEo7Y3ykzbxXHkq\nLgg=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-09T07:20:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_ur