Mjc0OWQ0NDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/heilashahidi/weekly-commit-module/commit/84ee68f60b10cdae30421d33ac1a189e514ad0fe","sha":"84ee68f60b10cdae30421d33ac1a189e514ad0fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heilashahidi/weekly-commit-module/commits/84ee68f60b10cdae30421d33ac1a189e514ad0fe"}],"sha":"4fe56911706affdb7c03dc3f67d1360b2749d445","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heilashahidi/weekly-commit-module/commits/4fe56911706affdb7c03dc3f67d1360b2749d445"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38868418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/heilashahidi","id":38868418,"login":"heilashahidi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4ODY4NDE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heilashahidi/weekly-commit-module/commits/84ee68f60b10cdae30421d33ac1a189e514ad0fe/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T20:22:58Z","email":"heila.shahidi@gmail.com","name":"Heila Shahidi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T20:22:58Z","email":"heila.shahidi@gmail.com","name":"Heila Shahidi"},"message":"fix(lifecycle): address Tier-2 code-review findings\n\nFrom the 11-reviewer review (5 P1 + 3 P2 fixed):\n- P1 sweep transaction isolation: extract LifecycleAutoAdvancer with per-plan\n  @Transactional(REQUIRES_NEW); sweep() is now a non-transactional orchestrator\n  with per-plan try/catch + logging + a top-level guard, so one bad plan can''t\n  roll back the batch or kill the @Scheduled future (reliability + correctness).\n- P1 carry-forward idempotency: skip sources already carried (by carriedFromId)\n  so a re-POST is a no-op, not a double-seed.\n- P1 carry only into a DRAFT next-week plan (409 otherwise) - prevents seeding\n  planned commitments onto an advanced plan (R8).\n- P1 enable ProblemDetail (RFC 7807) so ResponseStatusException messages reach\n  clients instead of bare status codes (D/F contract).\n- P2 enforce R6 at the level: commitment link must be a SUPPORTING_OUTCOME, not\n  any rcdo node.\n- P2 index weekly_plan(status, status_deadline) (V6) for the org-wide sweep finder.\n- P2 gate @Scheduled to !test so it doesn''t fire during ITs.\n- P2 remove dead LifecycleService.submitReconciled + fix stale seam docs.\n\n6 new tests; full ./gradlew check green (JaCoCo 80%). Deferred (in run artifact):\n@Version optimistic locking, agent-native read endpoints (workstream D), API\nversioning, manager-review read authz (workstream F).","tree":{"sha":"fe6084b8cf9f7d9f596d144f3dedb2374b3d4053","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heilashahidi/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/fe6084b8cf9f7d9f596d144f3dedb2374b3d4053"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heilashahidi/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/84ee68f60b10cdae30421d33ac1a189e514ad0fe","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38868418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/gists{/gist_id}"