kly-commit-module/commits/2c7df34fb3ee4f91451227d847e1069d411c4c1f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38868418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/heilashahidi","id":38868418,"login":"heilashahidi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4ODY4NDE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heilashahidi/weekly-commit-module/commits/dbe3c33bcee67c164c83953807b9b2d3f5efd29b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T18:46:18Z","email":"heila.shahidi@gmail.com","name":"Heila Shahidi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T18:46:18Z","email":"heila.shahidi@gmail.com","name":"Heila Shahidi"},"message":"fix(rcdo): address code-review findings (cycle guard, contract, drift)\n\nFrom the Tier-2 multi-agent review:\n- P1 (adversarial+correctness): parent_id cycles silently dropped nodes from\n  /tree (HTTP 200) and left toDto recursion unguarded. Add a DFS ancestor-set\n  guard so cyclic edges are not followed; both endpoints now terminate on cycles.\n- P1 (api-contract+maintainability): RcdoNodeDto.children meant different things\n  on /tree (full subtree) vs /nodes/{id} (direct children only) — a trap for\n  workstream C. Unify both on the same full-subtree assembly; remove the now-\n  unused findByParentId; document children as always-full-subtree.\n- P2 (data-migration): audit columns were TIMESTAMP but the entity''s Instant maps\n  to timestamptz — UTC shift hazard. Change to TIMESTAMPTZ.\n- P2 (correctness+testing): sort_order was persisted but never ordered siblings.\n  Sort roots and children by sortOrder; add coverage.\n- P2 (correctness): RcdoMigrationTest comment overclaimed a validate drift guard\n  (test profile uses ddl-auto: update). Correct the wording.\n- P2 (testing): add RcdoTree empty-state test.\n\nAdded service tests for cycle termination, sort ordering, and full-subtree\ngetNode. Backend check + frontend lint/test/build green.\n\nDeferred (rationale in run artifact): API versioning/OpenAPI codegen (gold-plating\nfor scope), unused findByNodeType/useGetRcdoNodeQuery (intentional seams), V3\nseed idempotency, 404 body shape.","tree":{"sha":"5bedc957fb1ae6e0f8178d48e574b760832e0c8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heilashahidi/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/5bedc957fb1ae6e0f8178d48e574b760832e0c8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heilashahidi/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/dbe3c33bcee67c164c83953807b9b2d3f5efd29b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38868418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/heilashahidi","id":38868418,"login":"heilashahidi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4ODY4NDE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/received_events","repos_url":"https://a