e shipped bundle. Safe in-line bumps clear the two criticals:\n- vitest 2.1.1 -> 2.1.9: RCE via Vitest API server (GHSA-9crc-q9x8-hgqq)\n- happy-dom 15.7.4 -> 20.9.0: VM context escape RCE (GHSA-...)\n- vite 5.4.8 -> 5.4.21: server.fs.deny bypasses + bundled esbuild fix\n- postcss 8.4.47 -> 8.5.15: XSS in CSS stringify\n\nVerified green: lint, vitest 4/4 (happy-dom 20.x), build emits federation chunks.\n\nDeferred to workstream G (CI hardening): the remaining high (serialize-javascript)\nand moderates live in the @cucumber/cypress E2E chain and need a breaking\ncypress-cucumber-preprocessor 21->24 bump. Dev-only, not exploitable, not worth\ndestabilizing the E2E harness mid-foundation.","tree":{"sha":"ae648699c036e2f818730d2e4b2e7c32c1d594af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heilashahidi/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/ae648699c036e2f818730d2e4b2e7c32c1d594af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heilashahidi/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/bc368f6d9d6726cfe806da8d13841d6d96b58ca2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38868418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/heilashahidi","id":38868418,"login":"heilashahidi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4ODY4NDE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/subscr