,"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T14:42:25Z","email":"heila.shahidi@gmail.com","name":"Heila Shahidi"},"message":"fix: Module Federation shared singletons for React + Redux\n\nSwitch shared from the array form to the object form with singleton:true\nand requiredVersion, and add react-redux + @reduxjs/toolkit. The array form\nlet host and remote each load their own copy: duplicate React breaks hooks\n(Invalid hook call) and a duplicate react-redux gives the remote a Context\nthat doesn''t match its Provider, so useSelector reads an empty store (#3).","tree":{"sha":"b86c07e7d0c5b0e02c614729ee3b4790415f8d9b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heilashahidi/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/b86c07e7d0c5b0e02c614729ee3b4790415f8d9b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heilashahidi/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/4cdbbd472273ba0138a8524d50ea8ed311d82ed2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38868418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/heilashahidi","id":38868418,"login":"heilashahidi","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4ODY4NDE4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://git