ssage":"fix: address backend code-review findings\n\n- build.gradle: pull embedded-postgres binaries for darwin-amd64 + linux\n  amd64/arm64 (was darwin-arm64v8 only) so backend ITs run on CI/x86 (#1)\n- SecurityConfig: fail fast with an actionable message when the secure\n  profile has no JwtDecoder, instead of an opaque missing-bean crash on a\n  bare bootRun; validate audience presence when issuer-uri is set (#2,#5)\n- application.yml: correct the comment that falsely claimed tenant-less\n  startup; document dev-profile / TestSecurityConfig paths (#2)\n- CorsConfig: reject a wildcard origin at startup (incompatible with\n  allowCredentials) instead of failing silently in the browser (#6)\n- checkNoLombokData: match @Data anywhere, catching inline/qualified forms (#7)\n- JwtPrincipalResolver: use instanceof AnonymousAuthenticationToken rather\n  than string-matching the principal name (#9)\n- HealthController: probe the datasource and return 503 DOWN when\n  unreachable, so health reflects real readiness (#10)\n- JaCoCo: narrow coverage exclusions to bootstrap + pure wiring so\n  SecurityConfig/CorsConfig logic is no longer hidden (#8)\n- tests: cover the new SecurityConfig guards, CORS wildcard rejection,\n  and HealthController UP/DOWN branches","tree":{"sha":"b6c18561126e59a1f7c55b6091eb054c6cc0a0f0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heilashahidi/weekly-commit-module/git/trees/b6c18561126e59a1f7c55b6091eb054c6cc0a0f0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heilashahidi/weekly-commit-module/git/commits/18abfcb33bfeb6bf0945184bd507e2cfd9b477fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38868418?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/heilashahidi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":