ommits/c5e666748328b5a3b32820a96201eb676e5c2164/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:33:09Z","email":"syreanis+1@gmail.com","name":"Petr Glaser"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:59:31Z","email":"12586960+BleedingDev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Petr Glaser"},"message":"feat(authz): stage demo and admin accounts with explicit Action grants\n\nStage now has Techsio and Akros, each with one demo and one admin account.\nAdmins get direct executor grants for every explicit Action from the\nsource-controlled stage policy; demos and the non-member are verified as\ndenied, and provisioning fails if a fixed Principal can access the other\nfixed Tenant. The bootstrap retires Siam Park through typed revoke/archive\nwrites, SpiceDB deletes and a Better Auth ban with credential removal.","tree":{"sha":"c8c9475036fe4a2ec04fddb8205e2994cd370514","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TechsioCZ/ontos/git/trees/c8c9475036fe4a2ec04fddb8205e2994cd370514"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TechsioCZ/ontos/git/commits/c5e666748328b5a3b32820a96201eb676e5c2164","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12586960?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BleedingDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BleedingDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BleedingDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BleedingDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BleedingDev","id":12586960,"login":"BleedingDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTg2OTYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BleedingDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BleedingDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BleedingDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BleedingDev/starred{