itter":{"date":"2026-10-01T20:36:03Z","email":"12586960+BleedingDev@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Petr Glaser"},"message":"fix(verticals): serve the development module contract from every discovered dev server\n\nThe Shell discovers each unit through /.well-known/ontos-module-manifest.json.\nInventory''s dev server never served it (the locale redirect answered 302), and\nthe catalog and commerce-market-catalog dev scripts never prepared the file\ntheir middleware reads, so local discovery listed them unavailable. Inventory\nnow uses the shared contract middleware, the three dev scripts prepare the\ncontract, and the ports test checks each discovered dev server serves one.","tree":{"sha":"88e43ac4dbfc9d3c5cf7012cf6a00802bbef3834","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TechsioCZ/ontos/git/trees/88e43ac4dbfc9d3c5cf7012cf6a00802bbef3834"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TechsioCZ/ontos/git/commits/9e03344a0d8bd6d82044350e97c1061bc1891906","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/12586960?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BleedingDev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BleedingDev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BleedingDev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BleedingDev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BleedingDev","id":12586960,"login":"BleedingDev","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNTg2OTYw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BleedingDev/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BleedingDev/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BleedingDev/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BleedingDev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BleedingDev/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/user