34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Релиз 1.2.0 и публикация в npm через Trusted Publishing (#2)\n\n* chore: bump to 1.2.0 and add npm trusted publishing\n\nShip the native-select release and publish it from a v* tag with OIDC, without a stored npm token.\n\nCo-authored-by: kellas <alex.step.kellas@gmail.com>\n\n* fix: publish only on v* tag push\n\ngh release create pushes the tag and publishes the release, so a release trigger would run npm publish twice.\n\nCo-authored-by: kellas <alex.step.kellas@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","tree":{"sha":"2b226cdc771bdb5a8379b3d0d81644dfb84a97f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexstep/custom-select/git/trees/2b226cdc771bdb5a8379b3d0d81644dfb84a97f5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/alexstep/custom-select/git/commits/5cf97c3a31579c0ca167071e2ca7b9c205032037","verification":{"payload":"tree 2b226cdc771bdb5a8379b3d0d81644dfb84a97f5\nparent d89e63598b21934960b915a57c4b48a6add875de\nauthor kellas <alex.step.kellas@gmail.com> 1791415474 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791415474 +0300\n\nРелиз 1.2.0 и публикация в npm через Trusted Publishing (#2)\n\n* chore: bump to 1.2.0 and add npm trusted publishing\n\nShip the native-select release and publish it from a v* tag with OIDC, without a stored npm token.\n\nCo-authored-by: kellas <alex.step.kellas@gmail.com>\n\n* fix: publish only on v* tag push\n\ngh release create pushes the tag and publishes the release, so a release trigger would run npm publish twice.\n\nCo-authored-by: kellas <alex.step.kellas@gmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxtSyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAGZ0QADQXd5cSQfyK/fCX6x2mLQXN\nGu5MltGRW4kT4z1zkzlxDmJ5zWYkrQ308ratjNaJinWEOdoJAQSRG0GYpwrbvXin\nZ1ZbwCZ7u0JYY4j/s7V+U4+B4aufxHm6H2XuvYXMoMzjKiipWE4/0E14MSvjNEGr\naUMevQHUwQGDmi8791Baq8lEGXe8eRtucJpo2D+fkVQJBNm+Z