pic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3feb2d92ae3dc715588eebe8919180d152d30101","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheJan2020/DemoSysMasterAll/git/trees/3feb2d92ae3dc715588eebe8919180d152d30101"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheJan2020/DemoSysMasterAll/git/commits/da781842b92b44731a08f82346d12d689e1b9a7b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64112255?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TheJan2020","id":64112255,"login":"TheJan2020","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTEyMjU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TheJan2020/DemoSysMasterAll/commit/da781842b92b44731a08f82346d12d689e1b9a7b","node_id":"C_kwDOSsKAa9oAKGRhNzgxODQyYjkyYjQ0NzMxYTA4ZjgyMzQ2ZDEyZDY4OWUxYjlhN2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TheJan2020/DemoSysMasterAll/commit/580de961eae9108016a9354798383529b31b8873","sha":"580de961eae9108016a9354798383529b31b8873","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheJan2020/DemoSysMasterAll/commits/580de961eae9108016a9354798383529b31b8873"}],"sha":"da781842b92b44731a08f82346d12d689e1b9a7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheJan2020/DemoSysMasterAll/commits/da781842b92b44731a08f82346d12d689e1b9a7b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64112255?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TheJan2020","id":64112255,"login":"TheJan2020","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTEyMjU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheJan2020/DemoSysMasterAll/commits/580de961eae9108016a9354798383529b31b8873/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T12:41:45Z","email":"z_buh@hotmail.com","name":"ZeyadA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T12:41:45Z","email":"z_buh@hotmail.com","name":"ZeyadA"},"message":"Snapshot for DemoSysMasterAll initial push\n\nBundles every restaurant-demo addition since the prior pw-demo-master\nmirror: full restaurant backend (menu / layout / invoices / reservations\n/ clients / meals / catering / kitchen rules + vision), live-agent voice\nstack (Gemini Live, ElevenLabs streaming TTS, ElevenLabs CAI), AI-Center\nplayground, kitchen AI-rules engine, plus the deployment scaffold\n(deploy/ubuntu-setup.sh, systemd unit, cloudflared + mutagen configs)\nand HTTP Basic auth middleware gating the master admin app.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d91eef23659470e19e4b1315f6de39b79f6ba9dc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheJan2020/DemoSysMasterAll/git/trees/d91eef23659470e19e4b1315f6de39b79f6ba9dc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheJan2020/DemoSysMasterAll/git/commits/580de961eae9108016a9354798383529b31b8873","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64112255?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TheJan2020","id":64112255,"login":"TheJan2020","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTEyMjU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/TheJan2020/DemoSysMasterAll/commit/580de961eae9108016a9354798383529b31b8873","node_id":"C_kwDOSsKAa9oAKDU4MGRlOTYxZWFlOTEwODAxNmE5MzU0Nzk4MzgzNTI5YjMxYjg4NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/TheJan2020/DemoSysMasterAll/commit/5727a5d8225800872ee5f034383bbec1e32d6bc3","sha":"5727a5d8225800872ee5f034383bbec1e32d6bc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheJan2020/DemoSysMasterAll/commits/5727a5d8225800872ee5f034383bbec1e32d6bc3"}],"sha":"580de961eae9108016a9354798383529b31b8873","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheJan2020/DemoSysMasterAll/commits/580de961eae9108016a9354798383529b31b8873"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64112255?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TheJan2020","id":64112255,"login":"TheJan2020","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTEyMjU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheJan2020/DemoSysMasterAll/commits/5727a5d8225800872ee5f034383bbec1e32d6bc3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-18T19:11:09Z","email":"z_buh@hotmail.com","name":"ZeyadA"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-18T19:11:09Z","email":"z_buh@hotmail.com","name":"ZeyadA"},"message":"WhatsApp: merge LID + phone chats that belong to the same patient\n\nSame WhatsApp user shows up twice on the chat list — once under\ntheir phone JID (used when WE send TO them) and once under their\nLID (used when THEY message us with privacy mode on). Operator\nends up with two rows for the same person, only one of which is\npatient-linked or repliable.\n\nBridge via name: if the LID''s push name (from Wasender contacts)\nmatches a patient on record (English or Arabic name, case-\ninsensitive), fold the LID into that patient''s phone JID. Both\nendpoints respect this:\n\n- whatsapp_contacts.py new helpers:\n  - build_patient_name_index(patients) → {normalised_name: phone_jid}\n  - canonical_jid_for(jid, name_index) — async, returns the\n    canonical phone JID for a LID if matched, else the JID unchanged.\n    Phone JIDs / group JIDs pass through untouched.\n\n- /whatsapp/chats now canonicalises each row''s JID before\n  grouping. Result: LID messages from \"Zeyad Ibrahim\" land in the\n  same chat as the phone-JID outbound messages, and the merged\n  chat is repliable (is_lid=false because it''s now keyed under the\n  phone JID).\n\n- /whatsapp/messages does the same canonicalisation per row. When\n  the operator opens the merged chat, the thread includes messages\n  that arrived under EITHER JID.\n\nIf the LID''s push name doesn''t match any patient (or no push name\nat all), the chat stays separate with the existing LID · read-only\ntreatment — defence-in-depth, no silent merges into the wrong\nrecord.\n\nBackend-only, no SPA rebuild needed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9f0b123669dab9c7d0a8de77a059db0184318a8f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheJan2020/DemoSysMasterAll/git/trees/9f0b123669dab9c7d0a8de77a059db0184318a8f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/TheJan2020/DemoSysMasterAll/git/commits/5727a5d8225800872ee5f034383bbec1e32d6bc3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/64112255?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/TheJan2020","id":64112255,"login":"TheJan2020","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY0MTEyMjU1","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheJan2020/repos","sit