ik@post.cz","name":"jsvobo"},"message":"feat: machine profile system + duplicate-node + UI/server smoke tests\n\n- Machine profile per host: slips_variant (none/weak/middle/strong),\n  attacker_pivot (validated to at most one across the topology), services,\n  external connections, internal connections.\n- Add ''Add +1'' duplicate-host action (regenerates name/id, resets\n  attacker_pivot on the copy).\n- generate_compose() bakes the profile: SLIPS resources (cpus/mem) from the\n  variants registry, SLIPS_PROFILE env, and expands connection types into\n  cron lines (internal targets resolved to the host providing the role).\n- Add updateable registries SLIPS_PROFILES / SERVICES / CONNECTION_TYPES\n  (single-entry extensibility).\n- Write changes.md and add server smoke tests (UI serves + injects types,\n  API list, create/get round-trip).","tree":{"sha":"8c523fa5624ebff4fba76598289025c124c34e82","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stratosphereips/SCL-Network-Topology-Creator/git/trees/8c523fa5624ebff4fba76598289025c124c34e82"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stratosphereips/SCL-Network-Topology-Creator/git/commits/5314df02b09c3b6c48ea18490f1f94e866e994b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174719267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsvobo/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsvobo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsvobo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsvobo/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jsvobo","id":174719267,"login":"jsvobo","node_id":"U_kgDOCmoBIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsvobo/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsvobo/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsvobo/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.githu