lse,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsvobo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsvobo/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsvobo","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stratosphereips/SCL-Network-Topology-Creator/commits/7f9613ae0110e72a41789b5109664304bce59486/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T11:25:40Z","email":"svoboda.honzik@post.cz","name":"jsvobo"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T11:25:40Z","email":"svoboda.honzik@post.cz","name":"jsvobo"},"message":"feat: thesis host types for SLIPS federation experiments\n\nAdd 5 thesis-specific host types:\n- slips-peer: SLIPS IDS with Zeek/Redis/P2P (thesis-slips image)\n- aracne-attacker: LLM pentesting agent (thesis-attacker image)\n- pivot: SSH pivot node (thesis-pivot image)\n- slip-ftp: vsftpd server (thesis-ftp image)\n- slip-snmp: SNMP agent + HTTP (thesis-snmp image)\n\nFeatures:\n- Type-specific Docker images via host_image() mapper\n- SLIPS peers get NET_ADMIN/NET_RAW/SYS_ADMIN caps + environment vars\n- Cronjob support: textarea per host, injected via crontab at startup\n- Duplicate network button (deep-copies network + hosts)\n- Bumped limits: 16 networks, 48 hosts per network\n- run_web checkbox for slips-peer background traffic\n- build-images.sh: tags thesis_project images for the plugin","tree":{"sha":"cabc689188515058e919c2eb81ef97c07f71277e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stratosphereips/SCL-Network-Topology-Creator/git/trees/cabc689188515058e919c2eb81ef97c07f71277e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/stratosphereips/SCL-Network-Topology-Creator/git/commits/7f9613ae0110e72a41789b5109664304bce59486","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174719267?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jsvobo/events{/privacy}","foll