owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnushkaMunde431/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnushkaMunde431","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AnushkaMunde074/BikeRental/commits/93286e46128173a1b786fbe66a0aae5ab6077c91/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T17:44:39Z","email":"anushka.munde@siemens.com","name":"Anushka Munde"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T17:44:39Z","email":"anushka.munde@siemens.com","name":"Anushka Munde"},"message":"refactor: improve structure, scalability, and UI/UX\n\n- Frontend: upgrade TypeScript 5.6 -> 5.7, add react-router-dom + @types/node\n- Frontend: replace manual pathname routing with React Router BrowserRouter/Routes\n- Frontend: extract shared useToast hook (DRY toast logic from pages)\n- Frontend: fix AccessoryModal CSS class mismatches (qty-control, order-summary, btn-order, acc-controls, out-of-stock)\n- Frontend: add aria-label to qty buttons, role=dialog on modal, role=status on toasts\n- Frontend: use Link component instead of bare anchor tags\n- Backend: fix CORS - moved out of dev-only block, now config-driven via AllowedOrigins in appsettings\n- Backend: add FleetSettings strongly-typed config, remove hardcoded reset defaults from BikeService\n- Backend: add /health endpoint via AddHealthChecks\n- Security: add .env to .gitignore to prevent committing local secrets","tree":{"sha":"3c3bebe3706e0378faad1bb1fd8b987928ddfe2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AnushkaMunde074/BikeRental/git/trees/3c3bebe3706e0378faad1bb1fd8b987928ddfe2e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AnushkaMunde074/BikeRental/git/commits/93286e46128173a1b786fbe66a0aae5ab6077c91","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/220711535?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AnushkaMunde431/events{/pri