AKGYzMzFmNDYxZDNhMWZhMmI1NDczMDg4MTcwYWJkZmU3YTIyYTVmYzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/23c41b98b41957f34190d77da3652343c6a83c12","sha":"23c41b98b41957f34190d77da3652343c6a83c12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/23c41b98b41957f34190d77da3652343c6a83c12"}],"sha":"f331f461d3a1fa2b5473088170abdfe7a22a5fc1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/f331f461d3a1fa2b5473088170abdfe7a22a5fc1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/23c41b98b41957f34190d77da3652343c6a83c12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T12:38:48Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T12:38:48Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"feat(08): add /clusters and /permit chat skills\n\nTwo more slash-command skills join /whatif and /help so the chat\npanel has a meaningful interactive surface for the demo.\n\nbackend/llm.py\n  - _stream_ollama_chat() — shared streaming helper extracted from\n    the whatif skill so /clusters and /permit don''t duplicate the\n    SSE-parsing loop.\n  - stream_clusters_skill(n, clusters, metrics) — emits a structured\n    prefix listing the top N confirmed trench-share clusters (sorted\n    by estimated_savings desc), then streams a Nemotron summary\n    grounded in the cluster JSON. Review-only same-street clusters\n    are surfaced as a tail note so judges see them without conflating\n    them with the savings claim.\n  - stream_permit_skill(raw_id, permit_opt, permit_naive, cluster,\n    conflicts) — emits a structured prefix for one permit (street,\n    work, dates, optimization status, cluster membership, top\n    conflict edges, schedule-shift detection vs naive), then streams\n    a Nemotron explanation.\n\nbackend/main.py\n  - /chat router now also handles /clusters [N] and /permit <id>.\n  - /permit accepts full IDs (road_resurfacing:1007), ''source #num''\n    display style, and bare numeric tails (1007 matches any permit\n    whose ID ends in :1007). Falls back to substring match.\n\nfrontend/src/components/ChatPanel.jsx\n  - Placeholder and empty-state hint list the four skills.\n\nNo new artifacts. No metrics changes. Pitch flow gains demo beats:\n  /clusters 3 → ''show me what the optimizer found''\n  /permit road_resurfacing:225 → ''drill into a specific decision''\n  /whatif Bridgman Ave → ''reason about a hypothetical''","tree":{"sha":"9519ce312190ea8d21bb27c8b132468d9c2a9bac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/9519ce312190ea8d21bb27c8b132468d9c2a9bac"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/23c41b98b41957f34190d77da3652343c6a83c12","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/23c41b98b41957f34190d77da3652343c6a83c12","node_id":"C_kwDOSsZngNoAKDIzYzQxYjk4YjQxOTU3ZjM0MTkwZDc3ZGEzNjUyMzQzYzZhODNjMTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/7721892c6e2cda5ddf5c51848682f19f5d55170d","sha":"7721892c6e2cda5ddf5c51848682f19f5d55170d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/7721892c6e2cda5ddf5c51848682f19f5d55170d"}],"sha":"23c41b98b41957f34190d77da3652343c6a83c12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/23c41b98b41957f34190d77da3652343c6a83c12"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/7721892c6e2cda5ddf5c51848682f19f5d55170d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T12:26:25Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T12:26:25Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"feat(08): chat skills — /whatif and /help slash commands\n\nTreat the chat as a single interaction surface with optional skills\nthe user invokes explicitly via slash commands. Cleaner pitch frame\nthan ''we also have a REST endpoint named whatif''.\n\nbackend/llm.py\n  - stream_help_skill() — emits a short skill manual as two SSE chunks\n  - stream_whatif_skill(street, ...) — first yields a structured\n    prefix (impact, affected permits, top conflicts), then streams a\n    Nemotron summary grounded in the what_if_by_street() result via\n    a focused system prompt. On Ollama failure the structured prefix\n    still lands; only the model commentary is skipped.\n\nbackend/main.py\n  - _sse_wrap() helper extracted to share framing between skills\n  - POST /chat routes /help and /whatif to the skill streams BEFORE\n    the normal RAG path. Bare /whatif (no street) returns usage.\n\nfrontend/src/components/ChatPanel.jsx\n  - Input placeholder and empty-state hint advertise the skills:\n    /help and /whatif <street>.\n\nNo frontend logic change: the chat just sees longer streams. The\n\\\"🔧 Skill: /whatif\\\" prefix in the response makes it visually\nobvious which path the chat took.\n\nDemo flow with this in place:\n  1. Click a canned button — generic RAG answer streams\n  2. Type \"/whatif Bridgman Ave\" — structured prefix flashes\n     in (impact + permits + conflicts), then Nemotron streams\n     a grounded 2-3 sentence interpretation\n  3. Gesture to the GX10 — ''all running locally on this box''","tree":{"sha":"eb14dec7dc7a8b8ed309cfde42ed959c8c79cce7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/eb14dec7dc7a8b8ed309cfde42ed959c8c79cce7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/7721892c6e2cda5ddf5c51848682f19f5d55170d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/7721892c6e2cda5ddf5c51848682f19f5d55170d","node_id":"C_kwDOSsZngNoAKDc3MjE4OTJjNmUyY2RhNWRkZjVjNTE4NDg2ODJmMTlmNWQ1NTE3MGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/057652870ad6af09000560abafec60bc23f6180d","sha":"057652870ad6af09000560abafec60bc23f6180d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/057652870ad6af09000560abafec60bc23f6180d"}],"sha":"7721892c6e2cda5ddf5c51848682f19f5d55170d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/7721892c6e2cda5ddf5c51848682f19f5d55170d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/057652870ad6af09000560abafec60bc23f6180d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T11:56:23Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T11:56:23Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"feat(08): render review-only clusters in blue, trench-share in amber\n\nTwo cluster tiers now have distinct colors on the map:\n\n- amber (#f59e0b) — confirmed trench-share opportunities (cluster.review_only is false: same_segment, same_street candidate merges, piggybacks). These are the clusters that contribute to the headline savings counter.\n- blue  (#3b82f6) — review-only anchor_program clusters (cluster.review_only is true). Same-street city road-program permits surfaced for the city to investigate; they don''t claim dollar or excavation credit, so the color difference makes that visible at a glance.\n\nConflict-deferred polygons stay red, singletons stay neutral grey,\nnaive view stays slate.","tree":{"sha":"1a9c23563bd08e0c8d736c372098c61e9321bffa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/1a9c23563bd08e0c8d736c372098c61e9321bffa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/057652870ad6af09000560abafec60bc23f6180d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/057652870ad6af09000560abafec60bc23f6180d","node_id":"C_kwDOSsZngNoAKDA1NzY1Mjg3MGFkNmFmMDkwMDA1NjBhYmFmZWM2MGJjMjNmNjE4MGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/6f8229edaeca4de68f8f7f128319252822a8924b","sha":"6f8229edaeca4de68f8f7f128319252822a8924b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/6f8229edaeca4de68f8f7f128319252822a8924b"}],"sha":"057652870ad6af09000560abafec60bc23f6180d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/057652870ad6af09000560abafec60bc23f6180d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/6f8229edaeca4de68f8f7f128319252822a8924b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T07:08:29Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T07:08:29Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"fix(08): anchor_program clusters are review-only, no $ or excavation credit\n\nThe previous commit (85726f6) introduced $1.11M in ''mobilization savings''\nfrom anchor_program clusters. Real-world inspection (BRIDGMAN AVE example:\n6 permits forming one continuous chain Kendal -> Bathurst) shows these\nclusters are often admin-split segments of a single coordinated city\nproject, NOT genuine consolidation opportunities. We can''t distinguish\n''true opportunity'' from ''already-coordinated admin split'' from CKAN data\nalone, so claiming dollar savings double-counts work the city already did.\n\nChanges:\n\nbackend/optimizer.py — cluster_anchor_program() now emits:\n  - estimated_savings: 0       (was: mobilizations_saved * $5K)\n  - lane_days_saved: 0         (already was)\n  - excavations_avoided: 0     (was: mobilizations_saved)\n  - review_only: true          (new flag)\n  - priority: ''Review''         (was: High/Medium)\n  - action/reason copy reframed as ''surface for review'' not ''savings''\n\nbackend/optimizer.py — build_metrics() now distinguishes:\n  - cluster_merges: confirmed trench-share count (was: all merges)\n  - coordination_opportunities: review-only cluster count (new)\n  - cost_avoidance: trench-share dollars only (was: trench + mob)\n  - removed per_mobilization_savings + mobilizations_saved fields\n\nfrontend — TriStatCounter unchanged in structure (3 equal cells per D-33).\nAdded a small sub-row beneath: ''+ N same-street clusters surfaced for\nthe city to review — possible coordination, not counted in savings above''.\nHidden in naive view (App.jsx sets coordination_opportunities: 0).\n\nArtifacts regenerated. Pitch story is now:\n  ''3 high-confidence coordination opportunities worth ~$210K,\n   plus 124 same-street clusters for the city to investigate.''\n\nDefensible to a judge who asks ''how do you know the city isn''t\nalready coordinating these?'' because: we don''t claim they aren''t.\nWe just surface the candidates.","tree":{"sha":"2275ed2f7bf77d5e686801776418612cfe4b5983","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/2275ed2f7bf77d5e686801776418612cfe4b5983"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/6f8229edaeca4de68f8f7f128319252822a8924b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/6f8229edaeca4de68f8f7f128319252822a8924b","node_id":"C_kwDOSsZngNoAKDZmODIyOWVkYWVjYTRkZTY4ZjhmN2YxMjgzMTkyNTI4MjJhODkyNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/85726f6f15aaaefb63240b46380bd60dc7feed7e","sha":"85726f6f15aaaefb63240b46380bd60dc7feed7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/85726f6f15aaaefb63240b46380bd60dc7feed7e"}],"sha":"6f8229edaeca4de68f8f7f128319252822a8924b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/6f8229edaeca4de68f8f7f128319252822a8924b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/85726f6f15aaaefb63240b46380bd60dc7feed7e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T06:45:46Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T06:45:46Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"feat(08): cluster anchor permits on the same street (fixes singleton-Bridgman bug)\n\nThe optimizer''s role split treated ''anchor'' permits (city road-program\nwork) as fixed windows that ''candidate'' permits piggyback onto. Anchors\nnever grouped with anchors — which meant 6 separate BRIDGMAN AVE road\njobs rendered as 6 singletons instead of one street program.\n\nThis commit adds cluster_anchor_program() — same Layer 2 (GEO_ID) /\nLayer 1 (normalized_street + temporal) logic as cluster_leftover_\ncandidates, but applied to the anchor side. Anchors already absorbed\nby a piggyback are skipped so we don''t double-claim a window.\n\nHonest savings math for the new tier:\n\n  - Trench-share clusters (merge / piggyback / same_segment of\n    candidates): unchanged — lane_days_saved × LANE_DAY_COST.\n  - Anchor-program clusters: lane_days_saved = 0 because the road\n    work itself still happens. Savings come from MOBILIZATION:\n    one crew dispatch we avoid per merged permit. Conservative\n    $5K/mobilization (low end of the $5K-25K range for municipal\n    road-crew mobilization). Env-tunable via PERMITFLOW_MOBILIZATION_\n    SAVINGS.\n\nmetrics.json gains two additive fields (Phase 4 contract preserved):\n  - per_mobilization_savings (int) — the $5K constant\n  - mobilizations_saved (int) — count of saved dispatches across\n    all anchor-program clusters\ncost_avoidance is now sum(rec.estimated_savings) so trench-share and\nmobilization contribute on their own honest scales rather than being\nconflated through a single $/lane-day multiplier.\n\nDemo numbers move on real semantic grounds:\n  before: 532 / 3 excavations / $210K\n  after:  532 / 225 excavations (222 mobilizations + 3 trench-share)\n         / $1.32M ($1.11M mobilization + $210K trench-share)\n\nBridgman is now a single 6-permit cluster (program:54). 124 anchor-\nprogram clusters + 2 same-street trench-share merges total.\n\nArtifacts regenerated and committed. Phase 4 TriStatCounter unchanged\n(reads the same field names from metrics.json — values just larger).","tree":{"sha":"412614b06d8194fa700ed16fcd2f71aab9d5bb0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/412614b06d8194fa700ed16fcd2f71aab9d5bb0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/85726f6f15aaaefb63240b46380bd60dc7feed7e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/85726f6f15aaaefb63240b46380bd60dc7feed7e","node_id":"C_kwDOSsZngNoAKDg1NzI2ZjZmMTVhYWFlZmI2MzI0MGI0NjM4MGJkNjBkYzdmZWVkN2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/ce6cfe437b88e63aa7a29127a7d155adb5b0a0ac","sha":"ce6cfe437b88e63aa7a29127a7d155adb5b0a0ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/ce6cfe437b88e63aa7a29127a7d155adb5b0a0ac"}],"sha":"85726f6f15aaaefb63240b46380bd60dc7feed7e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/85726f6f15aaaefb63240b46380bd60dc7feed7e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/ce6cfe437b88e63aa7a29127a7d155adb5b0a0ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T05:42:08Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T05:42:08Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"docs(08-01): complete street-based-clustering Layers 1+2 plan\n\n- Write 08-01-SUMMARY.md with demo-number delta (OLD=NEW=532/3/$210K — why\n  it''s still load-bearing), human-needed-verification checklist, atomic\n  commit table, and \"what was NOT done\" scope discipline list.\n- Mark Phase 8 as ✅ in ROADMAP.md (Layer 3 explicitly still deferred to v1.1).\n- Advance STATE.md: progress 50% → 55%; latest-decisions log gains D-83..D-87\n  (clustering algo, direction symmetry, empty-norm singleton, match_type\n  consistency, plain-function test runner); current-position flipped to\n  Phase 08 complete; session continuity records the 23-test-green green\n  smoke and the geocoding-gap blocker for future Layer-2 lift.","tree":{"sha":"fbb5df7e6677b3f3329684881cf22b3d604555a6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/fbb5df7e6677b3f3329684881cf22b3d604555a6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/ce6cfe437b88e63aa7a29127a7d155adb5b0a0ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/ce6cfe437b88e63aa7a29127a7d155adb5b0a0ac","node_id":"C_kwDOSsZngNoAKGNlNmNmZTQzN2I4OGU2M2FhN2EyOTEyN2E3ZDE1NWFkYjViMGEwYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/e8b9026ccc2f24de7fcd3480d3662185559ae463","sha":"e8b9026ccc2f24de7fcd3480d3662185559ae463","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/e8b9026ccc2f24de7fcd3480d3662185559ae463"}],"sha":"ce6cfe437b88e63aa7a29127a7d155adb5b0a0ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/ce6cfe437b88e63aa7a29127a7d155adb5b0a0ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/e8b9026ccc2f24de7fcd3480d3662185559ae463/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T05:39:05Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T05:39:05Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"feat(08-01): regenerate artifacts with match_type + document additive schema\n\n- Regenerated data/artifacts/* via build_phase3_artifacts(). Only clusters.json\n  (match_type added), naive.json + optimized.json (normalized_street/direction/\n  geo_id spread onto each permit), permits.geojson (same Phase-8 additive\n  fields on each feature''s properties) changed content; metrics.json,\n  hero-block.json, conflict-graph.json regenerated identically (no diff).\n- SCHEMAS.md: appended `## Phase 8 additions (additive, no removals)` section\n  documenting normalized_street / direction / geo_id permit fields,\n  the match_type field on clusters.json entries, and the\n  PERMITFLOW_STREET_WINDOW_DAYS env knob.\n- HeroMap.jsx: one-line additive subtitle in the cluster Popup —\n  `match: same street` shows under the chronology summary when cluster.match_type\n  is present. No palette, layout, or toggle change. npm run build still green\n  (65 modules, identical bundle shape).\n\nContract verified: every recommendation carries match_type ∈\n{same_segment, same_street, piggyback_segment}; all 7 Phase-4 metric keys\nintact; naive/optimized per-permit shape unchanged.","tree":{"sha":"f664d96373ce5b6ab03524c0b2543802660ae84e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/f664d96373ce5b6ab03524c0b2543802660ae84e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/e8b9026ccc2f24de7fcd3480d3662185559ae463","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://a