l95"},"message":"feat(08-01): rewrite cluster_leftover_candidates as GEO_ID + street + temporal\n\nLayer 2 (GEO_ID exact match) runs first; matched permits become ''same_segment''\nclusters when ≥2 land in the same temporal window. Singletons within a GEO_ID\nfall through to Layer 1.\n\nLayer 1 (normalized_street + temporal sub-bucketing) groups remaining\ncandidates by their normalized street name and chunks each group by a tunable\nSTREET_CLUSTER_WINDOW_DAYS (default 60d). Empty normalized_street is treated\nas singleton — never grouped under a junk ''unknown'' key.\n\nThe two false-positive / false-negative DBSCAN failure modes from CONTEXT are\nboth fixed: parallel streets no longer collapse, and same-street-far-apart\npermits now coordinate. dbscan_labels stays put for the legacy /permits\nendpoint and the cluster_permits DataFrame API.\n\nAdditive: every recommendation (merge AND piggyback) now carries a match_type\nfield in {''same_segment'',''same_street'',''piggyback_segment''} so downstream\nconsumers can render the basis for each cluster.\n\nNew backend/tests/test_clustering.py: 9 tests covering all branches + the\nschema-compliance shape contract. Full suite (street_norm + loaders +\nclustering) is 23/23 green.\n\nSmoke: build_phase3_artifacts() runs to completion with 2 same_street merges,\nall 7 Phase-4 metric field names intact.","tree":{"sha":"62ab974d2cf3d3084604053c57e5c3be885f8655","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/62ab974d2cf3d3084604053c57e5c3be885f8655"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/7fbcafedc67db1781369edd34c4f802a42788953","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.gith