.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/d87ab115cb1432fd3365bb7cba89b8b55b784462/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T05:15:32Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T05:15:32Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"docs(08-street-based-clustering): create plan for GEO_ID + same-street clustering (Layers 1+2)\n\nReplaces the radius-DBSCAN leftover-clustering pass in optimizer.py with\nGEO_ID exact-match (Layer 2) followed by normalized-street + temporal\ngrouping (Layer 1). Layer 3 (intersection coordination + new UI color)\ndeferred to follow-up. Plan covers street_norm.py module, additive\ngeo_id/normalized_street/match_type fields, artifact regeneration,\nSCHEMAS.md additive section, and optional one-line popup subtitle.\nPreserves /clusters and /metrics contracts so Phase 4 stays green.","tree":{"sha":"93bb578a9dceb3ed089a4db76e62b18df44ba3c7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/93bb578a9dceb3ed089a4db76e62b18df44ba3c7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/d87ab115cb1432fd3365bb7cba89b8b55b784462","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://