ml_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/bdd8e2eb09f43068622297ff3c31270889918a07/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T02:06:18Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T02:06:18Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"docs(07): contingency cards + dry-run checklist\n\nTwo print-ready artifacts for Phase 7 (the manual rehearsal phase):\n\n1. CONTINGENCY-CARDS.md — 6 cards per D-73, formatted to cut and\n   tape to the back of the laptop. Each card has symptom, action,\n   what NOT to do. Includes the 3 switch-line variants from D-66.\n\n2. DRY-RUN-CHECKLIST.md — the D-70/D-71/D-72 cadence with\n   checkboxes: T-0 setup, Run 1/2/3 timing, WiFi-off test, video\n   recording, final checks. Plus a NOT-to-do list (D-74 enforcement)\n   and the 5-second trip-wire criteria (D-65).\n\nNo code changes. Phase 7 is rehearsal + recording — these docs are\nthe supporting punchlist. No further code commits expected per D-74\n(hour-35 hard stop on commits).","tree":{"sha":"e2a27bc15996ffd5385e099360b8a60f4ff83175","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/e2a27bc15996ffd5385e099360b8a60f4ff83175"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/bdd8e2eb09f43068622297ff3c31270889918a07","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,