","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/8ab2e5816086c7c22f1ede6b1a5691c409db9d32/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T02:00:25Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T02:00:25Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"feat(06-01): fix counter retween + polish tri-stat typography\n\n- App.jsx: derive naiveMetrics (zero savings) and displayMetrics from view;\n  pass displayMetrics to TriStatCounter so toggling Naive<->Optimized hands\n  useCountUp a new target and the numbers visibly tween (G6-COUNTER, D-33/D-34).\n- App.css .tristat-value: bump font-size 32px -> 44px, letter-spacing\n  -0.5px -> -1.5px (G6-TYPOGRAPHY, D-55).\n- App.css .tristat-label: brighter color (#9ca3af -> #cbd5e1), 12px,\n  margin-top 8px for breathing room.\n- App.css .tristat-cell: padding 16px -> 22px to scale with the larger numbers.\n- useCountUp hook unchanged: already deps on [target, durationMs] so it\n  retargets correctly on prop change.","tree":{"sha":"0bbe6bc81b0d2fae3b85f78333ec60642ab04589","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/0bbe6bc81b0d2fae3b85f78333ec60642ab04589"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/8ab2e5816086c7c22f1ede6b1a5691c409db9d32","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url"