ser","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/2e10d83d7b569ba56bb39b8e6d83b9a0740188ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T01:41:21Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T01:41:21Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"feat(04-02): collapse clusters into one amber circle with a chronology popup\n\nPreviously, an N-permit cluster rendered as N overlapping amber polygons —\nunreadable, and the click target was ''whichever ended up on top.'' Now the\noptimized view renders each multi-member cluster as a SINGLE amber circle\nat the cluster''s centroid, sized to contain its members. The cluster''s\nindividual permit polygons are suppressed so there''s exactly one shape\nper coordination decision.\n\nCluster popup includes:\n- cluster type (merge | piggyback), id, member count, full window\n- estimated lane-day savings vs running members independently\n- a numbered chronology of members sorted by start_date, each with\n  start→end, permit id, street name, work type\n- the optimizer''s recommended action\n\nSingle-permit \"clusters\", singletons, conflict_deferred, and naive-view\npermits still render as individual polygons (unchanged behavior).","tree":{"sha":"3c3cde2ff9b5cc60a1b411845403d23b8c1bff03","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/3c3cde2ff9b5cc60a1b411845403d23b8c1bff03"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/2e10d83d7b569ba56bb39b8e6d83b9a0740188ad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/2e10d83d7b569ba56bb39b8e6d83b9a0740188ad","node_id":"C_kwDOSsZngNoAKDJlMTBkODNkN2I1NjliYTU2YmIzOWI4ZTZkODNiOWEwNzQwMTg4YWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/2d4ac201bd8994d5954e83461d88ceda1df20c73","sha":"2d4ac201bd8994d5954e83461d88ceda1df20c73","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/2d4ac201bd8994d5954e83461d88ceda1df20c73"}],"sha":"2e10d83d7b569ba56bb39b8e6d83b9a0740188ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/2e10d83d7b569ba56bb39b8e6d83b9a0740188ad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/2d4ac201bd8994d5954e83461d88ceda1df20c73/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T01:36:22Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T01:36:22Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"feat(04-02): popup now explains the optimizer''s decision per permit\n\nLoads /clusters, /conflict-graph, and /naive once on mount and joins\nthem to the rendered permit by id, so each polygon''s popup can show\nwhy it has the status it has:\n\n- coordinated: lists up to 4 cluster partners by id, shows the\n  cluster type (merge|piggyback) and the estimated lane-day savings\n- conflict_deferred: shows the +N days push (computed against the\n  naive twin''s start_date) and the top-3 permits it conflicts with,\n  with shared streets and the proxy conflict score\n- singleton / naive: short reason text so the user isn''t left\n  guessing why no decoration is shown","tree":{"sha":"439a0c3df2efe5b4e1e8b21c6234dda8377e13df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/439a0c3df2efe5b4e1e8b21c6234dda8377e13df"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/2d4ac201bd8994d5954e83461d88ceda1df20c73","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","