epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T00:41:50Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"feat(04-01): add SSE chat streaming, NIM embedder, and RAG helpers to llm.py\n\n- embed_query(): NIM nv-embedqa-e5-v5 client with graceful None on failure\n- cosine_sim(): pure-Python cosine similarity\n- retrieve_permits(): top-k RAG with embedder primary + keyword fallback,\n  module-level embedding cache, >200-permit escape hatch\n- lookup_conflict_edges(): conflict-graph street-name intersection (cap 10)\n- extract_street_mentions(): substring match of permit streets in query\n- build_chat_messages(): system prompt + grounded context block (cap ~3000 chars)\n- stream_chat(): Ollama nemotron-3-super SSE pass-through with offline fallback\n- CANNED_SCENARIOS list for /chat/scenarios endpoint\n- Preserves existing build_cluster_prompt and ask_local_llm signatures","tree":{"sha":"05f2b1dda45242edababe21adbc60003934bfc3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/05f2b1dda45242edababe21adbc60003934bfc3a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/cfe84a5aa560d6ba3982586cba693cc42355de6b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin"