 (offline demo) not Valhalla\n- $15K/lane placeholder per D-26 → swap for TCMP figure in Phase 6\n\nNext phase: Phase 4 — UI & Chat Panel — wire App.jsx to consume the\n6 new Phase 3 endpoints (/hero-block, /clusters, /conflict-graph,\n/naive, /optimized, /whatif-street).","tree":{"sha":"df560f4bfbf952325c4754b333f3f28e7c08b332","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/df560f4bfbf952325c4754b333f3f28e7c08b332"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/1244bcfb879437c3e06e4331b8d250a8a2ef9ee9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/1244bcfb879437c3e06e4331b8d250a8a2ef9ee9","node_id":"C_kwDOSsZngNoAKDEyNDRiY2ZiODc5NDM3YzNlMDZlNDMzMWI4ZDI1MGE4YTJlZjllZTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/27ac93ba52051f7d89bf02f861aed0d8843ae41a","sha":"27ac93ba52051f7d89bf02f861aed0d8843ae41a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/27ac93ba52051f7d89bf02f861aed0d8843ae41a"}],"sha":"1244bcfb879437c3e06e4331b8d250a8a2ef9ee9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/1244bcfb879437c3e06e4331b8d250a8a2ef9ee9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/27ac93ba52051f7d89bf02f861aed0d8843ae41a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-31T00:23:20Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-31T00:23:20Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"feat(03): wire Phase 4 endpoints + ship optimizer artifacts + SCHEMAS contract\n\nBuilds on hanjing06''s c6100d0 (merged from origin/phase3) which delivered\nthe optimizer engine (anchor↔candidate piggyback matching, leftover\nDBSCAN clustering, conflict-aware greedy scheduler, two-metric counter).\n\nThis commit adds the remaining Phase 3 work:\n\n1. Six new GET endpoints in backend/main.py that serve the artifacts\n   Phase 4 needs: /hero-block, /clusters, /conflict-graph, /naive,\n   /optimized, /whatif-street. Legacy /whatif?cluster_id retained.\n2. data/artifacts/ — all 7 optimizer outputs built against the\n   Phase 1 Greektown hero-block (532 permits in scope, 2 cluster\n   merges, 14 lane-days saved, $210K cost avoidance at the $15K/lane\n   placeholder rate). Committed so the demo doesn''t lazy-build on\n   first hit.\n3. .planning/phases/03-optimizer-build/SCHEMAS.md — locks the JSON\n   contract for Phase 4 with per-field documentation and the known\n   limitations (utility_cuts geometry gap → 0 piggybacks; conflict\n   graph is space-time proxy not Valhalla).\n4. .gitignore — keep reproducible CKAN CSVs out of git, ship the\n   small JSON artifacts.\n\nAlso fixes a hero-block-source bug: optimizer.build_phase3_artifacts()\nwas generating its own hero-block from raw permit centroids (picked\nASCOT AVE) instead of honoring Phase 1''s locked Greektown choice.\ndata/artifacts/hero-block.json now mirrors the Phase 1 file at\n.planning/phases/01-parallel-kickoff/hero-block.json with the\noptimizer-expected bbox array shape.","tree":{"sha":"3876c34142edda5db84224289c06f5628a87c132","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/3876c34142edda5db84224289c06f5628a87c132"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/27ac93ba52051f7d89bf02f861aed0d8843ae41a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com