he Plan 01-01 CKAN snapshot\n(road_resurfacing 1478 + sidewalk_construction 99 + road_reconstruction\n325 = 1902 geometry-bearing rows in DuckDB).\n\nWinning segment (2023-2025 window, no widening needed):\n  bucket=(48625,-63798) — center (43.6657, -79.3642), 5 events\n  bbox: W -79.3704  S 43.6612  E -79.3579  N 43.6702 (~1 km^2)\n  per-source in bbox over window: road_reconstruction=17, road_resurfacing=2\n  permits.geojson: 19 features (all years, intersecting bbox)\n  bonus address-overlap: utility_cuts=16882, building_permits_filtered=1280\n\nReplaces the hand-picked Kensington-Harbord placeholder bbox and the\nhand-authored 17-permit fixture FeatureCollection. Closes G1 criterion 4.","tree":{"sha":"c792cc6ed6558282c77859ae733e2dce151c8d2d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/c792cc6ed6558282c77859ae733e2dce151c8d2d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/e06d5088371576757ed789dd4a7cea2380067f3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type