ts (road_resurfacing,\n  sidewalk_construction, road_reconstruction) into DuckDB via the\n  spatial extension and parses GeoJSON LineStrings.\n- Ranks ~100m equirectangular grid cells by disruption event count\n  in 2023-2025 (D-08); widens to 2020-2025 if top cell has <5 events\n  (D-09). Deterministic tie-break by lat_bucket / lon_bucket.\n- Records the D-07 site-disturbance building-permit filter into the\n  output JSON for auditability; surfaces an address-overlap bonus\n  count for utility_cuts + filtered building_permits in the bbox\n  (the candidate CSVs ship without inline geometry per 01-01 SUMMARY).\n- Writes hero-block.json + permits.geojson (FeatureCollection) into\n  .planning/phases/01-parallel-kickoff/. --dry-run mode prints the\n  top-5 candidates and writes nothing.","tree":{"sha":"cf43a15444bd35aee60cb768d4e7f61546084a1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/cf43a15444bd35aee60cb768d4e7f61546084a1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/0bd0363ead85adfcfc8e4ea77ac62a66ff0759c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sh