itech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"docs(01): plan Phase 1 gap closure — data ingestion + hero block selection\n\nTwo-plan gap-closure pass for Phase 1. HEALTHCHECK shows the heavy\nPhase 1 infra (Ollama, Valhalla, NIM embedder, UI, nix runners) is\nalready standing; only G1 criterion 4 (hero-block.json) and its CKAN\ndata prerequisite remain.\n\n- 01-01: pull the remaining 6 CKAN datasets via the existing\n  backend/open_toronto.py downloader (wave 1, autonomous)\n- 01-02: write scripts/pick_hero_block.py, regenerate\n  hero-block.json and permits.geojson against real data (wave 2,\n  autonomous, depends on 01-01)\n\nHonours D-07 (combined utility-cut + filtered building permits),\nD-08 (top 100m segment 2023-25, 1 km² enclosure), D-09 (widen to\n2020-25 fallback), D-79 (tiered anchors/candidates split).","tree":{"sha":"ec2e123d5b7478081e07c960310939a4e0cf61d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/ec2e123d5b7478081e07c960310939a4e0cf61d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/154a97fd1ee35a667c06d04bbfb8205251b9a115","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https