shmul95"},"message":"planning: sync docs to reality (Ollama/Valhalla swaps, fine-tune dropped)\n\nUpdate PROJECT.md, ROADMAP.md, STATE.md, and every phase CONTEXT to\nreflect mid-execution decisions D-75 (OSRM→Valhalla), D-76 (NIM→Ollama\nnemotron-3-super 123B), D-77 (Phase 2 closed — no LoRA), D-78 (Phase 5\nreduced to verification + screenshots), D-79 (optimizer pivots to\ntrench-sharing anchor+piggyback). Each phase CONTEXT gets a top-of-file\nreality-check banner; bodies preserved as historical record.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b22c8ac63129bfd10192401c06bfdf16aef1dfaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/b22c8ac63129bfd10192401c06bfdf16aef1dfaa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/b5a3ce48c7a8baa3d9a248ba067c73379f3fa60f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/b5a3ce48c7a8baa3d9a248ba067c73379f3fa60f","node_id":"C_kw