//api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/f3544d24a1219176c475b767cf6b36cb2056dd67/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:33:48Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:33:48Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"flake: simplify to two modes — local (default) and deploy-tunnel\n\n  nix run                  → run backend+frontend on THIS box, assumes\n                             Ollama is reachable at localhost:11434\n                             (i.e. you are on the GX10 itself)\n  nix run .#deploy-tunnel  → laptop mode: backend+frontend run here,\n                             Ollama is brought to localhost via SSH\n                             tunnel to gx10-4896\n\nDrops the previous .#dev (now .#deploy-tunnel) and .#gx10 (SSH wrapper,\nreplaced by sshing manually and running `nix run` on the GX10 — or\n`bash scripts/gx10-up.sh` if Nix isn''t installed there).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f3570b9102f064915f1f9003e22172d14ec9eafa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/f3570b9102f064915f1f9003e22172d14ec9eafa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/f3544d24a1219176c475b767cf6b36cb2056dd67","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/f3544d24a1219176c475b767cf6b36cb2056dd67","node_id":"C_kwDOSsZngNoAKGYzNTQ0ZDI0YTEyMTkxNzZjNDc1Yjc2N2NmNmIzNmNiMjA1NmRkNjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/378c7ec92ea0f350024029afde1498a42a7fe8ac","sha":"378c7ec92ea0f350024029afde1498a42a7fe8ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/378c7ec92ea0f350024029afde1498a42a7fe8ac"}],"sha":"f3544d24a1219176c475b767cf6b36cb2056dd67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/f3544d24a1219176c475b767cf6b36cb2056dd67"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/378c7ec92ea0f350024029afde1498a42a7fe8ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:30:02Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:30:02Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"gx10: drop rsync; run whatever''s currently on the box\n\nnix run .#gx10 now just SSHes and starts the stack using whatever\nversion of the repo lives at ~/permitflow/code on the GX10. Updating\nis a manual git pull over SSH when you''re iterating — keeps the\nruntime path production-shaped and never silently mutates files\nunder someone else''s nose.\n\nOne-time setup on the GX10:\n  git clone <repo> ~/permitflow/code\n\nIteration:\n  ssh gx10-4896 ''cd ~/permitflow/code && git pull''\n\nRun:\n  nix run .#gx10\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"82f844d3d166e3762673cbb6d81bf33c09b6e1a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/82f844d3d166e3762673cbb6d81bf33c09b6e1a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/378c7ec92ea0f350024029afde1498a42a7fe8ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/378c7ec92ea0f350024029afde1498a42a7fe8ac","node_id":"C_kwDOSsZngNoAKDM3OGM3ZWM5MmVhMGYzNTAwMjQwMjlhZmRlMTQ5OGE0MmE3ZmU4YWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/98e9c3cf79ae3c7b8105019a1866292cfa2980f9","sha":"98e9c3cf79ae3c7b8105019a1866292cfa2980f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/98e9c3cf79ae3c7b8105019a1866292cfa2980f9"}],"sha":"378c7ec92ea0f350024029afde1498a42a7fe8ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/378c7ec92ea0f350024029afde1498a42a7fe8ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/98e9c3cf79ae3c7b8105019a1866292cfa2980f9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:27:07Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:27:07Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"gx10: nix run .#gx10 — full stack on the box, laptop is just a browser\n\nAdds:\n  scripts/gx10-up.sh    — backend + frontend started ON the GX10,\n                          both bound 0.0.0.0, VITE_API_URL pointing at\n                          gx10-4896:8000. Ollama is already local.\n  flake.nix apps.gx10   — rsyncs the repo to GX10:~/permitflow/code\n                          then ssh -tt''s into the start script.\n  frontend/src/App.jsx  — replaces hardcoded Tailnet IP with\n                          import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL with a\n                          localhost:8000 default for laptop dev.\n\nUsage:\n  nix run .#gx10                 # everything on gx10-4896\n  PERMITFLOW_GX10=other nix run .#gx10\n  open http://gx10-4896:5173 in your browser\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2832e7093ced043d3245c31468822a9b563e45c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/2832e7093ced043d3245c31468822a9b563e45c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/98e9c3cf79ae3c7b8105019a1866292cfa2980f9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/98e9c3cf79ae3c7b8105019a1866292cfa2980f9","node_id":"C_kwDOSsZngNoAKDk4ZTljM2NmNzlhZTNjN2I4MTA1MDE5YTE4NjYyOTJjZmEyOTgwZjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/2238f6be0a90a6f6a3d87b938be11362c2cb4477","sha":"2238f6be0a90a6f6a3d87b938be11362c2cb4477","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/2238f6be0a90a6f6a3d87b938be11362c2cb4477"}],"sha":"98e9c3cf79ae3c7b8105019a1866292cfa2980f9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/98e9c3cf79ae3c7b8105019a1866292cfa2980f9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/commits/2238f6be0a90a6f6a3d87b938be11362c2cb4477/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:23:15Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T21:23:15Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"flake: add apps.dev (=apps.default) — backend + frontend + tunnel\n\nSingle command for the whole local stack:\n\n  nix run              # = nix run .#dev\n\nBrings up Ollama SSH tunnel to gx10-4896 (idempotent — skipped if :11434\nis already bound), backend on :8000, frontend on :5173. Hostname override\nvia PERMITFLOW_GX10 env var. Ctrl-C tears all three down via trap.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"526b6f7240048974d115c69f413aa3fe76a2a89e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/526b6f7240048974d115c69f413aa3fe76a2a89e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/2238f6be0a90a6f6a3d87b938be11362c2cb4477","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/2238f6be0a90a6f6a3d87b938be11362c2cb4477","node_id":"C_kwDOSsZngNoAKDIyMzhmNmJlMGE5MGE2ZjZhM2Q4N2I5MzhiZTExMzYyYzJjYjQ0Nzc","parents":[{"