e60d2e990fcf9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-30T20:26:13Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-30T20:26:13Z","email":"samuel.gross@epitech.eu","name":"shmul95"},"message":"ingest: multi-dataset anchor + candidate downloader (D-79)\n\nPer D-79 trench-sharing reframe, the optimizer needs two tiers:\n  Anchors (planned city openings — fixed-date windows):\n    road-reconstruction-program, road-resurfacing-program,\n    sidewalk-construction-program\n  Candidates (flexible utility work — pieces to piggyback in):\n    utility-cut-permits, building-permits-active\n  Context overlays:\n    watermain-breaks, road-restrictions\n\nCLI: python open_toronto.py [all|anchors|utility|context]\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7bb43e5940bdd02a9c898d8c6d42b7678115c0e4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/7bb43e5940bdd02a9c898d8c6d42b7678115c0e4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/08125e823760409d1dfa5139e3fe60d2e990fcf9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"h