e":"shmul95"},"message":"llm: point at Ollama nemotron-3-super (D-76)\n\nOriginal target NIM :8001 with model \"nemotron\" is broken on the GX10''s\nGrace Blackwell (NIM nano image is amd64 inside an arm64 manifest; NIM\nsuper 49b has no GB10 profile). Switch to Ollama on :11434 serving\nnemotron-3-super:latest (123B Q4 already resident on the box).\n\nEnv vars OLLAMA_URL and OLLAMA_MODEL let the team override without code\nchanges. max_tokens raised to 800 because nemotron-3 is a reasoning\nmodel — chain-of-thought eats tokens before content lands.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26d0705bab63ebde1f784e4f8f0ba2102a0e491a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/trees/26d0705bab63ebde1f784e4f8f0ba2102a0e491a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/hanjing06/permitflow/git/commits/2d13f06af40e06e244006a5f473a7b3ec865c039","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146193617?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/shmul95","id":146193617,"login":"shmul95","node_id":"U_kgDOCLa80Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shmul95","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/hanjing06/permitflow/commit/2d13f06af40e0